(770987, 84828, 10268, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, and the contrast is excelleing.  It would be a great image without the desaturation.  I just don''t think it works keeping the colors in only on the tractor.<br/> <br/>I just want to say though, if the whole photo was black and white, this would be completely awesome.  6.</td>', 'I like the composition, and the contrast is excelleing.  It would be a great image without the desaturation.  I just don''t think it works keeping the colors in only on the tractor. I just want to say though, if the whole photo was black and white, this would be completely awesome.  6.', '2004-06-21 05:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(770988, 84560, 10268, '<td valign="top">I don''t think this one works for this challenge.  The way it looks, all the flowers are the same color, so it doesn''t seem to me that there is a need for the desatration.  An di''m not sure about the bud either.<br/> <br/>It''s a nice photo, I just don''t think it needs to be desaturated.  5.</td>', 'I don''t think this one works for this challenge.  The way it looks, all the flowers are the same color, so it doesn''t seem to me that there is a need for the desatration.  An di''m not sure about the bud either. It''s a nice photo, I just don''t think it needs to be desaturated.  5.', '2004-06-21 05:34:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(770989, 84783, 10268, '<td valign="top">This is awesome.  The only think I would have preferred, I think is to have the sky desaturation too, so the horse really pops out.  <br/> <br/>Excellent vibrabt colors, and great focus. 8.</td>', 'This is awesome.  The only think I would have preferred, I think is to have the sky desaturation too, so the horse really pops out.   Excellent vibrabt colors, and great focus. 8.', '2004-06-21 05:36:07.000000', NULL, 1),
