(771213, 84648, 9295, '<td valign="top">Excellent! I love your moment of capture--the look on his face is priceless!  Good use of selective desaturation, nice composition. I can''t vote but I thought you''d like to know how much I liked this. Good luck!</td>', 'Excellent! I love your moment of capture--the look on his face is priceless!  Good use of selective desaturation, nice composition. I can''t vote but I thought you''d like to know how much I liked this. Good luck!', '2004-06-21 09:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(771216, 84840, 9295, '<td valign="top">This is a great image. I love it. Not only is your use of selective desaturation appropriate, it''s almost necessary for this shot to be as strong as it is. I love the texture of the rocks and the clouds. Good luck.</td>', 'This is a great image. I love it. Not only is your use of selective desaturation appropriate, it''s almost necessary for this shot to be as strong as it is. I love the texture of the rocks and the clouds. Good luck.', '2004-06-21 09:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(771217, 84886, 9295, '<td valign="top">This is too funny! I love it!!  You''re title is hysterical. I wish I could vote just so I could give you a 10 for making me giggle so early on a Monday morning.  Thanks.</td>', 'This is too funny! I love it!!  You''re title is hysterical. I wish I could vote just so I could give you a 10 for making me giggle so early on a Monday morning.  Thanks.', '2004-06-21 09:39:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(771223, 84283, 9295, '<td valign="top">Priceless. I don''t know how else to say it. For my money, this is the perfect capture and my top pick of the challenge. Unfortunately, I can''t help with a vote, but if I could, 10 all the way. Great job.</td>', 'Priceless. I don''t know how else to say it. For my money, this is the perfect capture and my top pick of the challenge. Unfortunately, I can''t help with a vote, but if I could, 10 all the way. Great job.', '2004-06-21 09:45:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(771224, 84891, 9295, '<td valign="top">One of the few "eye" shots I actually kinda like. Different. Interesting.</td>', 'One of the few "eye" shots I actually kinda like. Different. Interesting.', '2004-06-21 09:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(771228, 84770, 16004, '<td valign="top">well, obviously the view you have chosen is gorgeous - and what is almost a standard tourist type shot has been enhanced a wonderfully exciting sky.  my only negatives that come to mind is that sadly the cathedral is a TINY bit off centre, which kind of unbalances the otherwise perfect symmetry, and i''m in two minds about whether or not desat really improves an image of this type.  in my limited understanding of photography, i was kind of led to believe that selective desat is supposed to draw your eyes to one particular element.  you''ve stuck with colour to people, which IS a sungular element, but they''re all over the place and i find my eyes to-ing and fro-ing trying to take them all in.    this is still a very dramatic picture, and in terms of quality and technical merit i would give an 8.  however, i personally don''t think this is enhanced by the selective desat, so i feel compelled to offer only a 6.</td>', 'well, obviously the view you have chosen is gorgeous - and what is almost a standard tourist type shot has been enhanced a wonderfully exciting sky.  my only negatives that come to mind is that sadly the cathedral is a TINY bit off centre, which kind of unbalances the otherwise perfect symmetry, and i''m in two minds about whether or not desat really improves an image of this type.  in my limited understanding of photography, i was kind of led to believe that selective desat is supposed to draw your eyes to one particular element.  you''ve stuck with colour to people, which IS a sungular element, but they''re all over the place and i find my eyes to-ing and fro-ing trying to take them all in.    this is still a very dramatic picture, and in terms of quality and technical merit i would give an 8.  however, i personally don''t think this is enhanced by the selective desat, so i feel compelled to offer only a 6.', '2004-06-21 09:54:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(771229, 84057, 9295, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting flower and nice composition, but what does the selective desaturation do to enhance it? Is the shot better for it? Here''s my thinking, if only one blossom was opened and that one blossom was colored, then it would make the selective desat important to the shot, making that blossom POP.  I think as it is, with several blooms open, had you only colored the open ones and not the closed one (leaving the mostly closed ones maybe a very pale shade of blue), it would be a tad more effective. Just a observation since I can''t vote and your score is not affected. Nice background and I like the sepia.</td>', 'This is an interesting flower and nice composition, but what does the selective desaturation do to enhance it? Is the shot better for it? Here''s my thinking, if only one blossom was opened and that one blossom was colored, then it would make the selective desat important to the shot, making that blossom POP.  I think as it is, with several blooms open, had you only colored the open ones and not the closed one (leaving the mostly closed ones maybe a very pale shade of blue), it would be a tad more effective. Just a observation since I can''t vote and your score is not affected. Nice background and I like the sepia.', '2004-06-21 09:55:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(771231, 84662, 9295, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image! I love how you can see right up into the balloon to see so much of the flame. Great focus and composition and perfect use of selective desaturation. Good luck in the challenge. You should do well.</td>', 'Beautiful image! I love how you can see right up into the balloon to see so much of the flame. Great focus and composition and perfect use of selective desaturation. Good luck in the challenge. You should do well.', '2004-06-21 10:00:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(771234, 84871, 9295, '<td valign="top">This is reminisent of the photography of the early days of cinema..20s and 30s maybe.  Your model has a great look and the apple is a fun touch of color. I like this a lot.</td>', 'This is reminisent of the photography of the early days of cinema..20s and 30s maybe.  Your model has a great look and the apple is a fun touch of color. I like this a lot.', '2004-06-21 10:03:20.000000', NULL, 1),
