(771251, 84542, 16004, '<td valign="top">This is great!  i love the centred composition of the fish (nemo?), and it really stands out beautfully from the blurred background.  THIS is what selective desat is for, and it''s been used to wonderful effect.  only thing i would add that isn''t praise, is that it looks like it''s hanging in air, not water.  don''t know what it is, but it''s almost TOO perfect...  maybe the lighting is a little flat?  dunno, i still love it to bits.  9.</td>', 'This is great!  i love the centred composition of the fish (nemo?), and it really stands out beautfully from the blurred background.  THIS is what selective desat is for, and it''s been used to wonderful effect.  only thing i would add that isn''t praise, is that it looks like it''s hanging in air, not water.  don''t know what it is, but it''s almost TOO perfect...  maybe the lighting is a little flat?  dunno, i still love it to bits.  9.', '2004-06-21 10:32:24.000000', NULL, 1),
