(771864, 84296, 18748, '<td valign="top">Very artistic and creative!  Like it a lot.</td>', 'Very artistic and creative!  Like it a lot.', '2004-06-21 17:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(771867, 84922, 22392, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favs. The desaturation defenitily adds something to the picture.</td>', 'This is one of my favs. The desaturation defenitily adds something to the picture.', '2004-06-21 17:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(771869, 84556, 22392, '<td valign="top">great idea. Wish i''d thought of it myself... 9</td>', 'great idea. Wish i''d thought of it myself... 9', '2004-06-21 17:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(771872, 84783, 16126, '<td valign="top">Great capture! Would have liked to see the sky desaturated also, gives even more focus to the horse. 7</td>', 'Great capture! Would have liked to see the sky desaturated also, gives even more focus to the horse. 7', '2004-06-21 17:19:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(771873, 84752, 22392, '<td valign="top">maybe because i''ve a daughter that age, but i really LOVE this one.... the highlight really makes the picture stronger. And the look of amazement is so recocnizable! (hope i spelled that right, i''m sure i didn''t)</td>', 'maybe because i''ve a daughter that age, but i really LOVE this one.... the highlight really makes the picture stronger. And the look of amazement is so recocnizable! (hope i spelled that right, i''m sure i didn''t)', '2004-06-21 17:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(771880, 84848, 22392, '<td valign="top">Nice! Perhaps influenced because I''m Dutch and orange is our national color, but I love it.</td>', 'Nice! Perhaps influenced because I''m Dutch and orange is our national color, but I love it.', '2004-06-21 17:21:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(771884, 84851, 22392, '<td valign="top">beautiful picture, but the eye-color seems fake. I gave it 8 now, I think totally in color or B/W it would be a 9 or 10.</td>', 'beautiful picture, but the eye-color seems fake. I gave it 8 now, I think totally in color or B/W it would be a 9 or 10.', '2004-06-21 17:23:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(771897, 84830, 16829, '<td valign="top">As with a lot of the "eyes" in this contest, I think the intensity here detracts from the photo. A much subtler use of color would be better. Otherwise, as a casual portrait, its excellent.</td>', 'As with a lot of the "eyes" in this contest, I think the intensity here detracts from the photo. A much subtler use of color would be better. Otherwise, as a casual portrait, its excellent.', '2004-06-21 17:29:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(771907, 84930, 16829, '<td valign="top">Love the idea. Execution is very good, but the flare on one side is distracting, and I''d prefer a little more detail contrast in the B&amp;W area.</td>', 'Love the idea. Execution is very good, but the flare on one side is distracting, and I''d prefer a little more detail contrast in the B&W area.', '2004-06-21 17:32:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(771930, 84926, 12573, '<td valign="top">Wow.  If only I could vote.  The only thing I think could improve this shot is to have more elements in your lens'' aperature, so the octagonal light points weren''t so prominent.  Even still, I would give this a 10 if I could.  Congrats!  Top 10 for sure.</td>', 'Wow.  If only I could vote.  The only thing I think could improve this shot is to have more elements in your lens'' aperature, so the octagonal light points weren''t so prominent.  Even still, I would give this a 10 if I could.  Congrats!  Top 10 for sure.', '2004-06-21 17:40:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(771934, 84065, 16829, '<td valign="top">Fantastic composition. I love the way the striation of the clouds compliments the  movement of the eye back to the vanishing point.</td>', 'Fantastic composition. I love the way the striation of the clouds compliments the  movement of the eye back to the vanishing point.', '2004-06-21 17:41:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(771937, 84741, 12573, '<td valign="top">Phenomenal composition.  I love the curves and the way the red pops out without being too overpowering in the image.</td>', 'Phenomenal composition.  I love the curves and the way the red pops out without being too overpowering in the image.', '2004-06-21 17:42:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(771942, 84866, 22781, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen something very similar</td>', 'I''ve seen something very similar', '2004-06-21 17:43:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(771945, 84896, 18349, '<td valign="top">The desat technique itself is done well, but I think that in this particular setting it isn''t working for me.  It appears that you used some kind of color overlay, which really gives the car an unnatural appearance in a natural setting.   I don''t have a problem with the power lines or towers, and it might have helped to have used the power theme to your advantage with a different title, or maybe red instead of blue...of course, these are just my opinions.  Good luck! :o)</td>', 'The desat technique itself is done well, but I think that in this particular setting it isn''t working for me.  It appears that you used some kind of color overlay, which really gives the car an unnatural appearance in a natural setting.   I don''t have a problem with the power lines or towers, and it might have helped to have used the power theme to your advantage with a different title, or maybe red instead of blue...of course, these are just my opinions.  Good luck! :o)', '2004-06-21 17:44:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(771948, 84606, 18349, '<td valign="top">Excellent desat technique used; very vivid color.  Unfortunately it''s just not a very appealing or appetizing subject, which might inadvertently hurt your score.</td>', 'Excellent desat technique used; very vivid color.  Unfortunately it''s just not a very appealing or appetizing subject, which might inadvertently hurt your score.', '2004-06-21 17:45:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(771952, 84795, 18349, '<td valign="top">Good desat; unfortunately the subject is just a little flat and doesn''t really match his surroundings.</td>', 'Good desat; unfortunately the subject is just a little flat and doesn''t really match his surroundings.', '2004-06-21 17:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(771957, 83788, 18349, '<td valign="top">Just a bit too noisy/grainy for my taste...which doesn''t mean I don''t like grain, it just doesn''t seem to work well for this image.   It looks like a very tight crop of a much larger picture.  A bit too fuzzy as well.</td>', 'Just a bit too noisy/grainy for my taste...which doesn''t mean I don''t like grain, it just doesn''t seem to work well for this image.   It looks like a very tight crop of a much larger picture.  A bit too fuzzy as well.', '2004-06-21 17:48:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(771962, 84823, 18349, '<td valign="top">In natural color, I bet this is a beautiful photo, but the flowers are just too small and lack detail to make a real impact in this challenge.  The desat itself is OK - I don''t know which technique you used - but it''s just lacking that "wow" factor.</td>', 'In natural color, I bet this is a beautiful photo, but the flowers are just too small and lack detail to make a real impact in this challenge.  The desat itself is OK - I don''t know which technique you used - but it''s just lacking that "wow" factor.', '2004-06-21 17:50:12.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(771966, 84877, 22922, '<td valign="top">This would probably have been a great B&amp;W shot, but you seem to have added color rather than just subtracting, giving this a very unpolished look.  The pixelated haze around the plant is distracting and the coloration is unnatural.</td>', 'This would probably have been a great B&W shot, but you seem to have added color rather than just subtracting, giving this a very unpolished look.  The pixelated haze around the plant is distracting and the coloration is unnatural.', '2004-06-21 17:51:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(771973, 84744, 22922, '<td valign="top">Top notch desaturization, you nailed this one.  Great shot and it really benefits from the technique. I would give this a 10 for the challenge.</td>', 'Top notch desaturization, you nailed this one.  Great shot and it really benefits from the technique. I would give this a 10 for the challenge.', '2004-06-21 17:53:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(771981, 84826, 12573, '<td valign="top">This is very nice.  Charming composition and wonderful detail in the bird and mirror.  It reminds me of the movie Pleasantville, in which the ''50s grey color slowly melts away to vibrant reds throughout the film.  Good stuff.</td>', 'This is very nice.  Charming composition and wonderful detail in the bird and mirror.  It reminds me of the movie Pleasantville, in which the ''50s grey color slowly melts away to vibrant reds throughout the film.  Good stuff.', '2004-06-21 17:55:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(771982, 84922, 22922, '<td valign="top">Good use of the challenge technique, very sharp looking.  This could be a great advertisement.</td>', 'Good use of the challenge technique, very sharp looking.  This could be a great advertisement.', '2004-06-21 17:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(771986, 84851, 18349, '<td valign="top">I like the high-key effect in this photo.  The black and white create a nice contrast against the blue of her eyes.  Nitpick- there appears to be a stray spot of blue outside the iris of her left eye.  Very nice portrait and it fits the challenge well.</td>', 'I like the high-key effect in this photo.  The black and white create a nice contrast against the blue of her eyes.  Nitpick- there appears to be a stray spot of blue outside the iris of her left eye.  Very nice portrait and it fits the challenge well.', '2004-06-21 17:56:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(771991, 84861, 22922, '<td valign="top">A startling shot, unconventional use of desaturization, I really like it, though I think it would be a mid-level photo in full color or B&amp;W, the halfway point fits this shot perfectly.</td>', 'A startling shot, unconventional use of desaturization, I really like it, though I think it would be a mid-level photo in full color or B&W, the halfway point fits this shot perfectly.', '2004-06-21 17:59:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(771992, 84606, 22922, '<td valign="top">Kind of creepy, and a lovely red, it looks so rich.  Love to know how you pulled off the desat on this one :)</td>', 'Kind of creepy, and a lovely red, it looks so rich.  Love to know how you pulled off the desat on this one :)', '2004-06-21 18:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(771994, 83788, 22922, '<td valign="top">Maybe not the best candidate for this challenge, the focus is fuzzy and the colors, though well highlighted, don''t pop the way many of the other entries do.  Shows a good hand with desat, but need to pick a more effective photo.</td>', 'Maybe not the best candidate for this challenge, the focus is fuzzy and the colors, though well highlighted, don''t pop the way many of the other entries do.  Shows a good hand with desat, but need to pick a more effective photo.', '2004-06-21 18:03:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(772001, 84816, 15648, '<td valign="top">Nice colors. Finland? 8</td>', 'Nice colors. Finland? 8', '2004-06-21 18:08:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(772002, 84299, 22392, '<td valign="top">one of the few in this challenge where the highlights really have a function in the picture. 9 (10 after i looked at them twice)</td>', 'one of the few in this challenge where the highlights really have a function in the picture. 9 (10 after i looked at them twice)', '2004-06-21 18:09:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(772009, 84828, 15648, '<td valign="top">Nice. Great Composition and contrast work. LOVE IT. 10</td>', 'Nice. Great Composition and contrast work. LOVE IT. 10', '2004-06-21 18:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(772016, 84896, 9002, '<td valign="top">too blue for me sorry</td>', 'too blue for me sorry', '2004-06-21 18:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(772017, 84826, 9002, '<td valign="top">good shot, but is he supposed to be red?</td>', 'good shot, but is he supposed to be red?', '2004-06-21 18:27:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(772018, 84610, 9002, '<td valign="top">seems to be out of focus .</td>', 'seems to be out of focus .', '2004-06-21 18:28:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(772019, 84583, 9002, '<td valign="top">nice detail ,and colour</td>', 'nice detail ,and colour', '2004-06-21 18:29:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(772022, 84877, 9002, '<td valign="top">you can clearly see the editting on this shot</td>', 'you can clearly see the editting on this shot', '2004-06-21 18:31:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(772026, 84891, 9002, '<td valign="top">one of the best i have voted for ,great detail on the lashes</td>', 'one of the best i have voted for ,great detail on the lashes', '2004-06-21 18:33:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(772030, 84583, 15032, '<td valign="top">The best of the flower pictures in this challenge.</td>', 'The best of the flower pictures in this challenge.', '2004-06-21 18:35:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(772032, 84488, 9002, '<td valign="top">good close up ,nice edit</td>', 'good close up ,nice edit', '2004-06-21 18:36:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(772034, 84485, 21362, '<td valign="top">One of my immediate favorites. Great candid image. Cute subjects. Nice use of selective color -- and color that looks natural and not glaringly artificial compared to the desaturated background.<br/> <br/>Wish the crop was not quite so tight, cutting off the tops of the boys'' heads. Still a nice photograph though. <br/> <br/>Good job. :)</td>', 'One of my immediate favorites. Great candid image. Cute subjects. Nice use of selective color -- and color that looks natural and not glaringly artificial compared to the desaturated background. Wish the crop was not quite so tight, cutting off the tops of the boys'' heads. Still a nice photograph though.  Good job. :)', '2004-06-21 18:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(772037, 84932, 9002, '<td valign="top">good use of the lit walls for the colour nice pic</td>', 'good use of the lit walls for the colour nice pic', '2004-06-21 18:37:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(772040, 84904, 18349, '<td valign="top">This has potential...but I do find the model''s pose to be a bit forced and unnatural, like she is quite uncomfortable.  It''s also difficult to discern whether or not this is a post desat or simply a "desaturated" environment from the start.  The background is too bright for my taste; a solid black without much detail would lend itself well to the subject.  Softer lighting on the model''s skin might also look better, or a pass through NeatImage.  I''d also like to see the whole bike, or have it at a different angle.  Of course, all of these are my opinions.  :o)</td>', 'This has potential...but I do find the model''s pose to be a bit forced and unnatural, like she is quite uncomfortable.  It''s also difficult to discern whether or not this is a post desat or simply a "desaturated" environment from the start.  The background is too bright for my taste; a solid black without much detail would lend itself well to the subject.  Softer lighting on the model''s skin might also look better, or a pass through NeatImage.  I''d also like to see the whole bike, or have it at a different angle.  Of course, all of these are my opinions.  :o)', '2004-06-21 18:38:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(772043, 84613, 9002, '<td valign="top">i would of marked this about a 6 if it didnt have the filter applied to it</td>', 'i would of marked this about a 6 if it didnt have the filter applied to it', '2004-06-21 18:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(772046, 84279, 9002, '<td valign="top">this doesnt seem to have and desaturation in the shot.</td>', 'this doesnt seem to have and desaturation in the shot.', '2004-06-21 18:40:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(772049, 84816, 9002, '<td valign="top">very dramatic sky ,works well</td>', 'very dramatic sky ,works well', '2004-06-21 18:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(772051, 84207, 9002, '<td valign="top">nice shot ,but feel it is a bit blurry</td>', 'nice shot ,but feel it is a bit blurry', '2004-06-21 18:42:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(772059, 84889, 21362, '<td valign="top">I think I would probably prefer this photo in color. The subject is wonderful, however I find the use of a color highlight to be more distracting to the overall image that I would like. It pulls my eye up to the balloons, but the cyclist is too interesting to be pushed into the b&amp;w background.</td>', 'I think I would probably prefer this photo in color. The subject is wonderful, however I find the use of a color highlight to be more distracting to the overall image that I would like. It pulls my eye up to the balloons, but the cyclist is too interesting to be pushed into the b&w background.', '2004-06-21 18:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(772080, 84895, 19708, '<td valign="top">This would have been an exemplary shot if you were to have removed the blue areas in the concrete, leaving only the globe/balloon/marble and it''s shadow in blue).<br/>Just my opinion.<br/>I loved the textures in the concrete and the angle it was shot BTW.</td>', 'This would have been an exemplary shot if you were to have removed the blue areas in the concrete, leaving only the globe/balloon/marble and it''s shadow in blue).Just my opinion.I loved the textures in the concrete and the angle it was shot BTW.', '2004-06-21 19:00:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(772083, 84888, 20992, '<td valign="top">damn nice!! Sharp, nice contrast in the black and white (I find that always hard with desaturation) nice composition, nice model!!</td>', 'damn nice!! Sharp, nice contrast in the black and white (I find that always hard with desaturation) nice composition, nice model!!', '2004-06-21 19:03:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(772086, 84146, 19708, '<td valign="top">This would have had so much more impact had the strawberries been brighter in color. The tone &amp; image quality was great BTW.</td>', 'This would have had so much more impact had the strawberries been brighter in color. The tone & image quality was great BTW.', '2004-06-21 19:04:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(772088, 84801, 16301, '<td valign="top">Really great colors and composition, gets a 10 for its originality. Good luck...</td>', 'Really great colors and composition, gets a 10 for its originality. Good luck...', '2004-06-21 19:05:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(772089, 84542, 10702, '<td valign="top">One of very few great shots in this challenge, outstanding work, .:10:.</td>', 'One of very few great shots in this challenge, outstanding work, .:10:.', '2004-06-21 19:05:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(772094, 84751, 10702, '<td valign="top">Það mætti vera soldið meiri contrast í svarthvíta hlutanum, töff mynd samt sem áður.</td>', 'Það mætti vera soldið meiri contrast í svarthvíta hlutanum, töff mynd samt sem áður.', '2004-06-21 19:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(772096, 84872, 20992, '<td valign="top">for me this one is one of the greates in the challenge. Nice sharpness, nice black and white, really good compostions and subtle use of the desaturation - 10 This one should really win!!</td>', 'for me this one is one of the greates in the challenge. Nice sharpness, nice black and white, really good compostions and subtle use of the desaturation - 10 This one should really win!!', '2004-06-21 19:08:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(772097, 84752, 327, '<td valign="top">Really a cute composition. Nice work.</td>', 'Really a cute composition. Nice work.', '2004-06-21 19:12:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(772098, 84874, 327, '<td valign="top">Unusual, and looks like a winner to me. Well done.</td>', 'Unusual, and looks like a winner to me. Well done.', '2004-06-21 19:13:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(772101, 84568, 327, '<td valign="top">Simple. Bravo</td>', 'Simple. Bravo', '2004-06-21 19:17:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(772102, 84299, 327, '<td valign="top">:) good job. Lots of feeling.</td>', ':) good job. Lots of feeling.', '2004-06-21 19:17:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(772104, 84886, 20992, '<td valign="top">funny, sharp, good contrast, nice desaturation!!! Loving it!!</td>', 'funny, sharp, good contrast, nice desaturation!!! Loving it!!', '2004-06-21 19:18:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(772105, 84871, 327, '<td valign="top">Love the ribbons in her hair, very nice touch. :) 9 from me.</td>', 'Love the ribbons in her hair, very nice touch. :) 9 from me.', '2004-06-21 19:18:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(772108, 84488, 20992, '<td valign="top">I know it wouldn''t have worked otherwise, but I do find it a pity that your fingers are showing. The green is splashing though!</td>', 'I know it wouldn''t have worked otherwise, but I do find it a pity that your fingers are showing. The green is splashing though!', '2004-06-21 19:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(772110, 84780, 21362, '<td valign="top">What a gorgeous baby! Nice photo, and good application of selective desaturation. It really highlights the nice features of the baby without being distracting to the image overall. Well done.</td>', 'What a gorgeous baby! Nice photo, and good application of selective desaturation. It really highlights the nice features of the baby without being distracting to the image overall. Well done.', '2004-06-21 19:20:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(772111, 84591, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice entry. Maybe a tighter crop on that left side but I like your entry! 9 from me.</td>', 'Nice entry. Maybe a tighter crop on that left side but I like your entry! 9 from me.', '2004-06-21 19:20:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(772112, 84702, 16965, '<td valign="top">what a totally great idea.  I hope it doesn''t get killed in the voting!</td>', 'what a totally great idea.  I hope it doesn''t get killed in the voting!', '2004-06-21 19:20:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(772113, 84717, 327, '<td valign="top">Good entry but I''m not crazy about the glare on the right. :(</td>', 'Good entry but I''m not crazy about the glare on the right. :(', '2004-06-21 19:21:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(772115, 84303, 327, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.</td>', 'Very pretty.', '2004-06-21 19:21:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(772116, 84114, 327, '<td valign="top">10 ~!</td>', '10 ~!', '2004-06-21 19:21:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(772117, 84651, 327, '<td valign="top">They have headlights on their tails.. very cool.</td>', 'They have headlights on their tails.. very cool.', '2004-06-21 19:22:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(772120, 84509, 21362, '<td valign="top">One of my immediate favorites. Good use of selective color -- it draws the eye right to the subject of the photo. The red is a nice rich color without being artificial in appearance. Composition is good too with the rule of thirds.  Cropping the top portion of the musician also keeps the subject in focus.</td>', 'One of my immediate favorites. Good use of selective color -- it draws the eye right to the subject of the photo. The red is a nice rich color without being artificial in appearance. Composition is good too with the rule of thirds.  Cropping the top portion of the musician also keeps the subject in focus.', '2004-06-21 19:23:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(772122, 84608, 21362, '<td valign="top">LOL. Hmmm.... so, right turns aren''t allowed here? ;)<br/> <br/>Nice photo. The touchs of blue add rather than distract from the overall image. Well done.</td>', 'LOL. Hmmm.... so, right turns aren''t allowed here? ;) Nice photo. The touchs of blue add rather than distract from the overall image. Well done.', '2004-06-21 19:25:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(772123, 84207, 21362, '<td valign="top">Cute. I probably would have desaturated the blue a touch just so it didn''t contrast SO much, but that''s more of a personal preferance I think. The focus seems a little soft, but it''s a nice photo.</td>', 'Cute. I probably would have desaturated the blue a touch just so it didn''t contrast SO much, but that''s more of a personal preferance I think. The focus seems a little soft, but it''s a nice photo.', '2004-06-21 19:26:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(772125, 84354, 327, '<td valign="top">Mystery person. I like it. The shot has a bit of noise but it''s not bad and adds to the over all shot. I would like the right side cropped a bit tighter to remove the partial trees. Good one.</td>', 'Mystery person. I like it. The shot has a bit of noise but it''s not bad and adds to the over all shot. I would like the right side cropped a bit tighter to remove the partial trees. Good one.', '2004-06-21 19:27:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(772126, 84283, 15403, '<td valign="top">i like this shot...kids and fountains...what could be better??</td>', 'i like this shot...kids and fountains...what could be better??', '2004-06-21 19:28:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(772127, 84357, 21362, '<td valign="top">Wow, beautiful bird! A shame that some tail feathers got clipped off the side of the frame. Otherwise, nice image.</td>', 'Wow, beautiful bird! A shame that some tail feathers got clipped off the side of the frame. Otherwise, nice image.', '2004-06-21 19:28:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(772128, 84114, 15403, '<td valign="top">striking colors.  very vivid and sharp</td>', 'striking colors.  very vivid and sharp', '2004-06-21 19:28:41.000000', NULL, 1),
