(772278, 84327, 3575, '<td valign="top">Real beautiful crystal eyes. She looks like a video game character, her skin has no texture. Since you were going for the textureless look, you could have also removed some of the lighter blotches around the eyes and smoothed the eyebrows a bit. I don''t mean remove the eyebrows, just the whitish blotches around them. I am really hypnotized by those eyes. I like that you left the red in too, it adds life. Honestly, I don''t know if I like this shot or not. I do know that it has had me spellbound for about 10 minutes now so I''m giving you an 9. Would be a ten but for the need to clean it up a little.</td>', 'Real beautiful crystal eyes. She looks like a video game character, her skin has no texture. Since you were going for the textureless look, you could have also removed some of the lighter blotches around the eyes and smoothed the eyebrows a bit. I don''t mean remove the eyebrows, just the whitish blotches around them. I am really hypnotized by those eyes. I like that you left the red in too, it adds life. Honestly, I don''t know if I like this shot or not. I do know that it has had me spellbound for about 10 minutes now so I''m giving you an 9. Would be a ten but for the need to clean it up a little.', '2004-06-21 20:39:53.000000', NULL, 1),
