(772481, 84485, 21375, '<td valign="top">My absolute favorite of all the entries.  The watermelon made my mouth water. EXCELLENT photo all the way around.</td>', 'My absolute favorite of all the entries.  The watermelon made my mouth water. EXCELLENT photo all the way around.', '2004-06-21 23:14:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(772484, 84706, 21375, '<td valign="top">GREAT color on the ladybug.  I really enjoyed your photo.</td>', 'GREAT color on the ladybug.  I really enjoyed your photo.', '2004-06-21 23:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(772505, 84807, 21375, '<td valign="top">Hummingbird, right?  Nice job trying to catch the action.  I felt that the photo was a llittle "heavy" on the right side with more "wing focus" than on the left... I mean.. just was off balanced and this distracted me a bit.  I''m no expert... just offering a comment.</td>', 'Hummingbird, right?  Nice job trying to catch the action.  I felt that the photo was a llittle "heavy" on the right side with more "wing focus" than on the left... I mean.. just was off balanced and this distracted me a bit.  I''m no expert... just offering a comment.', '2004-06-21 23:27:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(772506, 84541, 21375, '<td valign="top">It''s all about personal opinion... but I gave higher scores to those photos that appeared to be more difficult to obtain their "selections".  You captured the "challenge"... but it the straight lines were just too easy.</td>', 'It''s all about personal opinion... but I gave higher scores to those photos that appeared to be more difficult to obtain their "selections".  You captured the "challenge"... but it the straight lines were just too easy.', '2004-06-21 23:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(772509, 84783, 21375, '<td valign="top">Hmmmmm... I would have scored this higher if you had left only the horse in color, and put everything, including the sky as B&amp;W.  Pretty horse.</td>', 'Hmmmmm... I would have scored this higher if you had left only the horse in color, and put everything, including the sky as B&W.  Pretty horse.', '2004-06-21 23:31:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(772511, 84526, 21375, '<td valign="top">Nice idea... but the red handle looks like it was "pasted in" after the fact.  Love the kids expression.</td>', 'Nice idea... but the red handle looks like it was "pasted in" after the fact.  Love the kids expression.', '2004-06-21 23:32:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(772513, 84279, 21375, '<td valign="top">Something doesn''t fit with me.... she has sunglasses on, the baby''s eyes have quite a bit of glare in them, yet they and the room look "shadowy" - Also, I think for this challenge, there was suppose to be less color in the "desaturated" areas.</td>', 'Something doesn''t fit with me.... she has sunglasses on, the baby''s eyes have quite a bit of glare in them, yet they and the room look "shadowy" - Also, I think for this challenge, there was suppose to be less color in the "desaturated" areas.', '2004-06-21 23:35:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(772519, 84744, 10644, '<td valign="top">i think the idea is great but seems a bit cluttered</td>', 'i think the idea is great but seems a bit cluttered', '2004-06-21 23:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(772522, 84752, 10644, '<td valign="top">great idea...wish the lady bug would show up better</td>', 'great idea...wish the lady bug would show up better', '2004-06-21 23:42:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(772524, 84779, 21375, '<td valign="top">I gave higher scores for photos that had just a bit more "flash" of color.  I had to go "looking" for the color in this photo... but maybe my computer screen isn''t that great.</td>', 'I gave higher scores for photos that had just a bit more "flash" of color.  I had to go "looking" for the color in this photo... but maybe my computer screen isn''t that great.', '2004-06-21 23:42:54.000000', NULL, 1),
