(772571, 84751, 11518, '<td valign="top">I hope we''re not going to be staying in one of those when we go to Iceland! LOL</td>', 'I hope we''re not going to be staying in one of those when we go to Iceland! LOL', '2004-06-22 00:23:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(772579, 84092, 11518, '<td valign="top">woohoo!</td>', 'woohoo!', '2004-06-22 00:28:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(772625, 84860, 10268, '<td valign="top">Too shallow of a DoF for my liking.<br/> <br/>Would be cool to see the whole thing in focus, and a much stonger photo, I think.</td>', 'Too shallow of a DoF for my liking. Would be cool to see the whole thing in focus, and a much stonger photo, I think.', '2004-06-22 01:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(772627, 84420, 10268, '<td valign="top">Awesome colors.  I think the greens are a little too saturated, but I love the red.  I wonder if it''s really that color, of if you changed the hue, or something like that.  It looks awesome.  And the picture itself, while not really being anything of that great an interest, has great composition and focus.  Very nice.  8.</td>', 'Awesome colors.  I think the greens are a little too saturated, but I love the red.  I wonder if it''s really that color, of if you changed the hue, or something like that.  It looks awesome.  And the picture itself, while not really being anything of that great an interest, has great composition and focus.  Very nice.  8.', '2004-06-22 01:25:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(772628, 84813, 20882, '<td valign="top">Great idea, maybe a little more detail in the shadows would have made for a better photo.</td>', 'Great idea, maybe a little more detail in the shadows would have made for a better photo.', '2004-06-22 01:25:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(772630, 84569, 10268, '<td valign="top">Very simple.  Ilike it a lot.  One thing about it that''s great, it is looks naturally desaturated.  I''m not sure if it is or not, but it looks like if I were to buy a can like that, you''ve presented it exactly how I''d see it.  8.</td>', 'Very simple.  Ilike it a lot.  One thing about it that''s great, it is looks naturally desaturated.  I''m not sure if it is or not, but it looks like if I were to buy a can like that, you''ve presented it exactly how I''d see it.  8.', '2004-06-22 01:26:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(772631, 84568, 20330, '<td valign="top">the winner. gorgeous!</td>', 'the winner. gorgeous!', '2004-06-22 01:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(772634, 84809, 10732, '<td valign="top">i like the idea a lot.  the glare is kind of distracting though</td>', 'i like the idea a lot.  the glare is kind of distracting though', '2004-06-22 01:28:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(772636, 84286, 10268, '<td valign="top">To me, brown is just about the most unattractive color.  It''s just so dull.  I think I would have preferred to see the greens in this, and have the bench and path desaturated.</td>', 'To me, brown is just about the most unattractive color.  It''s just so dull.  I think I would have preferred to see the greens in this, and have the bench and path desaturated.', '2004-06-22 01:28:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(772637, 84916, 10268, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colors.  Nice focus.<br/> <br/>I think I would prefer to have the heart on the shirt without color.  It''d bring more focus to the petals, and make them stand out more.  <br/> <br/>The softness of the photo is really great too. Some of the shadows are sort of distracting too.  But this is really beautiful.  8.</td>', 'Wonderful colors.  Nice focus. I think I would prefer to have the heart on the shirt without color.  It''d bring more focus to the petals, and make them stand out more.   The softness of the photo is really great too. Some of the shadows are sort of distracting too.  But this is really beautiful.  8.', '2004-06-22 01:32:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(772641, 84631, 10268, '<td valign="top">Why not have the other screwdrivers in color?  It doesn''t look right with just one, IMO.  A clean background would help out too.</td>', 'Why not have the other screwdrivers in color?  It doesn''t look right with just one, IMO.  A clean background would help out too.', '2004-06-22 01:33:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(772643, 84686, 10268, '<td valign="top">Great colors in the shirt.  I wish we had some blue eyes to go along with it.<br/> <br/>Nice framing, too.  6.</td>', 'Great colors in the shirt.  I wish we had some blue eyes to go along with it. Nice framing, too.  6.', '2004-06-22 01:33:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(772644, 84886, 10268, '<td valign="top">Haha, that''s so funny.  I like the use of the desaturation as well.  7.</td>', 'Haha, that''s so funny.  I like the use of the desaturation as well.  7.', '2004-06-22 01:34:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(772648, 84634, 10268, '<td valign="top">I don''t think this quite works with the selective desaturation, but, I think it wold work either very well in color, or completely black and white.  5.</td>', 'I don''t think this quite works with the selective desaturation, but, I think it wold work either very well in color, or completely black and white.  5.', '2004-06-22 01:36:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(772650, 84816, 10268, '<td valign="top">One of the best uses of the selective desat. yet. 7.</td>', 'One of the best uses of the selective desat. yet. 7.', '2004-06-22 01:38:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(772653, 84702, 10268, '<td valign="top">Very cool.  I think it might looks slightly better to have the color start at the bridge on the other side than in the middle.<br/> <br/>But I like the concept here very much.  7.</td>', 'Very cool.  I think it might looks slightly better to have the color start at the bridge on the other side than in the middle. But I like the concept here very much.  7.', '2004-06-22 01:42:27.000000', NULL, 1),
