(773170, 84917, 16301, '<td valign="top">Nice centered composition, but I don''t think the brush work you did here is necessary, you could have stopped at the outlines of the person. <br/> <br/>Good luck...</td>', 'Nice centered composition, but I don''t think the brush work you did here is necessary, you could have stopped at the outlines of the person.  Good luck...', '2004-06-22 11:50:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(773172, 83912, 20889, '<td valign="top">Nice shot....clean....wonder what it would have looked like with just the one flag in the distance?</td>', 'Nice shot....clean....wonder what it would have looked like with just the one flag in the distance?', '2004-06-22 11:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(773173, 84834, 18349, '<td valign="top">This shot has some excellent potential...I like the lines and curves, and the yellow really pops.  There does seem to be a bit of a haze.  Maybe a stronger contrast adjustment could help.  Another DPCer also recently told me of a way to use USM to reduce haze...that would be effective as well.  The three light-colored poles in the foreground try to compete for attention from my eyes...maybe clone them out or a higher crop?  Some might be put off by the centered composition but I think it works just fine for this shot.  Very nice capture.  :o)</td>', 'This shot has some excellent potential...I like the lines and curves, and the yellow really pops.  There does seem to be a bit of a haze.  Maybe a stronger contrast adjustment could help.  Another DPCer also recently told me of a way to use USM to reduce haze...that would be effective as well.  The three light-colored poles in the foreground try to compete for attention from my eyes...maybe clone them out or a higher crop?  Some might be put off by the centered composition but I think it works just fine for this shot.  Very nice capture.  :o)', '2004-06-22 11:51:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(773174, 83788, 16301, '<td valign="top">It looks a bit pixelized and out of focus, nice composition though. <br/> <br/>Good luck...</td>', 'It looks a bit pixelized and out of focus, nice composition though.  Good luck...', '2004-06-22 11:52:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(773178, 84652, 16301, '<td valign="top">Yeah, Arsenal are really cool!</td>', 'Yeah, Arsenal are really cool!', '2004-06-22 11:53:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(773179, 84204, 18349, '<td valign="top">This is beautifully focused and the desat is done well...but the reflections in the bell really take away from the image.  Of course, I have no idea how to tell you to keep from getting them unless it''s to rearrange your house! ;o)</td>', 'This is beautifully focused and the desat is done well...but the reflections in the bell really take away from the image.  Of course, I have no idea how to tell you to keep from getting them unless it''s to rearrange your house! ;o)', '2004-06-22 11:54:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(773190, 84904, 23348, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture.  The blue with the tone of her skin and the black motorcycle contrast well.  Love it.</td>', 'Very nice picture.  The blue with the tone of her skin and the black motorcycle contrast well.  Love it.', '2004-06-22 12:04:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(773195, 84702, 16126, '<td valign="top">Very original! The only thing I would have liked better is to have the border between color/no color not on the middle of the bridge, but at the point where it touches the other side. More work, I know, but IMO would have been more powerful. 8</td>', 'Very original! The only thing I would have liked better is to have the border between color/no color not on the middle of the bridge, but at the point where it touches the other side. More work, I know, but IMO would have been more powerful. 8', '2004-06-22 12:13:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(773202, 84901, 20375, '<td valign="top">Not enough other desaturated elements in the photo.</td>', 'Not enough other desaturated elements in the photo.', '2004-06-22 12:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(773203, 84818, 16126, '<td valign="top">Hey,  must be John!  Pity that the background is a bit cluttered with all the buildings, but still a very effective image.</td>', 'Hey,  must be John!  Pity that the background is a bit cluttered with all the buildings, but still a very effective image.', '2004-06-22 12:17:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(773205, 84768, 20375, '<td valign="top">Not enough contrast in the black and white areas of this shot.</td>', 'Not enough contrast in the black and white areas of this shot.', '2004-06-22 12:18:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(773208, 84017, 16126, '<td valign="top">Somehow the flowers aren''t strong enough to draw the attention, my eye keeps wandering to the flask because it''s so perfectly focused.  Cropping out part of the flask would have made the flowers more of a focal point. I like the texture of the table.</td>', 'Somehow the flowers aren''t strong enough to draw the attention, my eye keeps wandering to the flask because it''s so perfectly focused.  Cropping out part of the flask would have made the flowers more of a focal point. I like the texture of the table.', '2004-06-22 12:19:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(773210, 83771, 20375, '<td valign="top">Good job. A little too grainy maybe.</td>', 'Good job. A little too grainy maybe.', '2004-06-22 12:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(773212, 84702, 20375, '<td valign="top">Hmmm. Very Imaginative. I like it.</td>', 'Hmmm. Very Imaginative. I like it.', '2004-06-22 12:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(773213, 84650, 18098, '<td valign="top">What a sweet looking doggie.  Good choice of colors.</td>', 'What a sweet looking doggie.  Good choice of colors.', '2004-06-22 12:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
