(773230, 84753, 16126, '<td valign="top">Hmm, doesn''t look like there''s any color left here, apart from a very slight tint in the milk.... Composition is very nice, but the pie is rather out of focus.</td>', 'Hmm, doesn''t look like there''s any color left here, apart from a very slight tint in the milk.... Composition is very nice, but the pie is rather out of focus.', '2004-06-22 12:24:54.000000', NULL, 1),
