(773428, 84870, 20779, '<td valign="top">Very nice hues seen here. I think I may have liked to see the shot with less cropping and the center having a contrasting color of some sort instead of the black. This may have not been an option, though. The edges a bit rough on my monitor.</td>', 'Very nice hues seen here. I think I may have liked to see the shot with less cropping and the center having a contrasting color of some sort instead of the black. This may have not been an option, though. The edges a bit rough on my monitor.', '2004-06-22 13:57:05.000000', NULL, 1),
