(773433, 84296, 7543, '<td valign="top">Great idea, nicely done. I would have placed the "inner color frame" differently though, either right in the middle or more off than it is. It kinda looks like it (the desaturation frame) was thown onto the picture. Original.</td>', 'Great idea, nicely done. I would have placed the "inner color frame" differently though, either right in the middle or more off than it is. It kinda looks like it (the desaturation frame) was thown onto the picture. Original.', '2004-06-22 13:59:55.000000', NULL, 1),
