(773442, 84702, 9906, '<td valign="top">Rather interesting take on the challenge.  A little ambiguous though.  I can''t find a resting point or a real subject...<br/>TC</td>', 'Rather interesting take on the challenge.  A little ambiguous though.  I can''t find a resting point or a real subject...TC', '2004-06-22 14:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(773446, 84824, 9906, '<td valign="top">I normally don''t care for abstract type shots, but this one is done well!<br/>TC</td>', 'I normally don''t care for abstract type shots, but this one is done well!TC', '2004-06-22 14:12:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(773449, 84144, 9906, '<td valign="top">Something about this doesn''t look right.  It''s either the color is off, or the selection needs to be feathered more.  It looks like it''s pasted on...<br/>TC</td>', 'Something about this doesn''t look right.  It''s either the color is off, or the selection needs to be feathered more.  It looks like it''s pasted on...TC', '2004-06-22 14:13:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(773450, 84424, 16126, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture with good lighting.  However, desaturating the background was not really necessary to make the bird the focal point of the image.  To better tie in with the challenge you could have used more background, would have made contrast between bird and background more apparent.  Nevertheless, very good picture. 7</td>', 'Very nice capture with good lighting.  However, desaturating the background was not really necessary to make the bird the focal point of the image.  To better tie in with the challenge you could have used more background, would have made contrast between bird and background more apparent.  Nevertheless, very good picture. 7', '2004-06-22 14:13:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(773451, 84904, 3032, '<td valign="top">The idea is good, but the background and lighting hurt the shot. The background is messy and the light is so that it creates very hard shadows. Use a second light behind the MC to get some backlight for your model and a fill light for your background. To make the background look less messy:<br/>a) Use another background, or<br/>b) Increase the distance between the MC and the background and use a wide aperture (like F2.8 or less) to let the shallow dof blur it into oblivion.<br/> <br/>The model''s pose makes it look like we are looking from the wrong side. This feeling is also enhance by the way the steer stands pointing away from the viewer.</td>', 'The idea is good, but the background and lighting hurt the shot. The background is messy and the light is so that it creates very hard shadows. Use a second light behind the MC to get some backlight for your model and a fill light for your background. To make the background look less messy:a) Use another background, orb) Increase the distance between the MC and the background and use a wide aperture (like F2.8 or less) to let the shallow dof blur it into oblivion. The model''s pose makes it look like we are looking from the wrong side. This feeling is also enhance by the way the steer stands pointing away from the viewer.', '2004-06-22 14:13:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(773465, 84818, 3032, '<td valign="top">Nice work, putting the ship this far forward in the composition focusses attention on the rear end. Just having the flag in color enhances that.  I like the square framing.<br/>Well done.<br/></td>', 'Nice work, putting the ship this far forward in the composition focusses attention on the rear end. Just having the flag in color enhances that.  I like the square framing.Well done.', '2004-06-22 14:25:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(773466, 84702, 11518, '<td valign="top">Very original.  I like. 7</td>', 'Very original.  I like. 7', '2004-06-22 14:25:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(773470, 84296, 22781, '<td valign="top">It took me a while before I commented on this photo.<br/>I think it''s done nicely, a simple approach with nice outcome.<br/>Very different. Stands out from the rest!</td>', 'It took me a while before I commented on this photo.I think it''s done nicely, a simple approach with nice outcome.Very different. Stands out from the rest!', '2004-06-22 14:28:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(773474, 84893, 11518, '<td valign="top">Nice stop motion.  Selective desaturation works well here.</td>', 'Nice stop motion.  Selective desaturation works well here.', '2004-06-22 14:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(773476, 84878, 11518, '<td valign="top">Spooky!</td>', 'Spooky!', '2004-06-22 14:31:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(773486, 84909, 9906, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the challenge.  Nice color scheme with July 4 coming up too!<br/>TC</td>', 'Interesting take on the challenge.  Nice color scheme with July 4 coming up too!TC', '2004-06-22 14:38:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(773489, 84921, 9906, '<td valign="top">Can''t really tell if ya desat''ed the background or not.  Nice macro shot.<br/>TC</td>', 'Can''t really tell if ya desat''ed the background or not.  Nice macro shot.TC', '2004-06-22 14:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(773490, 84770, 11518, '<td valign="top">Beautifu;, well done.  Love the clouds.</td>', 'Beautifu;, well done.  Love the clouds.', '2004-06-22 14:39:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(773497, 84303, 12733, '<td valign="top">The color stands out nicely against the black and white, but the umbrella doesn''t seem to be the main subject of the picture that you''d want to emphasize. The effect is incongruous rather than harmonious, IMHO.</td>', 'The color stands out nicely against the black and white, but the umbrella doesn''t seem to be the main subject of the picture that you''d want to emphasize. The effect is incongruous rather than harmonious, IMHO.', '2004-06-22 14:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(773504, 84474, 11518, '<td valign="top">Beautiful portrait.  This would have worked well for this week''s challenge too! :)9</td>', 'Beautiful portrait.  This would have worked well for this week''s challenge too! :)9', '2004-06-22 14:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(773508, 84017, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, and effective technique in separating the color from the desaturated B&amp;W. I find the one flower you missed distracting, and I think it would have been more effective if the leaves had been left colored.</td>', 'Nice idea, and effective technique in separating the color from the desaturated B&W. I find the one flower you missed distracting, and I think it would have been more effective if the leaves had been left colored.', '2004-06-22 14:45:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(773514, 84901, 12733, '<td valign="top">The flower is awesome, but the background is so uniformly black that it could just as easily be selective lighting as selective desaturation. It appears that the leaves have retained their subtle color, rather than being desaturated. Good marks for the picture quality, but some deduction for the lack of any black and white subject matter.</td>', 'The flower is awesome, but the background is so uniformly black that it could just as easily be selective lighting as selective desaturation. It appears that the leaves have retained their subtle color, rather than being desaturated. Good marks for the picture quality, but some deduction for the lack of any black and white subject matter.', '2004-06-22 14:48:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(773519, 84299, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice use of desaturation to separate the picture elements - viewer vs. pictures.</td>', 'Nice use of desaturation to separate the picture elements - viewer vs. pictures.', '2004-06-22 14:49:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(773521, 84748, 9906, '<td valign="top">I like what ya were trying to do here (I think).  If you were trying to isolate the dummie books, you should have used a different technique.  The way you did it left yellow all over the shot.  This makes it a little confusing.  If you would have masked out all but the dummy books, it would make for a much cleaner composition and isn''t too much more difficult.<br/>TC</td>', 'I like what ya were trying to do here (I think).  If you were trying to isolate the dummie books, you should have used a different technique.  The way you did it left yellow all over the shot.  This makes it a little confusing.  If you would have masked out all but the dummy books, it would make for a much cleaner composition and isn''t too much more difficult.TC', '2004-06-22 14:50:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(773523, 84210, 9906, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge, but not terribly attention holding.<br/>TC</td>', 'Meets the challenge, but not terribly attention holding.TC', '2004-06-22 14:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(773524, 84770, 12733, '<td valign="top">Brilliant concept - people in color against black and white objects. I also like the sky and the great DOF. I''d like to know how ou selected the people - it looks like it would have been a tremendous amount of work to outline each individually.</td>', 'Brilliant concept - people in color against black and white objects. I also like the sky and the great DOF. I''d like to know how ou selected the people - it looks like it would have been a tremendous amount of work to outline each individually.', '2004-06-22 14:51:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(773527, 84769, 11518, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, great deep DOF, nice. 8</td>', 'Beautiful, great deep DOF, nice. 8', '2004-06-22 14:52:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(773529, 84456, 9906, '<td valign="top">Appears to be a touch oversharpened OR you maybe needed to feather your selection of the bird to make the transition not so harsh OR a combo of both.<br/>TC</td>', 'Appears to be a touch oversharpened OR you maybe needed to feather your selection of the bird to make the transition not so harsh OR a combo of both.TC', '2004-06-22 14:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(773530, 84178, 12733, '<td valign="top">You have to use the cat that you''ve got, but I think those blazing yellow eyes would have been really spectactular on a black cat - assuming the texture and detail on the fur were well rendered. Nice idea, and a sharp photo.</td>', 'You have to use the cat that you''ve got, but I think those blazing yellow eyes would have been really spectactular on a black cat - assuming the texture and detail on the fur were well rendered. Nice idea, and a sharp photo.', '2004-06-22 14:53:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(773532, 84327, 9906, '<td valign="top">She seems a little plastic.  Did you NeatImage this?<br/>TC</td>', 'She seems a little plastic.  Did you NeatImage this?TC', '2004-06-22 14:54:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(773534, 84836, 12733, '<td valign="top">Good use of color to make the subject really stand out. I sure helps to have a subject so colorfully dressed.</td>', 'Good use of color to make the subject really stand out. I sure helps to have a subject so colorfully dressed.', '2004-06-22 14:55:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(773536, 84279, 11518, '<td valign="top">You don;t seem to have desturated anything.  There seems to be colour everywhere with the baby''s eyes enhanced.  Beautiful pose though.</td>', 'You don;t seem to have desturated anything.  There seems to be colour everywhere with the baby''s eyes enhanced.  Beautiful pose though.', '2004-06-22 14:56:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(773537, 84282, 9906, '<td valign="top">Is that a real tatoo?  If so are those the real colors?  I''ve never seen anyone with a neon green tatoo before!  Nice shot.  Love the graininess of the B/W!  Great contrasts and lighting.<br/>TC</td>', 'Is that a real tatoo?  If so are those the real colors?  I''ve never seen anyone with a neon green tatoo before!  Nice shot.  Love the graininess of the B/W!  Great contrasts and lighting.TC', '2004-06-22 14:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(773538, 84896, 9906, '<td valign="top">Ooooh...your blues are way oversaturated and IMHO ruins the effect...<br/>TC</td>', 'Ooooh...your blues are way oversaturated and IMHO ruins the effect...TC', '2004-06-22 14:57:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(773539, 84146, 12733, '<td valign="top">Yum! I can almost taste the strawberries, and they look so much redder against the black and white background.</td>', 'Yum! I can almost taste the strawberries, and they look so much redder against the black and white background.', '2004-06-22 14:57:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(773541, 84857, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very cute!<br/>TC</td>', 'Very cute!TC', '2004-06-22 14:57:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(773542, 84651, 9906, '<td valign="top">Tetras?  If so, why did you take out the blue?  If not, the desat. in this image doesn''t make a lot of sense to me...<br/>TC</td>', 'Tetras?  If so, why did you take out the blue?  If not, the desat. in this image doesn''t make a lot of sense to me...TC', '2004-06-22 14:58:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(773544, 84772, 12733, '<td valign="top">The colors of the wire and plug stand out nicely, and the box looks good in grey tones that imply painted metal.</td>', 'The colors of the wire and plug stand out nicely, and the box looks good in grey tones that imply painted metal.', '2004-06-22 14:59:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(773545, 84727, 12733, '<td valign="top">A nice black and white cityscape with the tower really standing out in red. Nice effect.</td>', 'A nice black and white cityscape with the tower really standing out in red. Nice effect.', '2004-06-22 15:00:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(773547, 84207, 12733, '<td valign="top">The waterfall looks great in B&amp;W, and the girl would have been lost without the color. Nice use of selective desaturation to make her stand out.</td>', 'The waterfall looks great in B&W, and the girl would have been lost without the color. Nice use of selective desaturation to make her stand out.', '2004-06-22 15:02:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(773549, 84357, 12733, '<td valign="top">Beautifully colored bird, and the desaturation works well with this background.</td>', 'Beautifully colored bird, and the desaturation works well with this background.', '2004-06-22 15:03:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(773551, 84312, 12733, '<td valign="top">I like the bright colors on the kid and the effect of swirling water, which works well in B&amp;W.</td>', 'I like the bright colors on the kid and the effect of swirling water, which works well in B&W.', '2004-06-22 15:04:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(773553, 84913, 12733, '<td valign="top">If "land matters" why does the sky get the color? I could imagine the barn, surrounding trees and meadow in color, with the sky and the foreground as a black and white "border."</td>', 'If "land matters" why does the sky get the color? I could imagine the barn, surrounding trees and meadow in color, with the sky and the foreground as a black and white "border."', '2004-06-22 15:07:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(773557, 84816, 12733, '<td valign="top">I like the colors of the flag against the black and white sky. Why did you call it "Blue Sky" rather than "Blue Flag," given that sky has been desaturated of all color, incluiding blue?</td>', 'I like the colors of the flag against the black and white sky. Why did you call it "Blue Sky" rather than "Blue Flag," given that sky has been desaturated of all color, incluiding blue?', '2004-06-22 15:09:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(773562, 84424, 12733, '<td valign="top">The bird''s color is brilliant, and the desaturated background ensures that there''s no color clash or distraction. Great photo.</td>', 'The bird''s color is brilliant, and the desaturated background ensures that there''s no color clash or distraction. Great photo.', '2004-06-22 15:10:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(773564, 84877, 12733, '<td valign="top">I love the way the black and white rendering brings out the sand texture. IMHO it would have been more effective to leave all three bushes in color.</td>', 'I love the way the black and white rendering brings out the sand texture. IMHO it would have been more effective to leave all three bushes in color.', '2004-06-22 15:13:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(773570, 84896, 12733, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, and the rendering of the sky and power lines. The blue of the car seems unnatural and makes the car seem out of place IMHO.</td>', 'I like the idea, and the rendering of the sky and power lines. The blue of the car seems unnatural and makes the car seem out of place IMHO.', '2004-06-22 15:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(773575, 84654, 12733, '<td valign="top">I like the color of the leaves, but I think from the point of view of making the Kookaburra stand out they could have been desaturated. The rest of the background becomes unobtruisve when desaturated, making the bird stand out.</td>', 'I like the color of the leaves, but I think from the point of view of making the Kookaburra stand out they could have been desaturated. The rest of the background becomes unobtruisve when desaturated, making the bird stand out.', '2004-06-22 15:18:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(773579, 84608, 8860, '<td valign="top">Nice use of the theme (it has a purpose!!) and there''s some humour too. Blue is just too saturated though and would look more slick with a bit more subtlety. In this instance I feel that no border would have been more simple and emphatic of the technique.</td>', 'Nice use of the theme (it has a purpose!!) and there''s some humour too. Blue is just too saturated though and would look more slick with a bit more subtlety. In this instance I feel that no border would have been more simple and emphatic of the technique.', '2004-06-22 15:20:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(773581, 84563, 12733, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice black and white shot, and IMHO the color in the dress doesn''t add much. I think that rendering the whole woman in color would improve the effect dramatically.</td>', 'This is a very nice black and white shot, and IMHO the color in the dress doesn''t add much. I think that rendering the whole woman in color would improve the effect dramatically.', '2004-06-22 15:22:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(773585, 84489, 8860, '<td valign="top">Emotive use of the technique here which is what I''m valuing highly as a voter. Mundanity of the scene adds to the poignancy - where two people ended their lives. We probably all imagine that our lives would end somewhat gloriously or at least in oeace, but this depicts the stark reality to the contrary.<br/> <br/>A longer DOF would have been better and it almost looks as if the surrounding areas have been blurred which is distracting and frustrating - particularly on the barrier next to the wreaths.</td>', 'Emotive use of the technique here which is what I''m valuing highly as a voter. Mundanity of the scene adds to the poignancy - where two people ended their lives. We probably all imagine that our lives would end somewhat gloriously or at least in oeace, but this depicts the stark reality to the contrary. A longer DOF would have been better and it almost looks as if the surrounding areas have been blurred which is distracting and frustrating - particularly on the barrier next to the wreaths.', '2004-06-22 15:25:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(773588, 84057, 16106, '<td valign="top">The choice of what to de-stat seems a bit random. If there is anything special about what was left colored then I''m missing it.</td>', 'The choice of what to de-stat seems a bit random. If there is anything special about what was left colored then I''m missing it.', '2004-06-22 15:27:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(773592, 84883, 9668, '<td valign="top">This must have took a while to to desaturate. The blue with the black background.  But if it was only a few color, you probably could of used hue/saturation instead of selectivly getting each little dot of color :). <br/>The top of the fountain seems a bit overexposed. I wonder what this would have looked like with a faster or slower shutter-speed. Nice use of the texture in the background, good contrast between foreground/background. Love the impact on the bottom.</td>', 'This must have took a while to to desaturate. The blue with the black background.  But if it was only a few color, you probably could of used hue/saturation instead of selectivly getting each little dot of color :). The top of the fountain seems a bit overexposed. I wonder what this would have looked like with a faster or slower shutter-speed. Nice use of the texture in the background, good contrast between foreground/background. Love the impact on the bottom.', '2004-06-22 15:29:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(773595, 84930, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, and the colors sand out. IMHO there''s too mcuh black and white relative to color, and the contrast in the B&amp;W is too high for my taste - areas that black out completely vs. hot spots.</td>', 'Nice idea, and the colors sand out. IMHO there''s too mcuh black and white relative to color, and the contrast in the B&W is too high for my taste - areas that black out completely vs. hot spots.', '2004-06-22 15:32:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(773599, 84351, 12733, '<td valign="top">Great closeup, and the color stands out, partly because its use is so restrained.</td>', 'Great closeup, and the color stands out, partly because its use is so restrained.', '2004-06-22 15:34:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(773601, 84871, 12733, '<td valign="top">Clever idea, and good desaturation technique.</td>', 'Clever idea, and good desaturation technique.', '2004-06-22 15:35:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(773602, 84662, 14603, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and exposure..the partial desat does it`s work well  by taking the eye into the central portion of the image.<br/>Well done</td>', 'Nice composition and exposure..the partial desat does it`s work well  by taking the eye into the central portion of the image.Well done', '2004-06-22 15:36:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(773603, 83953, 12733, '<td valign="top">Great closeup, texture, and color on the lizard. The texture of the wood is well rendered in the black and white, and the overall effect is great.</td>', 'Great closeup, texture, and color on the lizard. The texture of the wood is well rendered in the black and white, and the overall effect is great.', '2004-06-22 15:37:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(773605, 84114, 14603, '<td valign="top">The bright orange gives a nice vibrancy to this image.</td>', 'The bright orange gives a nice vibrancy to this image.', '2004-06-22 15:38:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(773606, 84548, 12733, '<td valign="top">I like the colors, and the concept ofseparating plant life from background using desaturation. Very pretty shot.</td>', 'I like the colors, and the concept ofseparating plant life from background using desaturation. Very pretty shot.', '2004-06-22 15:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(773607, 84217, 14603, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed and a good example of how this technique can add interest to an otherwise ordinary subject.</td>', 'Nicely composed and a good example of how this technique can add interest to an otherwise ordinary subject.', '2004-06-22 15:39:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(773608, 84859, 12733, '<td valign="top">A nice illustration of the poem. The B&amp;W scene works well as background, IMHO she needs a purple hat to really stand out.</td>', 'A nice illustration of the poem. The B&W scene works well as background, IMHO she needs a purple hat to really stand out.', '2004-06-22 15:41:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(773610, 84583, 12733, '<td valign="top">The rose seems to jump out against the desaturated background. IMHO leaving color in the leaves closest to the flower (the two in the foreground) would have added some variety of color and made the shot even better.</td>', 'The rose seems to jump out against the desaturated background. IMHO leaving color in the leaves closest to the flower (the two in the foreground) would have added some variety of color and made the shot even better.', '2004-06-22 15:44:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(773614, 84543, 12733, '<td valign="top">An especially  nice rendition of what has become something of a cliche among desaturation shots. I probably would have entered a similar shot if could have gotten my cat to cooperate during the challenge period. I have taken a lot of desaturated cat-colored eyes in the past.</td>', 'An especially  nice rendition of what has become something of a cliche among desaturation shots. I probably would have entered a similar shot if could have gotten my cat to cooperate during the challenge period. I have taken a lot of desaturated cat-colored eyes in the past.', '2004-06-22 15:46:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(773616, 84334, 14603, '<td valign="top">This is the first time I have seen partial desat used this way....i.e..one part of the field (bottom left) still showing colour... part of the telegraph pole desaturated.<br/>Very unusual and original</td>', 'This is the first time I have seen partial desat used this way....i.e..one part of the field (bottom left) still showing colour... part of the telegraph pole desaturated.Very unusual and original', '2004-06-22 15:48:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(773617, 84045, 14603, '<td valign="top">This is what partial desat does best..really focuses in on the subject.<br/>Nicely done</td>', 'This is what partial desat does best..really focuses in on the subject.Nicely done', '2004-06-22 15:49:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(773620, 83918, 12733, '<td valign="top">An unusual twist on the challenge - desaturating the subject, rather than the background. But it works well in this case, and you caught a great expression. You did miss a little bit of blue around the shoulders that should have been desaturated to black and white.</td>', 'An unusual twist on the challenge - desaturating the subject, rather than the background. But it works well in this case, and you caught a great expression. You did miss a little bit of blue around the shoulders that should have been desaturated to black and white.', '2004-06-22 15:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(773622, 84542, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice colors.</td>', 'Nice colors.', '2004-06-22 15:51:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(773626, 84774, 14603, '<td valign="top">Nice action shot, well captured.. and so carefully desaturated that (if not for the bright reflection on the dinghy)..you may just mistake this for a dull day</td>', 'Nice action shot, well captured.. and so carefully desaturated that (if not for the bright reflection on the dinghy)..you may just mistake this for a dull day', '2004-06-22 15:52:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(773627, 84780, 12733, '<td valign="top">This looks a lot like the hand-colored shots of yesteryear. It''s effective, and the red lips in addition to the blues adds some color variety.</td>', 'This looks a lot like the hand-colored shots of yesteryear. It''s effective, and the red lips in addition to the blues adds some color variety.', '2004-06-22 15:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(773629, 84283, 12733, '<td valign="top">I really like the way the kids stand out in color, and the way the rest of the shot appears in B&amp;W.</td>', 'I really like the way the kids stand out in color, and the way the rest of the shot appears in B&W.', '2004-06-22 15:56:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(773633, 84303, 14603, '<td valign="top">I don`t know if my original comment got through as after I made it, I selected this shot as a favourite and everything disappeared :)<br/>Suffice to say that I like it very much as it brings back many pleasant memories</td>', 'I don`t know if my original comment got through as after I made it, I selected this shot as a favourite and everything disappeared :)Suffice to say that I like it very much as it brings back many pleasant memories', '2004-06-22 16:00:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(773636, 84889, 12733, '<td valign="top">The balloons really stand out against the black and white background. I think the rider could have been a bit lighter to make him stand out as well.</td>', 'The balloons really stand out against the black and white background. I think the rider could have been a bit lighter to make him stand out as well.', '2004-06-22 16:02:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(773638, 84930, 14603, '<td valign="top">I can`t understand why so many people dislike this technique..here is a perfect example of a picture being improved and made more interesting through partial desat.<br/>Good choice of subject</td>', 'I can`t understand why so many people dislike this technique..here is a perfect example of a picture being improved and made more interesting through partial desat.Good choice of subject', '2004-06-22 16:04:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(773642, 84266, 12733, '<td valign="top">That bright red luscious raspberry stands out aginst the background, but IMHO the other berries in the cluster should have been red as well.</td>', 'That bright red luscious raspberry stands out aginst the background, but IMHO the other berries in the cluster should have been red as well.', '2004-06-22 16:06:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(773643, 84914, 14603, '<td valign="top">Simple but effective</td>', 'Simple but effective', '2004-06-22 16:06:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(773645, 84899, 11518, '<td valign="top">Wow!!  Nice legs!!! Were you the model for this one? 9</td>', 'Wow!!  Nice legs!!! Were you the model for this one? 9', '2004-06-22 16:06:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(773651, 83722, 11518, '<td valign="top">Looks slightly out of focus and the apple looks painted on.  It''s probably the lighting that''s causing this.</td>', 'Looks slightly out of focus and the apple looks painted on.  It''s probably the lighting that''s causing this.', '2004-06-22 16:09:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(773652, 84456, 12733, '<td valign="top">I love the colors, and the background works well in black and white. I think some feathering (no pun intended) at the border between bird and background would avoid the flat "pasted in" look.</td>', 'I love the colors, and the background works well in black and white. I think some feathering (no pun intended) at the border between bird and background would avoid the flat "pasted in" look.', '2004-06-22 16:09:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(773658, 84896, 11518, '<td valign="top">Did you paint the car blue instead of desaturating only the surroundings?  The way to do that is to create 2 layers, desaturate the top later then erase the car from the top layer so that the colour of the car in the background layer shows up. Voila you''ve got a selectively desaturated image.</td>', 'Did you paint the car blue instead of desaturating only the surroundings?  The way to do that is to create 2 layers, desaturate the top later then erase the car from the top layer so that the colour of the car in the background layer shows up. Voila you''ve got a selectively desaturated image.', '2004-06-22 16:13:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(773660, 84779, 11518, '<td valign="top">Probably not the best choice for this challenge.  A white bird on a bright background kinda disappears, losing impact.</td>', 'Probably not the best choice for this challenge.  A white bird on a bright background kinda disappears, losing impact.', '2004-06-22 16:15:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(773661, 84559, 12733, '<td valign="top">The butterfly is gorgeous against the desaturated leaves. I think green leaves would both clash with the overall butterfly and blended into the green edges.  I''d love to know how you selected the delicate feelers to keep them colored while the background was desaturated.</td>', 'The butterfly is gorgeous against the desaturated leaves. I think green leaves would both clash with the overall butterfly and blended into the green edges.  I''d love to know how you selected the delicate feelers to keep them colored while the background was desaturated.', '2004-06-22 16:15:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(773662, 84474, 22922, '<td valign="top">Not sure you played by the rules, but it''s an interesting picture.</td>', 'Not sure you played by the rules, but it''s an interesting picture.', '2004-06-22 16:16:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(773663, 84608, 14603, '<td valign="top">I like the exposure and composition in this image as much as the desat..but they all combine well to give the picture impact.</td>', 'I like the exposure and composition in this image as much as the desat..but they all combine well to give the picture impact.', '2004-06-22 16:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(773666, 84217, 11518, '<td valign="top">Was that gate originally that blue colour or did you add the blue colour?  That''s a great location but I don;t think that selective desaturation works here.</td>', 'Was that gate originally that blue colour or did you add the blue colour?  That''s a great location but I don;t think that selective desaturation works here.', '2004-06-22 16:17:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(773667, 84744, 14603, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and a good example of how to highlight your subject by partial desat.<br/>He would probably disappear in a full colour shot.</td>', 'Nice idea and a good example of how to highlight your subject by partial desat.He would probably disappear in a full colour shot.', '2004-06-22 16:20:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(773668, 84818, 22922, '<td valign="top">A nice use of the challenge technique, but the picture seems too unbalanced. I feel like the ship (the focus) is not immediately obvious because of the placement of the shore and buildings, taking the top edge down about 3/4 of an inch would help frame the ship better.</td>', 'A nice use of the challenge technique, but the picture seems too unbalanced. I feel like the ship (the focus) is not immediately obvious because of the placement of the shore and buildings, taking the top edge down about 3/4 of an inch would help frame the ship better.', '2004-06-22 16:20:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(773670, 84283, 11518, '<td valign="top">That''s a beautiful capture but it doesn;t seem that the selective desaturation was carried out well.  The kids look really pale. The way to do that is to create 2 layers, desaturate the top later then erase the parts you want in colour from the top layer so that the colour of the kids in the background layer show up. Voila you''ve got a selectively desaturated image.</td>', 'That''s a beautiful capture but it doesn;t seem that the selective desaturation was carried out well.  The kids look really pale. The way to do that is to create 2 layers, desaturate the top later then erase the parts you want in colour from the top layer so that the colour of the kids in the background layer show up. Voila you''ve got a selectively desaturated image.', '2004-06-22 16:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(773674, 84197, 6888, '<td valign="top">a tighter crop on this, maybe just full frame on the face, with the green eyes would be very dramatic</td>', 'a tighter crop on this, maybe just full frame on the face, with the green eyes would be very dramatic', '2004-06-22 16:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(773675, 84132, 14603, '<td valign="top">One of these shots that you would give your right arm to capture...lucky you.<br/>I can see this being amongst the ribbons....well done</td>', 'One of these shots that you would give your right arm to capture...lucky you.I can see this being amongst the ribbons....well done', '2004-06-22 16:22:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(773679, 84634, 12733, '<td valign="top">I like both the restrained use of color and the good rendition of texture and shape in the black and white parts of the photo.</td>', 'I like both the restrained use of color and the good rendition of texture and shape in the black and white parts of the photo.', '2004-06-22 16:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(773680, 84266, 14603, '<td valign="top">Good use of shallow dof and lovely lighting</td>', 'Good use of shallow dof and lovely lighting', '2004-06-22 16:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(773682, 84542, 22922, '<td valign="top">I love the level of detail you managed in your desat, but I wish the background was a bit more focused.  The fish looks like he is floating in front of the background, rather than swimming through it.</td>', 'I love the level of detail you managed in your desat, but I wish the background was a bit more focused.  The fish looks like he is floating in front of the background, rather than swimming through it.', '2004-06-22 16:29:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(773683, 84931, 12733, '<td valign="top">Great use of selective color to make the graffiti stand out from their background.</td>', 'Great use of selective color to make the graffiti stand out from their background.', '2004-06-22 16:30:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(773687, 84889, 6130, '<td valign="top">Lovely 10</td>', 'Lovely 10', '2004-06-22 16:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(773688, 84485, 14603, '<td valign="top">Really nice picture..one that will be kept for posterity I would assume.<br/>Might have cropped just a touch off the left..but that`s me being picky.<br/>Nice work</td>', 'Really nice picture..one that will be kept for posterity I would assume.Might have cropped just a touch off the left..but that`s me being picky.Nice work', '2004-06-22 16:31:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(773691, 84901, 6130, '<td valign="top">Lovely 10</td>', 'Lovely 10', '2004-06-22 16:33:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(773693, 84816, 6130, '<td valign="top">Äntligen en svensk flagga.10</td>', 'Äntligen en svensk flagga.10', '2004-06-22 16:34:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(773695, 84541, 14603, '<td valign="top">The composition and lighting really make this image stand out..a good example of how to make a simple subject interesting..well done</td>', 'The composition and lighting really make this image stand out..a good example of how to make a simple subject interesting..well done', '2004-06-22 16:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(773700, 84820, 14603, '<td valign="top">Another shot that you probably wouldn`t give much thought to if it was in full colour..but it takes on so much more interest in the way you have handled it.<br/>Good work</td>', 'Another shot that you probably wouldn`t give much thought to if it was in full colour..but it takes on so much more interest in the way you have handled it.Good work', '2004-06-22 16:36:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(773702, 84553, 21362, '<td valign="top">Siamese cats do have the most beautiful eyes!</td>', 'Siamese cats do have the most beautiful eyes!', '2004-06-22 16:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(773709, 84751, 14603, '<td valign="top">A wee bothy.. these can be lifesavers.<br/>Nice composition, must have taken a bit of trekking to get this one ?</td>', 'A wee bothy.. these can be lifesavers.Nice composition, must have taken a bit of trekking to get this one ?', '2004-06-22 16:39:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(773725, 83785, 14603, '<td valign="top">Good choice of subject as it shows the qualities that this technique has for drawing the eye straight to the points of interest.</td>', 'Good choice of subject as it shows the qualities that this technique has for drawing the eye straight to the points of interest.', '2004-06-22 16:47:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(773740, 84770, 14603, '<td valign="top">Wow..mindblowing composition and lighting..the guy upper left is my only nitpick..although I like the way the light is hitting him, I find my eyes being drawn away from the centre of the image where the perspective wants to lead them..perhaps if somebody had been on the right to balance it, this might not have been so prevalent....that aside..this must be a ribbon winner..very well done</td>', 'Wow..mindblowing composition and lighting..the guy upper left is my only nitpick..although I like the way the light is hitting him, I find my eyes being drawn away from the centre of the image where the perspective wants to lead them..perhaps if somebody had been on the right to balance it, this might not have been so prevalent....that aside..this must be a ribbon winner..very well done', '2004-06-22 16:53:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(773753, 84926, 14603, '<td valign="top">Beautifully detailed and good use of shallow dof to create the abstract background.</td>', 'Beautifully detailed and good use of shallow dof to create the abstract background.', '2004-06-22 16:57:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(773757, 84282, 14603, '<td valign="top">Fantastic lighting and exposure.<br/>This image must do well..excellent work</td>', 'Fantastic lighting and exposure.This image must do well..excellent work', '2004-06-22 17:01:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(773761, 84895, 14603, '<td valign="top">A very unusual shot and very captivating.<br/>The light has really emphasised the textures in the image.<br/></td>', 'A very unusual shot and very captivating.The light has really emphasised the textures in the image.', '2004-06-22 17:04:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(773775, 84869, 10437, '<td valign="top">This is lovely indeed, too bad the background is so busy</td>', 'This is lovely indeed, too bad the background is so busy', '2004-06-22 17:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(773779, 84383, 17134, '<td valign="top">Great shot, although this idea should''ve been performed with a Corvette ofcourse! ;)</td>', 'Great shot, although this idea should''ve been performed with a Corvette ofcourse! ;)', '2004-06-22 17:14:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(773780, 83828, 17134, '<td valign="top">Very nice! Would like to see the original..</td>', 'Very nice! Would like to see the original..', '2004-06-22 17:16:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(773784, 84026, 14603, '<td valign="top">You should receive a special award for bravery..Combining partial desat with a high key portrait..both unpopular techniques on this site.<br/>Since it`s a Partial desat challenge..hopefully voters won`t be too unkind to you.<br/>I love both techniques and really like your portrait in high key..my only criticism is that I would like to have seen it a bit sharper with less softening but it is very 60`s in style and something I would like to see more of on this site.<br/>Well done</td>', 'You should receive a special award for bravery..Combining partial desat with a high key portrait..both unpopular techniques on this site.Since it`s a Partial desat challenge..hopefully voters won`t be too unkind to you.I love both techniques and really like your portrait in high key..my only criticism is that I would like to have seen it a bit sharper with less softening but it is very 60`s in style and something I would like to see more of on this site.Well done', '2004-06-22 17:17:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(773788, 84828, 14603, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done..superb use of light and shade</td>', 'Beautifully done..superb use of light and shade', '2004-06-22 17:20:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(773790, 84146, 1563, '<td valign="top">The Red color might be a bit brighter for a higher score, at least for my 2cents worth.</td>', 'The Red color might be a bit brighter for a higher score, at least for my 2cents worth.', '2004-06-22 17:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(773792, 84851, 20779, '<td valign="top">Precious take! The only thing I would do differently (and you have probably already heard this - sorry!) is I think the blue of the eyes is a bit too intense. The photo is very "natural" and soft; the eyes look bold and somewhat hard. This I am not sure of, but it seems that the eyes are often balanced, when done this way, by a slightly "tinted" mouth, also. Play with this -- it is a great shot!</td>', 'Precious take! The only thing I would do differently (and you have probably already heard this - sorry!) is I think the blue of the eyes is a bit too intense. The photo is very "natural" and soft; the eyes look bold and somewhat hard. This I am not sure of, but it seems that the eyes are often balanced, when done this way, by a slightly "tinted" mouth, also. Play with this -- it is a great shot!', '2004-06-22 17:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(773798, 84896, 20779, '<td valign="top">Good perspective and unusual location. I think the blue may look at bit too "electric" and almost glowing. The car appears to be disjointed from the rest of the picture, perhaps due to this striking contrast. Completely personal and not part of my score -- I don''t find "new" cars very interesting, but enjoy pictures of classics and customs more for photography.</td>', 'Good perspective and unusual location. I think the blue may look at bit too "electric" and almost glowing. The car appears to be disjointed from the rest of the picture, perhaps due to this striking contrast. Completely personal and not part of my score -- I don''t find "new" cars very interesting, but enjoy pictures of classics and customs more for photography.', '2004-06-22 17:28:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(773808, 84899, 20779, '<td valign="top">I like the set-up and flavor of this a lot. The things I might like to see done differently (which may or may not work) is the cropping seems extreme on the vertical to horizontal relation; the shoes look "stretched" - maybe not such a high platform, and perhaps cropping the top right at the shoulders. Very nit-pic comment: On my monitor, the color appears neon orange-red; I think I would prefer a deep, saturated red. Just an opinion based on how I am seeing it on my display.</td>', 'I like the set-up and flavor of this a lot. The things I might like to see done differently (which may or may not work) is the cropping seems extreme on the vertical to horizontal relation; the shoes look "stretched" - maybe not such a high platform, and perhaps cropping the top right at the shoulders. Very nit-pic comment: On my monitor, the color appears neon orange-red; I think I would prefer a deep, saturated red. Just an opinion based on how I am seeing it on my display.', '2004-06-22 17:36:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(773814, 84613, 20779, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and the background interplay. The flower looks somewhat detached and floating, however. The background doesn''t appear de-saturated, but more like a digital art type thing -- but of course, I don''t know what I am actually seeing -- just how it "looks". The pistals in the flower show sharp outlines, as does parts of the flower, making it appear a little harsh. The shape of the flower itself and the placement aren''t "great", but just an opinion. I like the hints of tangerine very much.</td>', 'I like the colors and the background interplay. The flower looks somewhat detached and floating, however. The background doesn''t appear de-saturated, but more like a digital art type thing -- but of course, I don''t know what I am actually seeing -- just how it "looks". The pistals in the flower show sharp outlines, as does parts of the flower, making it appear a little harsh. The shape of the flower itself and the placement aren''t "great", but just an opinion. I like the hints of tangerine very much.', '2004-06-22 17:40:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(773817, 84927, 21362, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure that this photo has been improved with desaturation, since there were only two colors to begin with (the red and the leather seats, right?) I do like the photo though -- it''s a pleasing abstract.</td>', 'I''m not sure that this photo has been improved with desaturation, since there were only two colors to begin with (the red and the leather seats, right?) I do like the photo though -- it''s a pleasing abstract.', '2004-06-22 17:41:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(773819, 84890, 20779, '<td valign="top">I lke this rustic take on the challenge. Very good composition  and that you thought of how to use this shot. I could use a tad more brightness/saturation/boldness of the colors. I doubt there is a way to do this with the shot you could get, but it would be nice if there were a bit more light tones to bring out a crisper contrast.</td>', 'I lke this rustic take on the challenge. Very good composition  and that you thought of how to use this shot. I could use a tad more brightness/saturation/boldness of the colors. I doubt there is a way to do this with the shot you could get, but it would be nice if there were a bit more light tones to bring out a crisper contrast.', '2004-06-22 17:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(773822, 84899, 21362, '<td valign="top">A good idea for the challenge topic, I think. I would prefer if the color was tuned down a bit. It seems oversaturated to me, or appears that way in contrast to the gray shades in the rest of the photo.</td>', 'A good idea for the challenge topic, I think. I would prefer if the color was tuned down a bit. It seems oversaturated to me, or appears that way in contrast to the gray shades in the rest of the photo.', '2004-06-22 17:44:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(773824, 84734, 20779, '<td valign="top">Good, original idea. The color brings you to what is "important". The focal point (the color) seems just a little too far down and to the left within the composition. It would have been very nice to have had a little more tonal range in the B &amp; W, but have no idea if this is even possible or perhaps you wanted to keep a more "overcast" look for your subject matter. Focus is not very crisp, which will probably affect the scores you see overal.</td>', 'Good, original idea. The color brings you to what is "important". The focal point (the color) seems just a little too far down and to the left within the composition. It would have been very nice to have had a little more tonal range in the B & W, but have no idea if this is even possible or perhaps you wanted to keep a more "overcast" look for your subject matter. Focus is not very crisp, which will probably affect the scores you see overal.', '2004-06-22 17:46:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(773830, 84339, 21362, '<td valign="top">That leaf is perfect! Really beautiful!<br/> <br/>A nice photo, however it has not been improved at all by the desaturation imo. The background probably wasn''t too different in the original than it is here. If this leaf was resting among a bunch of other leaves, hightlighting it would make it stand out from a crowd.</td>', 'That leaf is perfect! Really beautiful! A nice photo, however it has not been improved at all by the desaturation imo. The background probably wasn''t too different in the original than it is here. If this leaf was resting among a bunch of other leaves, hightlighting it would make it stand out from a crowd.', '2004-06-22 17:58:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(773832, 84662, 21362, '<td valign="top">Nice image. I like the perspective, composition and square crop a lot. I''d like to see the original too. Hot air balloon have such beautiful color, it doesn''t seem quite the same in B&amp;W. Still, for the purposes of this challenge, I think this one was well done. :)</td>', 'Nice image. I like the perspective, composition and square crop a lot. I''d like to see the original too. Hot air balloon have such beautiful color, it doesn''t seem quite the same in B&W. Still, for the purposes of this challenge, I think this one was well done. :)', '2004-06-22 18:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(773849, 84895, 21362, '<td valign="top">Interesting one... interesting good, that is. Lots of texture. <br/> <br/>(Isn''t Hawaii too close to the mainland on that marble?)</td>', 'Interesting one... interesting good, that is. Lots of texture.  (Isn''t Hawaii too close to the mainland on that marble?)', '2004-06-22 18:17:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(773853, 84801, 16004, '<td valign="top">this is a very clever use of desat - though i wonder why you elected to to keep her hair with the red highlights and the slightly blue pastelly shirt coloured.  i think it might have conveyed more of an impact if all but the artwork was B&amp;W.  i love the idea though, and technically the shot passes muster too - focus and composition is top dog!  though, being unfairly picky, the patch of white in the extreme lower left corner is a bit distracting.  that aside, well done.  8.</td>', 'this is a very clever use of desat - though i wonder why you elected to to keep her hair with the red highlights and the slightly blue pastelly shirt coloured.  i think it might have conveyed more of an impact if all but the artwork was B&W.  i love the idea though, and technically the shot passes muster too - focus and composition is top dog!  though, being unfairly picky, the patch of white in the extreme lower left corner is a bit distracting.  that aside, well done.  8.', '2004-06-22 18:24:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(773856, 84662, 16148, '<td valign="top">I like this shot and take on the challenge.  It works as a centered composition.  Good luck.</td>', 'I like this shot and take on the challenge.  It works as a centered composition.  Good luck.', '2004-06-22 18:28:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(773874, 84092, 14603, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and well lit. really good example of partial desat working to it`s best advantage</td>', 'Nice composition and well lit. really good example of partial desat working to it`s best advantage', '2004-06-22 18:41:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(773876, 84741, 14603, '<td valign="top">Very topical and the unusual viewpoint really adds impact to the image.<br/>Nice work</td>', 'Very topical and the unusual viewpoint really adds impact to the image.Nice work', '2004-06-22 18:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(773879, 84893, 14603, '<td valign="top">I like the tonal qualities of this image and also the way you have captured the action. The red top just adds that little bit of impact and gives the image a lift.<br/>Nice work</td>', 'I like the tonal qualities of this image and also the way you have captured the action. The red top just adds that little bit of impact and gives the image a lift.Nice work', '2004-06-22 18:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(773882, 84197, 14603, '<td valign="top">This is my favourite of all the cat shots..filling the frame just seems to have given it that little bit extra for me.</td>', 'This is my favourite of all the cat shots..filling the frame just seems to have given it that little bit extra for me.', '2004-06-22 18:48:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(773890, 84207, 16230, '<td valign="top">The blue dress stands out nicely. The soft focus would have worked better if the litle were more in focus and the background were less.</td>', 'The blue dress stands out nicely. The soft focus would have worked better if the litle were more in focus and the background were less.', '2004-06-22 18:54:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(773909, 84542, 16230, '<td valign="top">The centered composition isn''t working for me. The fish, although nice and colorful, appears to be floating in space. totally detached from its surroundings. The background looks flat--almost as if it''s a black &amp; white image propped up well behind the fish.</td>', 'The centered composition isn''t working for me. The fish, although nice and colorful, appears to be floating in space. totally detached from its surroundings. The background looks flat--almost as if it''s a black & white image propped up well behind the fish.', '2004-06-22 19:06:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(773915, 84556, 16230, '<td valign="top">Great! I really like this one. The composition is very nice. Placing the horizon on the lower third was a good choice here. The big, desaturated sky works well with the main subject. Excellent work! A big 10 from me.</td>', 'Great! I really like this one. The composition is very nice. Placing the horizon on the lower third was a good choice here. The big, desaturated sky works well with the main subject. Excellent work! A big 10 from me.', '2004-06-22 19:14:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(773921, 84909, 16230, '<td valign="top">Very nice! The focus looks to be just a touch off though. It might just be the monitor or lighting here at work.</td>', 'Very nice! The focus looks to be just a touch off though. It might just be the monitor or lighting here at work.', '2004-06-22 19:19:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(773923, 84901, 22781, '<td valign="top">I see your point, but it does look like a WHITE flower..<br/>So this could have been a pink desaturated flower, but it could also be a full color picture of a white flower.<br/>So I think it''s fun, but I also think that if you without the title nobody will know about what you tried to achieve...</td>', 'I see your point, but it does look like a WHITE flower..So this could have been a pink desaturated flower, but it could also be a full color picture of a white flower.So I think it''s fun, but I also think that if you without the title nobody will know about what you tried to achieve...', '2004-06-22 19:20:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(773924, 84327, 22781, '<td valign="top">Nice</td>', 'Nice', '2004-06-22 19:20:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(773926, 84686, 22781, '<td valign="top">Sweet looking girl, nice shot!</td>', 'Sweet looking girl, nice shot!', '2004-06-22 19:21:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(773927, 84489, 22781, '<td valign="top">hmmm I don''t know if I like it or dislike it...<br/>Makes me feel a little down....</td>', 'hmmm I don''t know if I like it or dislike it...Makes me feel a little down....', '2004-06-22 19:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(773931, 84644, 22781, '<td valign="top">Cars at the right side of the picture are distracting.<br/>Mybe tighter crop</td>', 'Cars at the right side of the picture are distracting.Mybe tighter crop', '2004-06-22 19:23:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(773932, 84176, 22781, '<td valign="top">Bird looks a bit out of focus, and colors are very soft, maybe if you made the colors harder this photo would be better...</td>', 'Bird looks a bit out of focus, and colors are very soft, maybe if you made the colors harder this photo would be better...', '2004-06-22 19:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(773933, 84485, 16636, '<td valign="top">one of the best in this challenge..</td>', 'one of the best in this challenge..', '2004-06-22 19:25:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(773934, 84842, 16230, '<td valign="top">I''ve got the one on the right, and I''m considering the one on the left. :) Nice idea. well executed.</td>', 'I''ve got the one on the right, and I''m considering the one on the left. :) Nice idea. well executed.', '2004-06-22 19:25:32.000000', NULL, 1);
