(773936, 84791, 22781, '<td valign="top">Why did you copy my idea? :-) <br/>Well you must be as inteligent as I am! 9</td>', 'Why did you copy my idea? :-) Well you must be as inteligent as I am! 9', '2004-06-22 19:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
