(773958, 84852, 16636, '<td valign="top">I don''t think the purple flower really adds anything to your image and I would have cropped this off, also the (bug?) could have been removed before shooting.</td>', 'I don''t think the purple flower really adds anything to your image and I would have cropped this off, also the (bug?) could have been removed before shooting.', '2004-06-22 19:36:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(773977, 84556, 16912, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot and lends itself to the effect nicely.<br/>ok, I''m clutching at straws here but feel the blue of the water maybe makes this a little more surreal than I''d have liked. The title really lends itself to this picture. Calling out for a print (but I guess you know this :)</td>', 'Excellent shot and lends itself to the effect nicely.ok, I''m clutching at straws here but feel the blue of the water maybe makes this a little more surreal than I''d have liked. The title really lends itself to this picture. Calling out for a print (but I guess you know this :)', '2004-06-22 20:00:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(773990, 84630, 18677, '<td valign="top">nice perspective.  the red on the sign barely looks saturated, but I like the subtlety of it.  very good</td>', 'nice perspective.  the red on the sign barely looks saturated, but I like the subtlety of it.  very good', '2004-06-22 20:08:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(774001, 84588, 18677, '<td valign="top">beautiful lighting, excellent focus and image quality.  great job!</td>', 'beautiful lighting, excellent focus and image quality.  great job!', '2004-06-22 20:12:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(774004, 84920, 18677, '<td valign="top">the leaf looks nice and the lighting is good, but the composition could use a little work.  the curved reflections add to the mood but are quite distracting at the same time.</td>', 'the leaf looks nice and the lighting is good, but the composition could use a little work.  the curved reflections add to the mood but are quite distracting at the same time.', '2004-06-22 20:14:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(774007, 84702, 18677, '<td valign="top">This is a great idea!  I hope people understand it and don''t lower your score because so much of it is saturated.  I like it a lot... 8</td>', 'This is a great idea!  I hope people understand it and don''t lower your score because so much of it is saturated.  I like it a lot... 8', '2004-06-22 20:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(774010, 84334, 18677, '<td valign="top">interesting.  very unique.  I hope that is a real rainbow.  If so, excellent job capturing it!   I don''t think i like the fact that some of the grass here is saturated, and the bright spot on the pole (on the right side) distracts my eye a lot, but overall this is a pretty good photo</td>', 'interesting.  very unique.  I hope that is a real rainbow.  If so, excellent job capturing it!   I don''t think i like the fact that some of the grass here is saturated, and the bright spot on the pole (on the right side) distracts my eye a lot, but overall this is a pretty good photo', '2004-06-22 20:18:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(774013, 84609, 18677, '<td valign="top">fairly good use of selective desaturation, but the lighting is not good  (light is too direct and creates strong reflections, and a couple of the bottles is overexposed), and it appears to be a little out of focus</td>', 'fairly good use of selective desaturation, but the lighting is not good  (light is too direct and creates strong reflections, and a couple of the bottles is overexposed), and it appears to be a little out of focus', '2004-06-22 20:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(774014, 84774, 18677, '<td valign="top">great capture.  the water spray looks a bit oversharpened, otherwise nice job</td>', 'great capture.  the water spray looks a bit oversharpened, otherwise nice job', '2004-06-22 20:21:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(774015, 84759, 18677, '<td valign="top">I used to have that same car, even the same color!  The background is very distracting, but the selective desaturation helps make the car stand out better</td>', 'I used to have that same car, even the same color!  The background is very distracting, but the selective desaturation helps make the car stand out better', '2004-06-22 20:22:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(774016, 84541, 18677, '<td valign="top">nice composition.  looks slightly crooked, but not a big problem.  sky is very nice.  ground on left side looks a little oversharpened.</td>', 'nice composition.  looks slightly crooked, but not a big problem.  sky is very nice.  ground on left side looks a little oversharpened.', '2004-06-22 20:24:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(774018, 84909, 18677, '<td valign="top">poor lighting.  the light is too bright/direct which causes strong reflections.  would also be better if you desaturated the red tacks also</td>', 'poor lighting.  the light is too bright/direct which causes strong reflections.  would also be better if you desaturated the red tacks also', '2004-06-22 20:25:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(774026, 84474, 18677, '<td valign="top">beautiful !  the flag on the ear is just a little too much, which is why I give this an 8 instead of 9.  great job!</td>', 'beautiful !  the flag on the ear is just a little too much, which is why I give this an 8 instead of 9.  great job!', '2004-06-22 20:34:21.000000', NULL, 1),
