(774028, 84339, 18677, '<td valign="top">one of my favorites in this challenge, if not on this entire site.  very well done.  i can''t think of anything wrong with it, except maybe very slight oversharpening which appears in some areas but not in most of the image.  great job!  my only 10 so far</td>', 'one of my favorites in this challenge, if not on this entire site.  very well done.  i can''t think of anything wrong with it, except maybe very slight oversharpening which appears in some areas but not in most of the image.  great job!  my only 10 so far', '2004-06-22 20:36:34.000000', NULL, 1),
