(774104, 84591, 14476, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot and a lot of us are making hard choices of what to emphasis (some for the first time).  While I like your choices of yellow placement, I wonder what this image would have looked like with the 40MPG and the two other lines emphasised as well.  Naturally, I assume you already looked at those ideas and made your decision but if you haven''t, it''s something to think about.</td>', 'I really like this shot and a lot of us are making hard choices of what to emphasis (some for the first time).  While I like your choices of yellow placement, I wonder what this image would have looked like with the 40MPG and the two other lines emphasised as well.  Naturally, I assume you already looked at those ideas and made your decision but if you haven''t, it''s something to think about.', '2004-06-22 21:21:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(774123, 84867, 14476, '<td valign="top">Terrific capture.  Good selection, but (just a thought) I wonder what it would have looked like with all the lettering saturated.</td>', 'Terrific capture.  Good selection, but (just a thought) I wonder what it would have looked like with all the lettering saturated.', '2004-06-22 21:28:07.000000', NULL, 1),
