(774336, 84770, 4494, '<td valign="top">Excellent attention to detail in this.  I see you have colored it perfectly and not missed one person.  Great job.  I would have exaggerated the colors on a couple of the people I think to make them stick out more, but still good, and great Title.</td>', 'Excellent attention to detail in this.  I see you have colored it perfectly and not missed one person.  Great job.  I would have exaggerated the colors on a couple of the people I think to make them stick out more, but still good, and great Title.', '2004-06-23 00:17:19.000000', NULL, 1),
