(774678, 84847, 14355, '<td valign="top">The dream, or, the nightmare?  Great work - this is one of the few pictures that meet the challenge and do what was intended.   I would have given you a 10 except the woman''s hair doesn''t fit with the other untouched items in your photo. Rated 9.</td>', 'The dream, or, the nightmare?  Great work - this is one of the few pictures that meet the challenge and do what was intended.   I would have given you a 10 except the woman''s hair doesn''t fit with the other untouched items in your photo. Rated 9.', '2004-06-23 02:20:27.000000', NULL, 1),
