(774710, 84637, 14355, '<td valign="top">I really liked the concept of this picture.   Wonderful idea, nice focus on the forground hand, leaf, body, but the background is too grainy.  You have talent and need a better camera or portrait lens - you equiment should never let you down.  Focus outstanding and the colors perfect.  Wonderful workmanship separating the leaf from the rest...... truly great detail work!  (go get better gear!)  Rated 8.</td>', 'I really liked the concept of this picture.   Wonderful idea, nice focus on the forground hand, leaf, body, but the background is too grainy.  You have talent and need a better camera or portrait lens - you equiment should never let you down.  Focus outstanding and the colors perfect.  Wonderful workmanship separating the leaf from the rest...... truly great detail work!  (go get better gear!)  Rated 8.', '2004-06-23 02:37:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(774720, 84546, 14355, '<td valign="top">A really great picture to use for this challenge.  And unusual.  And imaginative!   Only off point is the napkin is extremly bright and draws away from the yellow corn.  Focus is a little soft, but, it''s still and excellent take.  Nice workmanship desaturating the background.  Rated 8.</td>', 'A really great picture to use for this challenge.  And unusual.  And imaginative!   Only off point is the napkin is extremly bright and draws away from the yellow corn.  Focus is a little soft, but, it''s still and excellent take.  Nice workmanship desaturating the background.  Rated 8.', '2004-06-23 02:40:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(774728, 84266, 14355, '<td valign="top">One of the few pictures that meets the challenge.   And a great choice.  Awesome dof - looks like it could be picked right from the monitor.  Perfect workmanship on the desaturation.  Very nice colors.  There is too much negative space on the bottom, top and left side - a slightly different crop seems in order.  Still - an excellent piece of work.  Cropped, matted and framed - it will sell.  Rated 9.</td>', 'One of the few pictures that meets the challenge.   And a great choice.  Awesome dof - looks like it could be picked right from the monitor.  Perfect workmanship on the desaturation.  Very nice colors.  There is too much negative space on the bottom, top and left side - a slightly different crop seems in order.  Still - an excellent piece of work.  Cropped, matted and framed - it will sell.  Rated 9.', '2004-06-23 02:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(774756, 84085, 14355, '<td valign="top">I have a love hate relationship with this picture.  Stepping back from the monitor it works, looking at it it normally doesn''t.  That''s because the transition between yellow and orange have pixilated on you.  While desaturating the picture you must have accidentally removed a hue used by the colored segment of the picture.  It''s a nice hight contrast picture to work with on this challenge - one liemon from the correct angle might have worked better for you.  Rated 7.</td>', 'I have a love hate relationship with this picture.  Stepping back from the monitor it works, looking at it it normally doesn''t.  That''s because the transition between yellow and orange have pixilated on you.  While desaturating the picture you must have accidentally removed a hue used by the colored segment of the picture.  It''s a nice hight contrast picture to work with on this challenge - one liemon from the correct angle might have worked better for you.  Rated 7.', '2004-06-23 02:54:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(774768, 84428, 14355, '<td valign="top">This could have been a 10 if you had colored the butterfly  - it''s certainly the main subject with perfect symetry and freshly sprouted!  Nearly the perfect picture to use for this challenge............... nice focus, good dof and excellent contrast.  Excellent workmanship on separating the color from the background.  Perhaps others will appreciate the flower over the butterfly.  It''s a great picture in any case.  Good work.  Rated 7.</td>', 'This could have been a 10 if you had colored the butterfly  - it''s certainly the main subject with perfect symetry and freshly sprouted!  Nearly the perfect picture to use for this challenge............... nice focus, good dof and excellent contrast.  Excellent workmanship on separating the color from the background.  Perhaps others will appreciate the flower over the butterfly.  It''s a great picture in any case.  Good work.  Rated 7.', '2004-06-23 02:58:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(774774, 84575, 14355, '<td valign="top">What did you desaturate?   We can''t tell.  What were you thinking??????  Notice how the glass stems hold color?  The two back ones have glass color, the two front ones show the reflection of the back ones.  Desaturated water?</td>', 'What did you desaturate?   We can''t tell.  What were you thinking??????  Notice how the glass stems hold color?  The two back ones have glass color, the two front ones show the reflection of the back ones.  Desaturated water?', '2004-06-23 03:00:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(774787, 84567, 20235, '<td valign="top">I like the cropping and the way the farm''s roof is sillouhetted against the dark treeline. A shame this site only allows 640 pixel size because this is one of those photos where bigger is better.</td>', 'I like the cropping and the way the farm''s roof is sillouhetted against the dark treeline. A shame this site only allows 640 pixel size because this is one of those photos where bigger is better.', '2004-06-23 03:04:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(774790, 84793, 20235, '<td valign="top">Nice work on the desaturation. There are some areas that look slightly out of focus, but overall nice image.</td>', 'Nice work on the desaturation. There are some areas that look slightly out of focus, but overall nice image.', '2004-06-23 03:05:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(774795, 84266, 20235, '<td valign="top">Good DOF and desaturation. I think cropping to make the subject more centralized may have been nice.</td>', 'Good DOF and desaturation. I think cropping to make the subject more centralized may have been nice.', '2004-06-23 03:06:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(774800, 84608, 20235, '<td valign="top">Great use of the desaturation to emphasize the title. The contrast between the electric blue against the greyscale is so vivid...... 8</td>', 'Great use of the desaturation to emphasize the title. The contrast between the electric blue against the greyscale is so vivid...... 8', '2004-06-23 03:07:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(774803, 84689, 20235, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot and great composition. The resulting contrast between the green and sky really creates an almost dream-like photo...... I give an 8 !</td>', 'Beautiful shot and great composition. The resulting contrast between the green and sky really creates an almost dream-like photo...... I give an 8 !', '2004-06-23 03:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(774806, 84830, 20235, '<td valign="top">Fantastic clarity and detail. I think a more shallow DOF would have helped to emphasize the subject more, but nice shot nonetheless.</td>', 'Fantastic clarity and detail. I think a more shallow DOF would have helped to emphasize the subject more, but nice shot nonetheless.', '2004-06-23 03:10:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(774808, 84871, 20235, '<td valign="top">Great title and subject. Composition and contrast are very nice..... 7</td>', 'Great title and subject. Composition and contrast are very nice..... 7', '2004-06-23 03:11:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(774812, 84351, 20235, '<td valign="top">Wow, that''s a really cool shot. Detail and DOF are great and the desaturation looks flawless. Maybe cropping to make the "bubble" more central may have improved composition, but great shot regardless..... 8</td>', 'Wow, that''s a really cool shot. Detail and DOF are great and the desaturation looks flawless. Maybe cropping to make the "bubble" more central may have improved composition, but great shot regardless..... 8', '2004-06-23 03:12:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(774820, 84456, 20235, '<td valign="top">Great contrast and very vivid colors!  My only suggestion is that the lighting seems a little harsh and the cropping of the bird to desaturate is a little messy.... particularly around the wings.</td>', 'Great contrast and very vivid colors!  My only suggestion is that the lighting seems a little harsh and the cropping of the bird to desaturate is a little messy.... particularly around the wings.', '2004-06-23 03:14:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(774829, 84854, 20235, '<td valign="top">haha, great shot. DOF and composition are nice and the reverse use of selective desaturation works well. A little noisy in the background for my taste, but still a good nonetheless.... 7</td>', 'haha, great shot. DOF and composition are nice and the reverse use of selective desaturation works well. A little noisy in the background for my taste, but still a good nonetheless.... 7', '2004-06-23 03:16:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(774832, 84851, 20235, '<td valign="top">I love the framing and clarity in this shot. Very simple selective desaturation, but it works well in this case.... 7</td>', 'I love the framing and clarity in this shot. Very simple selective desaturation, but it works well in this case.... 7', '2004-06-23 03:17:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(774836, 84575, 20235, '<td valign="top">I like your idea and execution here. Although I''m not crazy about the composition. The subjects are very split in the shot and the negative space does not add to the photo imho.</td>', 'I like your idea and execution here. Although I''m not crazy about the composition. The subjects are very split in the shot and the negative space does not add to the photo imho.', '2004-06-23 03:18:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(774841, 84826, 20235, '<td valign="top">Good composition and DOF.</td>', 'Good composition and DOF.', '2004-06-23 03:19:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(774847, 84282, 20235, '<td valign="top">Cool shot. I like the use of lighting and shadows here. Composition and selective desaturation really emphasize the title. I''m gonna step out on a limb here and pick this as one of the top placers in the challenge.... 8</td>', 'Cool shot. I like the use of lighting and shadows here. Composition and selective desaturation really emphasize the title. I''m gonna step out on a limb here and pick this as one of the top placers in the challenge.... 8', '2004-06-23 03:21:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(774885, 84178, 20235, '<td valign="top">Beautiful clarity and focus. The darkened background works well to isolate the subject.</td>', 'Beautiful clarity and focus. The darkened background works well to isolate the subject.', '2004-06-23 03:33:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(774888, 84634, 20235, '<td valign="top">Love the composition and framing here. Very interesting pic to look at.... 7</td>', 'Love the composition and framing here. Very interesting pic to look at.... 7', '2004-06-23 03:34:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(774889, 84889, 20235, '<td valign="top">Good work on the desaturation. Very whimsical photo.... 7</td>', 'Good work on the desaturation. Very whimsical photo.... 7', '2004-06-23 03:34:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(774892, 84577, 20235, '<td valign="top">Wait a minute, does this mean you wear lipstick? ; )<br/> <br/>Good idea and execution. The composition and DOF are very nice.</td>', 'Wait a minute, does this mean you wear lipstick? ; ) Good idea and execution. The composition and DOF are very nice.', '2004-06-23 03:36:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(774898, 84542, 20235, '<td valign="top">Great work on the selective desaturation. The focus and vividness of the fish are great. Maybe some cropping to make the fish a larger part of the composition may have been nice, but that''s just my own preference.</td>', 'Great work on the selective desaturation. The focus and vividness of the fish are great. Maybe some cropping to make the fish a larger part of the composition may have been nice, but that''s just my own preference.', '2004-06-23 03:38:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(774902, 84132, 20235, '<td valign="top">Well composed and nice DOF. Your use of desaturation really emphasize the title.....7</td>', 'Well composed and nice DOF. Your use of desaturation really emphasize the title.....7', '2004-06-23 03:40:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(774910, 84647, 20235, '<td valign="top">Great shot. The POV, subject, desaturation, and architecture of the control tower give this photo a very nostaligic feel......7</td>', 'Great shot. The POV, subject, desaturation, and architecture of the control tower give this photo a very nostaligic feel......7', '2004-06-23 03:41:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(775129, 84485, 12802, '<td valign="top">This was the first shot I opened in the challenge and I know this one will do well!<br/> <br/>I really like this shot, it''s exactly what I thought would be entered into the challenge.  The expressions on the boys faces are brilliant, the colours in the watermelon are amazing, so vivid.  I even like the wire mesh in the background, it seems to bring the subject closer.   The exposure is perfect, the skins tones are brilliant, even looking at the darker areas of the boys clothes I can still see them clearly.<br/> <br/>Only one thing I would have liked changed is the hoses behind the boy on the right hand side, but that''e me just being a picky bugger.<br/> <br/>Excellent shot, full marks and I hope you''ve printed this out for the boys to keep! :-)</td>', 'This was the first shot I opened in the challenge and I know this one will do well! I really like this shot, it''s exactly what I thought would be entered into the challenge.  The expressions on the boys faces are brilliant, the colours in the watermelon are amazing, so vivid.  I even like the wire mesh in the background, it seems to bring the subject closer.   The exposure is perfect, the skins tones are brilliant, even looking at the darker areas of the boys clothes I can still see them clearly. Only one thing I would have liked changed is the hoses behind the boy on the right hand side, but that''e me just being a picky bugger. Excellent shot, full marks and I hope you''ve printed this out for the boys to keep! :-)', '2004-06-23 05:37:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(775132, 84609, 12802, '<td valign="top">Good idea, certainly meets the challenge.<br/> <br/>I think your lighitng here has let you down a little here, too much of a reflection.  If you''ve used an on board flash, try putting some white paper in front of it to diffuse ot or not make it so harsh.  6</td>', 'Good idea, certainly meets the challenge. I think your lighitng here has let you down a little here, too much of a reflection.  If you''ve used an on board flash, try putting some white paper in front of it to diffuse ot or not make it so harsh.  6', '2004-06-23 05:38:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(775136, 84017, 12802, '<td valign="top">Great idea for the challenge, I think the title adds that little extrat bit too.<br/> <br/>Maybe moving the camera round a little to the left so that the flowers have a dark background would have helped. The white leaves of the flowers are overtaken by the white sky. 6</td>', 'Great idea for the challenge, I think the title adds that little extrat bit too. Maybe moving the camera round a little to the left so that the flowers have a dark background would have helped. The white leaves of the flowers are overtaken by the white sky. 6', '2004-06-23 05:39:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(775156, 84877, 12802, '<td valign="top">Excellent idea, really like the ripples in the sand, extra points for including the birds claw marks. <br/> <br/>Afraid though that you could have done a little more with the desaturation part. If you''d gone round the leaves etc in more details you wouldn''t have been able to see the sand, it''s too distracting I''m afraid.  6</td>', 'Excellent idea, really like the ripples in the sand, extra points for including the birds claw marks.  Afraid though that you could have done a little more with the desaturation part. If you''d gone round the leaves etc in more details you wouldn''t have been able to see the sand, it''s too distracting I''m afraid.  6', '2004-06-23 05:48:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(775176, 84929, 18450, '<td valign="top">the dof of field has created the most wonderful textures with the different trees and foliage, bridge creates contrast with nice flowing lines.....however the red areas appear a little patchy to me.</td>', 'the dof of field has created the most wonderful textures with the different trees and foliage, bridge creates contrast with nice flowing lines.....however the red areas appear a little patchy to me.', '2004-06-23 05:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(775180, 84858, 18450, '<td valign="top">beautiful flower with lovely lines and textures in the desaturated areas</td>', 'beautiful flower with lovely lines and textures in the desaturated areas', '2004-06-23 05:59:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(775194, 84779, 18450, '<td valign="top">beautifully subtle effect......this is very lovely</td>', 'beautifully subtle effect......this is very lovely', '2004-06-23 06:06:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(775258, 84608, 10268, '<td valign="top">This is awesome.  I love the blue, the composition, and the way the text is.  It''s just perfect.  9.</td>', 'This is awesome.  I love the blue, the composition, and the way the text is.  It''s just perfect.  9.', '2004-06-23 06:34:25.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(775265, 84896, 10268, '<td valign="top">Seems as though your color balances is off.  You can tell, because the grays and whites on the car are cyan. It''s easily fixable in photoshop, for next time if you accident''y shoot using the wrong white balance.</td>', 'Seems as though your color balances is off.  You can tell, because the grays and whites on the car are cyan. It''s easily fixable in photoshop, for next time if you accident''y shoot using the wrong white balance.', '2004-06-23 06:35:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(775270, 84354, 10268, '<td valign="top">I think grain when used correctly, really adds to a photo.  I find all the grain really distracting here.  <br/> <br/>I like the way you desaturated, and the framing of the subject.  Great photo for the challenge, just a little grainy.  7.</td>', 'I think grain when used correctly, really adds to a photo.  I find all the grain really distracting here.   I like the way you desaturated, and the framing of the subject.  Great photo for the challenge, just a little grainy.  7.', '2004-06-23 06:37:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(775277, 84852, 10268, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice of focus.  I don''t particularly like it.  It''s too big, too centered, and not in focus at all.  <br/> <br/>But as long as you like it, then that''s all that matter.  If you had everything in focus, then I think this would be a much nicer photo.</td>', 'Interesting choice of focus.  I don''t particularly like it.  It''s too big, too centered, and not in focus at all.   But as long as you like it, then that''s all that matter.  If you had everything in focus, then I think this would be a much nicer photo.', '2004-06-23 06:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(775281, 84776, 10268, '<td valign="top">Excellent choice for this theme.<br/> <br/>I think the house and cars are slightly distracting.  I would have figured out a different crop.  Maybe also increasing the saturation and brightness of the rainbow might have helped out a bit.  5.</td>', 'Excellent choice for this theme. I think the house and cars are slightly distracting.  I would have figured out a different crop.  Maybe also increasing the saturation and brightness of the rainbow might have helped out a bit.  5.', '2004-06-23 06:40:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(775289, 84428, 10268, '<td valign="top">I think I would have preferred to have the butterfly in color and the rest of the photo in black and white.  I don''t think it quite works the way you have it.<br/></td>', 'I think I would have preferred to have the butterfly in color and the rest of the photo in black and white.  I don''t think it quite works the way you have it.', '2004-06-23 06:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(775301, 84848, 10268, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and the contrast very much in this shot.  The angle you shot it at annoys me a bit though.<br/> <br/>With a slight counter clockwise rotation to make the lines straight, you''d have a 9.  I''m giving you a 7 though, as the tilting of the image is way too distracting.</td>', 'I like the idea and the contrast very much in this shot.  The angle you shot it at annoys me a bit though. With a slight counter clockwise rotation to make the lines straight, you''d have a 9.  I''m giving you a 7 though, as the tilting of the image is way too distracting.', '2004-06-23 06:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(775352, 84912, 6999, '<td valign="top">For me, your yellow key line in the frame here is a mistake - it amkes the frame part of the picture, rather than something to isolate the picture from its surroundings, precisely because you''ve used that colour as your choice in the image. The remaining colour in the eyes looks so unreal too - I really do think you should have desaturated those areas also. There''s also a pull introduced by your cropping between the face and the flower and the negative space image right - but I don''t see a purpose of that negative space here, other than to place the flower on the cntre of image, which I think is weak, compositionally. I like the softness of the image, has a suitability for what feels quite old-time, but I also think you could have found some more definition with your lighting - more depth. All of which sounds hyper-critical, but actually to my eye you''re not far off something rather nice here. 6</td>', 'For me, your yellow key line in the frame here is a mistake - it amkes the frame part of the picture, rather than something to isolate the picture from its surroundings, precisely because you''ve used that colour as your choice in the image. The remaining colour in the eyes looks so unreal too - I really do think you should have desaturated those areas also. There''s also a pull introduced by your cropping between the face and the flower and the negative space image right - but I don''t see a purpose of that negative space here, other than to place the flower on the cntre of image, which I think is weak, compositionally. I like the softness of the image, has a suitability for what feels quite old-time, but I also think you could have found some more definition with your lighting - more depth. All of which sounds hyper-critical, but actually to my eye you''re not far off something rather nice here. 6', '2004-06-23 07:07:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(775388, 84874, 15506, '<td valign="top">I like this photo and how you used the desaturation.  Good work!</td>', 'I like this photo and how you used the desaturation.  Good work!', '2004-06-23 07:35:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(775389, 83912, 15506, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorites.  Good job of desaturation</td>', 'This is one of my favorites.  Good job of desaturation', '2004-06-23 07:37:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(775390, 84849, 18450, '<td valign="top">excellent job done on the colour with the flowers.....I would have liked to have seen them either arranged in a different vase or on the plant - I ended up focusing on the vase, which to me didn''t enhance the image</td>', 'excellent job done on the colour with the flowers.....I would have liked to have seen them either arranged in a different vase or on the plant - I ended up focusing on the vase, which to me didn''t enhance the image', '2004-06-23 07:38:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(775392, 84816, 15506, '<td valign="top">Very original and great contrast.</td>', 'Very original and great contrast.', '2004-06-23 07:38:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(775394, 84428, 15506, '<td valign="top">Interesting that you chose to color the flowers instead of the butterfly.  Good job</td>', 'Interesting that you chose to color the flowers instead of the butterfly.  Good job', '2004-06-23 07:39:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(775395, 84847, 15506, '<td valign="top">Very original going for the read in the picture.  Makes you look for a while and smile</td>', 'Very original going for the read in the picture.  Makes you look for a while and smile', '2004-06-23 07:40:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(775396, 84323, 18450, '<td valign="top">the flags make a lovely bold statement but the background of the houses is very busy and distracting....would like to see this shot from a different angle with the fields behind if that were possible</td>', 'the flags make a lovely bold statement but the background of the houses is very busy and distracting....would like to see this shot from a different angle with the fields behind if that were possible', '2004-06-23 07:41:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(775398, 84207, 15506, '<td valign="top">Nice picture for this challenge.  I would like it more if the pretty face was in focus.</td>', 'Nice picture for this challenge.  I would like it more if the pretty face was in focus.', '2004-06-23 07:42:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(775399, 84702, 15506, '<td valign="top">Great Idea!  Must have been a great shot in color too</td>', 'Great Idea!  Must have been a great shot in color too', '2004-06-23 07:43:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(775404, 84859, 15506, '<td valign="top">great  job with</td>', 'great  job with', '2004-06-23 07:47:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(775406, 84800, 15506, '<td valign="top">Beautiful job.  Great capture.</td>', 'Beautiful job.  Great capture.', '2004-06-23 07:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(775410, 84512, 16053, '<td valign="top">Good pic. Nice job</td>', 'Good pic. Nice job', '2004-06-23 07:51:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(775445, 84651, 472, '<td valign="top">this is a cute one. i like fish in general. and these guys look cool and fast with those black and red stripes. oh hey maybe they work at texaco ! :)</td>', 'this is a cute one. i like fish in general. and these guys look cool and fast with those black and red stripes. oh hey maybe they work at texaco ! :)', '2004-06-23 08:33:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(775447, 84583, 472, '<td valign="top">Well done presentation of a classic subject.  im thinking i might crop out that lower bud.</td>', 'Well done presentation of a classic subject.  im thinking i might crop out that lower bud.', '2004-06-23 08:34:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(775449, 84854, 472, '<td valign="top">wow - this is really really cool.  first one i''ve seen to desat the main subj but leave the bg whole.  it''s very trippy, esp since you captured the dog so crisply and with so much detail, full on drool in motion mode. 10.</td>', 'wow - this is really really cool.  first one i''ve seen to desat the main subj but leave the bg whole.  it''s very trippy, esp since you captured the dog so crisply and with so much detail, full on drool in motion mode. 10.', '2004-06-23 08:36:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(775451, 84217, 472, '<td valign="top">nice gate. new mexico?</td>', 'nice gate. new mexico?', '2004-06-23 08:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(775453, 83918, 472, '<td valign="top">uh oh, it''s an oops!  seriously, well done shot, altho i dont find that blue bg as flattering as some other colors might have been.  I think it''s that there''s not enough contrast to really hit the spot for me.</td>', 'uh oh, it''s an oops!  seriously, well done shot, altho i dont find that blue bg as flattering as some other colors might have been.  I think it''s that there''s not enough contrast to really hit the spot for me.', '2004-06-23 08:37:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(775454, 84185, 472, '<td valign="top">WOW. this is amazing.  i love the dreamy fantasy feel with the sepia.  I wonder if you''re getting dinged for using sepia and not pure b&amp;w?</td>', 'WOW. this is amazing.  i love the dreamy fantasy feel with the sepia.  I wonder if you''re getting dinged for using sepia and not pure b&w?', '2004-06-23 08:38:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(775455, 84791, 472, '<td valign="top">hmm .. nice effort. might have made more sense to have the kids faces in color since they are what''s important? instead of wjhat looks like a random flower abstract in the lower corner?</td>', 'hmm .. nice effort. might have made more sense to have the kids faces in color since they are what''s important? instead of wjhat looks like a random flower abstract in the lower corner?', '2004-06-23 08:39:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(775456, 84526, 472, '<td valign="top">this is awesome!  could be in a magazine.</td>', 'this is awesome!  could be in a magazine.', '2004-06-23 08:39:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(775458, 84351, 472, '<td valign="top">wow cool - that''s so weird, i''ve never seen that before.  hmm, i bet you are getting dinged for dof.  alot of people will think the shot oof because of the blurry abdomen.   too bad.  the orange eye and green bubble are a nice touch but i wonder how it would look if the eye was the only color. 9.</td>', 'wow cool - that''s so weird, i''ve never seen that before.  hmm, i bet you are getting dinged for dof.  alot of people will think the shot oof because of the blurry abdomen.   too bad.  the orange eye and green bubble are a nice touch but i wonder how it would look if the eye was the only color. 9.', '2004-06-23 08:40:47.000000', NULL, 1),
