(775555, 84896, 11738, '<td valign="top">This would have worked much better if you hadn`t painted the whole car blue.  Eliminate the tint on the windows, headlights, wheels and headlights and it would be better I think.  I gota a chance to drive one of these babies as a rental in Florida.  Sweet little car.</td>', 'This would have worked much better if you hadn`t painted the whole car blue.  Eliminate the tint on the windows, headlights, wheels and headlights and it would be better I think.  I gota a chance to drive one of these babies as a rental in Florida.  Sweet little car.', '2004-06-23 09:43:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(775561, 84575, 11738, '<td valign="top">This image looks weird.  The rflections on the background look nice but I can`t say the same for the glasses.  Did you simply desat the glasses or did you paint over them using a PS function?  I''m thinking the latter.  Good idea, but I would try reworking it.</td>', 'This image looks weird.  The rflections on the background look nice but I can`t say the same for the glasses.  Did you simply desat the glasses or did you paint over them using a PS function?  I''m thinking the latter.  Good idea, but I would try reworking it.', '2004-06-23 09:46:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(775576, 84826, 11738, '<td valign="top">The edge around the bird is way to sharp.  It looks like the bird was cut out of another picture and pasted into this one (not saying that you did that).  I would liked seeing just a bit more detail in the background.  It might have lessened the ffect I just mentioned about the bird.</td>', 'The edge around the bird is way to sharp.  It looks like the bird was cut out of another picture and pasted into this one (not saying that you did that).  I would liked seeing just a bit more detail in the background.  It might have lessened the ffect I just mentioned about the bird.', '2004-06-23 09:51:43.000000', NULL, 1),
