(775583, 84025, 11738, '<td valign="top">Well, we won`t be able to say that you picked an overly used subject matter!  So Ernie is a print head surfer, eh?  Never knew that.  Thanks for making me laugh.</td>', 'Well, we won`t be able to say that you picked an overly used subject matter!  So Ernie is a print head surfer, eh?  Never knew that.  Thanks for making me laugh.', '2004-06-23 09:54:45.000000', NULL, 1),
