(776416, 84769, 20235, '<td valign="top">I like this shot alot. The details and textures throughout are fantastic and the deep DOF through the window is great. I''m gonna step out on a limb here and pick this as one the top photos in this challenge.... 9</td>', 'I like this shot alot. The details and textures throughout are fantastic and the deep DOF through the window is great. I''m gonna step out on a limb here and pick this as one the top photos in this challenge.... 9', '2004-06-23 17:12:39.000000', NULL, 1),
