(776420, 84801, 20235, '<td valign="top">Great subject and composition. Your selected areas of desaturation really emphasize the feelings in this photo. The juxtaposition of the "artist" against the cold urban backdrop is nice..... 7</td>', 'Great subject and composition. Your selected areas of desaturation really emphasize the feelings in this photo. The juxtaposition of the "artist" against the cold urban backdrop is nice..... 7', '2004-06-23 17:16:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(776484, 84877, 16004, '<td valign="top">something awry seems to have happened in the bush area, giving the coloured selection a blue halo.  it''s also unclear as to why that certain bush has been selected to remain in colour - did you perhaps consider keeping the footprints in the sand in colour?  i do like the grainy feel of the image (such style is always welcome in my book) and the footprints are a lovely touch.  5.</td>', 'something awry seems to have happened in the bush area, giving the coloured selection a blue halo.  it''s also unclear as to why that certain bush has been selected to remain in colour - did you perhaps consider keeping the footprints in the sand in colour?  i do like the grainy feel of the image (such style is always welcome in my book) and the footprints are a lovely touch.  5.', '2004-06-23 17:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(776488, 84474, 18191, '<td valign="top">I like this idea a lot, but i think the color is a little bit too overpowering.</td>', 'I like this idea a lot, but i think the color is a little bit too overpowering.', '2004-06-23 17:41:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(776517, 83828, 18191, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract.</td>', 'Nice abstract.', '2004-06-23 17:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(776521, 84627, 18191, '<td valign="top">This is out of focus. Try manually focusing if you have a dSLR, and try not to rely on your first attempt of AF all the time...especially with close subjects such as this. A good concept though. Also, the eyes seem over saturated.</td>', 'This is out of focus. Try manually focusing if you have a dSLR, and try not to rely on your first attempt of AF all the time...especially with close subjects such as this. A good concept though. Also, the eyes seem over saturated.', '2004-06-23 17:49:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(776523, 84869, 259, '<td valign="top">the soft coloring fits nicely with the cat.  i tend to think of cats as warm and soft, and using bold coloring wouldn''t would as well.  so good choice.</td>', 'the soft coloring fits nicely with the cat.  i tend to think of cats as warm and soft, and using bold coloring wouldn''t would as well.  so good choice.', '2004-06-23 17:49:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(776529, 84315, 18191, '<td valign="top">I think the flower and the child are competing for attention and it is hard to look at this for too long. The concept is definitely there though. Maybe if some of the child''s features were in color, or if the desturation was the other way around, then this might have been a little bit stronger. Cute though!</td>', 'I think the flower and the child are competing for attention and it is hard to look at this for too long. The concept is definitely there though. Maybe if some of the child''s features were in color, or if the desturation was the other way around, then this might have been a little bit stronger. Cute though!', '2004-06-23 17:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(776536, 84608, 18191, '<td valign="top">hehe funny...very nice image as well...very good leading lines---I like I like!</td>', 'hehe funny...very nice image as well...very good leading lines---I like I like!', '2004-06-23 17:52:40.000000', NULL, 1),
