(776802, 84631, 259, '<td valign="top">i would recommend working on the lighting.  the top left corner is brighter than the lower right.  also, i might be seeing things, but it looks like there is a shadow of someone''s head too.  as far as the desaturation goes, it looks good.</td>', 'i would recommend working on the lighting.  the top left corner is brighter than the lower right.  also, i might be seeing things, but it looks like there is a shadow of someone''s head too.  as far as the desaturation goes, it looks good.', '2004-06-23 20:07:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(776809, 84383, 259, '<td valign="top">very good.  the blur looks like it might have been done in PS, but it still works very well.  one of the better shots this week.  if this were my pic, and i wanted to print it or do something more with it, i would clone out the two spots in the lower right section of the car (one on the bumper, and one just to the lower right corner of the brake lights).<br/> <br/>good use of desaturation too.</td>', 'very good.  the blur looks like it might have been done in PS, but it still works very well.  one of the better shots this week.  if this were my pic, and i wanted to print it or do something more with it, i would clone out the two spots in the lower right section of the car (one on the bumper, and one just to the lower right corner of the brake lights). good use of desaturation too.', '2004-06-23 20:11:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(776819, 84283, 259, '<td valign="top">one of the best shots.  if there were one small thing i would work on, it would be the green shoe strings.  they are the boldest and brightest part of the shot and compete with the boy''s face for attention.  toning them down would be a good idea i think.</td>', 'one of the best shots.  if there were one small thing i would work on, it would be the green shoe strings.  they are the boldest and brightest part of the shot and compete with the boy''s face for attention.  toning them down would be a good idea i think.', '2004-06-23 20:18:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(776834, 84650, 259, '<td valign="top">there seems to be a slight pink hue to the background and across the dog''s eyes.  the blue collar definetly sticks out on the black and white.  <br/> <br/>just random thinking.  in thinking of a reason why there is a slight pink hue, i remembered that my best friend is color blind and i know of people who can''t tell the difference between pink and white.  don''t take offense if this is not the case.  sometimes i throw off the wall comments out there.</td>', 'there seems to be a slight pink hue to the background and across the dog''s eyes.  the blue collar definetly sticks out on the black and white.   just random thinking.  in thinking of a reason why there is a slight pink hue, i remembered that my best friend is color blind and i know of people who can''t tell the difference between pink and white.  don''t take offense if this is not the case.  sometimes i throw off the wall comments out there.', '2004-06-23 20:27:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(776837, 84428, 259, '<td valign="top">nice black and white.  many of the shots seem to have overlooked the b&amp;w when concentrating on the color.</td>', 'nice black and white.  many of the shots seem to have overlooked the b&w when concentrating on the color.', '2004-06-23 20:28:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(776843, 84753, 259, '<td valign="top">creative.  milk''s not so white afterall</td>', 'creative.  milk''s not so white afterall', '2004-06-23 20:30:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(776866, 84631, 14656, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition but I''m not sure I like it. I feel as if this is another photo that does poorly with or without selective desat.</td>', 'Interesting composition but I''m not sure I like it. I feel as if this is another photo that does poorly with or without selective desat.', '2004-06-23 20:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(776870, 84745, 3575, '<td valign="top">Beautiful Photograph. I love it! The clarity is awsome and I love the subject matter. Nice desat job. Gorgeous horse. :)</td>', 'Beautiful Photograph. I love it! The clarity is awsome and I love the subject matter. Nice desat job. Gorgeous horse. :)', '2004-06-23 20:56:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(776875, 84026, 14656, '<td valign="top">Contrast appears a bit harsh and lighting overexposed. Not sure if it works for this photo. Also, I''m not sure if the shadowy grain on the right half of the face works as traditional portraits appear to be soft and flattering. Image appears soft overall with no definite sharpness other than the eyes, which are still not as sharp as I''d like them to be. I believe the flowers should''ve been sharper for this submission as coloring them still doesn''t take my attention and focus away from the model''s eyes.</td>', 'Contrast appears a bit harsh and lighting overexposed. Not sure if it works for this photo. Also, I''m not sure if the shadowy grain on the right half of the face works as traditional portraits appear to be soft and flattering. Image appears soft overall with no definite sharpness other than the eyes, which are still not as sharp as I''d like them to be. I believe the flowers should''ve been sharper for this submission as coloring them still doesn''t take my attention and focus away from the model''s eyes.', '2004-06-23 20:59:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(776877, 84204, 3575, '<td valign="top">Great idea. I love photos of musical instruments for the most part but there are a couple of problems with this, mainly the reflected items in the horn are distracting. I find that photographing anything reflective is real tricky, you don''t want to get burned out highlights and you don''t want unwanted reflections. Also I think that having at least one end of the horn in the composition would be nice. I think the overall the exposure and clarity is super.</td>', 'Great idea. I love photos of musical instruments for the most part but there are a couple of problems with this, mainly the reflected items in the horn are distracting. I find that photographing anything reflective is real tricky, you don''t want to get burned out highlights and you don''t want unwanted reflections. Also I think that having at least one end of the horn in the composition would be nice. I think the overall the exposure and clarity is super.', '2004-06-23 21:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(776878, 84916, 14656, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept although I find the heart on the t-shirt a bit distracting. It ties in nicely with the red theme but I think it would''ve done fine if it was desaturated as well. The red border looks fine on the bottom half of your image but looks a tad distracting going across the model''s face. My $.02</td>', 'Interesting concept although I find the heart on the t-shirt a bit distracting. It ties in nicely with the red theme but I think it would''ve done fine if it was desaturated as well. The red border looks fine on the bottom half of your image but looks a tad distracting going across the model''s face. My $.02', '2004-06-23 21:01:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(776881, 84840, 14656, '<td valign="top">Very interesting photo and composition but the amount of color in this submission is a bit too subtle to be effective imo.</td>', 'Very interesting photo and composition but the amount of color in this submission is a bit too subtle to be effective imo.', '2004-06-23 21:03:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(776882, 84381, 3575, '<td valign="top">Wonderful. Maybe just a little dark but that could be my monitor. A pleasure to view.</td>', 'Wonderful. Maybe just a little dark but that could be my monitor. A pleasure to view.', '2004-06-23 21:03:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(776885, 84836, 14656, '<td valign="top">I find the elements in the foreground (bars and fence) to be distracting. Selective desat did help to single this officer out, but it still is a rather uninteresting photo.</td>', 'I find the elements in the foreground (bars and fence) to be distracting. Selective desat did help to single this officer out, but it still is a rather uninteresting photo.', '2004-06-23 21:05:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(776886, 84282, 3575, '<td valign="top">Wow, what an awesome photograph. So emotional. I love the darkness, the graininess, and your saturation work. It is one of those I would like a lot better without any color but then that wouldn''t meet the challenge. 10 from me.</td>', 'Wow, what an awesome photograph. So emotional. I love the darkness, the graininess, and your saturation work. It is one of those I would like a lot better without any color but then that wouldn''t meet the challenge. 10 from me.', '2004-06-23 21:05:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(776891, 84889, 3575, '<td valign="top">First of all, this is a truly wonderful photo. I think it would benefit from a little contrast adjustment but it really is a terrific shot.</td>', 'First of all, this is a truly wonderful photo. I think it would benefit from a little contrast adjustment but it really is a terrific shot.', '2004-06-23 21:08:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(776895, 84743, 3575, '<td valign="top">That is a very rough sea. I wouldn''t want to be out there in that. I love the way you photographed this -- you brought the intensity of the waves up front. I would have liked the waves to be more in focus though. Well composed.</td>', 'That is a very rough sea. I wouldn''t want to be out there in that. I love the way you photographed this -- you brought the intensity of the waves up front. I would have liked the waves to be more in focus though. Well composed.', '2004-06-23 21:10:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(776896, 84428, 14656, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo with the butterfly in sharp focus (at least the top half). Interesting to choose the flowers to be colorized, I would''ve chosen the butterfly but that''s what makes this photo different. Selection of the flowers under the butterfly seems a bit "loose" as parts of the background were left out when desaturating.</td>', 'Beautiful photo with the butterfly in sharp focus (at least the top half). Interesting to choose the flowers to be colorized, I would''ve chosen the butterfly but that''s what makes this photo different. Selection of the flowers under the butterfly seems a bit "loose" as parts of the background were left out when desaturating.', '2004-06-23 21:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(776898, 84842, 14656, '<td valign="top">This image barely looks desaturated. The red rings around the lens don''t make the photo anymore interesting. Clever title, but I don''t think it helps the image. Focus seems a bit soft.</td>', 'This image barely looks desaturated. The red rings around the lens don''t make the photo anymore interesting. Clever title, but I don''t think it helps the image. Focus seems a bit soft.', '2004-06-23 21:12:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(776903, 84877, 3575, '<td valign="top">I feel so bad about the saturation problem on this shot. I love the sand, the layers, the footprints and the little trees. I''m sure you didn''t see the pale blue background on your green tree before you submitted the shot - I have done that before where I thought everything was perfect, and it was, on my monitor, and then I was told about problems that were obvious to everybody else. Hey, at least you gave a real nice original photo, right?</td>', 'I feel so bad about the saturation problem on this shot. I love the sand, the layers, the footprints and the little trees. I''m sure you didn''t see the pale blue background on your green tree before you submitted the shot - I have done that before where I thought everything was perfect, and it was, on my monitor, and then I was told about problems that were obvious to everybody else. Hey, at least you gave a real nice original photo, right?', '2004-06-23 21:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(776905, 84752, 14656, '<td valign="top">Nice attempt, but I don''t think the ladybug is brightly colored enough to scream attention or grab focus, even if everything else around it was selectively desaturated. Perhaps much more contrast of the floor, blowing out the highlights and.or overexposing it would help it to "pop out."<br/> <br/>Other than that, technically a good photo.</td>', 'Nice attempt, but I don''t think the ladybug is brightly colored enough to scream attention or grab focus, even if everything else around it was selectively desaturated. Perhaps much more contrast of the floor, blowing out the highlights and.or overexposing it would help it to "pop out." Other than that, technically a good photo.', '2004-06-23 21:20:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(776908, 84132, 3575, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot.</td>', 'Wonderful shot.', '2004-06-23 21:21:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(776910, 84542, 14656, '<td valign="top">Nice and sharp! You''ve found Nemo! Composition is a tad boring though being smack dab in the center, almost looks copy/paste. Perhaps offsetting the fish or having its tankmates (assuming there are other fish in there) in the frame as well would make it more interesting. Capturing the fish in midturn or feeding also helps to make the fish look more natural instead of a static image.</td>', 'Nice and sharp! You''ve found Nemo! Composition is a tad boring though being smack dab in the center, almost looks copy/paste. Perhaps offsetting the fish or having its tankmates (assuming there are other fish in there) in the frame as well would make it more interesting. Capturing the fish in midturn or feeding also helps to make the fish look more natural instead of a static image.', '2004-06-23 21:23:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(776913, 84556, 14656, '<td valign="top">I love this photo! Strong contrast, the lighting, the emotion.. very powerful. Excellent choice to leave the reflection in color, almost leaves you wondering which is reality. You should score highly with this photo, my pick for top3.</td>', 'I love this photo! Strong contrast, the lighting, the emotion.. very powerful. Excellent choice to leave the reflection in color, almost leaves you wondering which is reality. You should score highly with this photo, my pick for top3.', '2004-06-23 21:27:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(776915, 84791, 14656, '<td valign="top">Photos of other photos, is this allowed?<br/> <br/><i>Artwork. Literal photographic representations of the entirety of existing works of art (including your own) are not considered acceptable submissions, however creative depictions or interpretations of "art" are permissible. This includes, but is not limited to: paintings, sculptures, photographs, drawings, computer artwork, computer monitors, and televisions.</i></td>', 'Photos of other photos, is this allowed? Artwork. Literal photographic representations of the entirety of existing works of art (including your own) are not considered acceptable submissions, however creative depictions or interpretations of "art" are permissible. This includes, but is not limited to: paintings, sculptures, photographs, drawings, computer artwork, computer monitors, and televisions.', '2004-06-23 21:29:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(776917, 84860, 14656, '<td valign="top">Interesting that you included the shadow for color. Great lighting and strong contrast but I think what hurts this photo is a bit <i>too</i> shallow DOF. I''d like to see the entire grasshopper in focus, hind legs included.</td>', 'Interesting that you included the shadow for color. Great lighting and strong contrast but I think what hurts this photo is a bit too shallow DOF. I''d like to see the entire grasshopper in focus, hind legs included.', '2004-06-23 21:31:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(776919, 84926, 14656, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot! I would''ve slightly boosted saturation of the dragonfly. Excellent detail on the wings and body but would''ve liked to see the entire dragonfly in focus including wings in the foreground and tail end of the body.</td>', 'Beautiful shot! I would''ve slightly boosted saturation of the dragonfly. Excellent detail on the wings and body but would''ve liked to see the entire dragonfly in focus including wings in the foreground and tail end of the body.', '2004-06-23 21:36:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(776922, 84931, 14656, '<td valign="top">If graffiti is considered an art, would this violate one of the rules in depicting artwork of someone else? Or even if it were your own?</td>', 'If graffiti is considered an art, would this violate one of the rules in depicting artwork of someone else? Or even if it were your own?', '2004-06-23 21:38:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(776924, 84752, 23104, '<td valign="top">great photo</td>', 'great photo', '2004-06-23 21:40:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(776926, 84785, 14656, '<td valign="top">Nice and sharp image. Technically, it''s a good photo but composition leaves a little to be desired. I find it rather uninteresting.</td>', 'Nice and sharp image. Technically, it''s a good photo but composition leaves a little to be desired. I find it rather uninteresting.', '2004-06-23 21:41:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(776927, 84896, 259, '<td valign="top">i''m not so sure the total blue tint was the way to go.  the composition works well.  i kinda like the power lines on the left, however, i would clone out the ones above the car on the right.</td>', 'i''m not so sure the total blue tint was the way to go.  the composition works well.  i kinda like the power lines on the left, however, i would clone out the ones above the car on the right.', '2004-06-23 21:41:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(776929, 84068, 14656, '<td valign="top">Appears as if selective colors were desatured to supply this effect as there are still hints of color in the background (bluish tints) and the birds also look dull and have spots of gray. I''m sure the birds were more appealing in full color. Nice contrast but the perch near the bird''s tails seem a bit blown out.</td>', 'Appears as if selective colors were desatured to supply this effect as there are still hints of color in the background (bluish tints) and the birds also look dull and have spots of gray. I''m sure the birds were more appealing in full color. Nice contrast but the perch near the bird''s tails seem a bit blown out.', '2004-06-23 21:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(776935, 84286, 14656, '<td valign="top">Appears if you selectively desaturated colors to achieve this effect. It would''ve been a pain to manually select the bits of dirt between the grass behind the bench. Nice idea, but I think with so much brown from the dirt on the right half, it draws attention away from the bench.</td>', 'Appears if you selectively desaturated colors to achieve this effect. It would''ve been a pain to manually select the bits of dirt between the grass behind the bench. Nice idea, but I think with so much brown from the dirt on the right half, it draws attention away from the bench.', '2004-06-23 21:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(776936, 84819, 259, '<td valign="top">i like the wet leaves.  i''m not sure about the composition though.  a more unusual perspective would help create a more unique and interesting picture.</td>', 'i like the wet leaves.  i''m not sure about the composition though.  a more unusual perspective would help create a more unique and interesting picture.', '2004-06-23 21:47:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(776939, 84383, 14656, '<td valign="top">Beautiful machine and excellent photo! Is she yours? I think desaturating the white of the reverse light made the tailights appear dull. Perhaps you could''ve left the yellow and white of the reverse and blinkers?</td>', 'Beautiful machine and excellent photo! Is she yours? I think desaturating the white of the reverse light made the tailights appear dull. Perhaps you could''ve left the yellow and white of the reverse and blinkers?', '2004-06-23 21:51:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(776940, 84858, 259, '<td valign="top">really nice exposure.  the inside of the flower looks as good, if not better than the rest of the flower.  the only thing i would recommend would be a more unique perspective.  the perspective as it is, is pretty regular and looks like and everyday site.  as far as technical aspects go like the exposure and whatnot, you''ve done a really good job.</td>', 'really nice exposure.  the inside of the flower looks as good, if not better than the rest of the flower.  the only thing i would recommend would be a more unique perspective.  the perspective as it is, is pretty regular and looks like and everyday site.  as far as technical aspects go like the exposure and whatnot, you''ve done a really good job.', '2004-06-23 21:51:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(776942, 84682, 14656, '<td valign="top">I think too much of the background in focus and the butterfly not sharp enough. Also could''ve benefitted from a larger aperture, grass too distracting to bring my attention to the color of the butterfly.</td>', 'I think too much of the background in focus and the butterfly not sharp enough. Also could''ve benefitted from a larger aperture, grass too distracting to bring my attention to the color of the butterfly.', '2004-06-23 21:53:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(776943, 84793, 259, '<td valign="top">nice bright vibrant color.  i would recommend going from a normal perspective to a more unique one for added interest.</td>', 'nice bright vibrant color.  i would recommend going from a normal perspective to a more unique one for added interest.', '2004-06-23 21:54:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(776945, 83916, 14656, '<td valign="top">Selection around base of glass a bit loose, leaving part of the table still saturated. Nice composition, and the colors give me the sudden craving for watermelon.</td>', 'Selection around base of glass a bit loose, leaving part of the table still saturated. Nice composition, and the colors give me the sudden craving for watermelon.', '2004-06-23 21:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(776947, 84652, 14656, '<td valign="top">Appears to be an everyday snapshot.  Good practice in selective desat, but uninteresting subject and composition.</td>', 'Appears to be an everyday snapshot.  Good practice in selective desat, but uninteresting subject and composition.', '2004-06-23 21:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(776950, 84824, 259, '<td valign="top">i like the perspective</td>', 'i like the perspective', '2004-06-23 21:57:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(776951, 84608, 259, '<td valign="top">very nice b&amp;w, it''s nice to see a shot that didn''t ignore the b&amp;w aspect.  the tonal range is excellent.</td>', 'very nice b&w, it''s nice to see a shot that didn''t ignore the b&w aspect.  the tonal range is excellent.', '2004-06-23 21:58:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(776954, 84065, 259, '<td valign="top">great looking blue</td>', 'great looking blue', '2004-06-23 22:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(776960, 84904, 2158, '<td valign="top">I''d have desaturated the bike too as this way it draws attention away from the model.</td>', 'I''d have desaturated the bike too as this way it draws attention away from the model.', '2004-06-23 22:06:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(776963, 84026, 16775, '<td valign="top">thank you for not doing the eyes - 8</td>', 'thank you for not doing the eyes - 8', '2004-06-23 22:06:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(776964, 84833, 259, '<td valign="top">i like the people being part of the shot, but the two that are half in the shot on both sides would be better off either in or out.  i like the semi-panoramic crop too.</td>', 'i like the people being part of the shot, but the two that are half in the shot on both sides would be better off either in or out.  i like the semi-panoramic crop too.', '2004-06-23 22:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(776966, 84780, 16775, '<td valign="top">nice subtle coloring - off camera stare - i like it - 7</td>', 'nice subtle coloring - off camera stare - i like it - 7', '2004-06-23 22:08:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(776967, 84613, 19608, '<td valign="top">You have very vivid colors that work well together. Unfortunately the image is full of processing artifacts that destroy it.</td>', 'You have very vivid colors that work well together. Unfortunately the image is full of processing artifacts that destroy it.', '2004-06-23 22:10:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(776968, 84929, 14656, '<td valign="top">Beautiful garden, not sure if I find the bridge a strong subject of composition though.</td>', 'Beautiful garden, not sure if I find the bridge a strong subject of composition though.', '2004-06-23 22:10:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(776973, 84744, 19608, '<td valign="top">Ah - a deer''s eye view - and very effective.  I really like what you''ve tried here but think the image is pretty cluttered.  Especially bothersome is the OOF branch in the left foreground.</td>', 'Ah - a deer''s eye view - and very effective.  I really like what you''ve tried here but think the image is pretty cluttered.  Especially bothersome is the OOF branch in the left foreground.', '2004-06-23 22:13:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(776974, 84932, 14656, '<td valign="top">Gray area at top a bit excessive. Also desaturation doesn''t follow the line of the ceiling on the left side, seems a rather arbitrary cut off point. I''m sure a beautiful picture could''ve been produced here, just not photogenic at this angle or method of post processing.</td>', 'Gray area at top a bit excessive. Also desaturation doesn''t follow the line of the ceiling on the left side, seems a rather arbitrary cut off point. I''m sure a beautiful picture could''ve been produced here, just not photogenic at this angle or method of post processing.', '2004-06-23 22:13:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(776976, 84889, 259, '<td valign="top">good use of desaturation for sure.</td>', 'good use of desaturation for sure.', '2004-06-23 22:14:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(776978, 84866, 19608, '<td valign="top">A simple image with a nice feel about it.  Good desaturation work.  The top part of the image is not helping much - it seems to be to be better with it cropped into a square format by removing considerable from the top,  Border ok, but I''d remove it.</td>', 'A simple image with a nice feel about it.  Good desaturation work.  The top part of the image is not helping much - it seems to be to be better with it cropped into a square format by removing considerable from the top,  Border ok, but I''d remove it.', '2004-06-23 22:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(776979, 84702, 259, '<td valign="top">woa, that''s pretty cool.  i really like this twist on the challenge.</td>', 'woa, that''s pretty cool.  i really like this twist on the challenge.', '2004-06-23 22:16:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(776980, 84354, 14656, '<td valign="top">Strong contrast but image appears noisy and oversharpened (I''m sure it isn''t rain). Even with all the sharpening, it seems the umbrella wasn''t sharpened at all and seems soft. I would''ve done quite the opposite softening the background and sharpening the umbrella to further drive the point home. Even though the umbrella is in color, i''m drawn to the busy background and sharpness of everything else except the color of the umbrella.</td>', 'Strong contrast but image appears noisy and oversharpened (I''m sure it isn''t rain). Even with all the sharpening, it seems the umbrella wasn''t sharpened at all and seems soft. I would''ve done quite the opposite softening the background and sharpening the umbrella to further drive the point home. Even though the umbrella is in color, i''m drawn to the busy background and sharpness of everything else except the color of the umbrella.', '2004-06-23 22:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(776985, 84420, 259, '<td valign="top">the green and red work well together</td>', 'the green and red work well together', '2004-06-23 22:19:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(776986, 84489, 14656, '<td valign="top">A powerful image, especially where I live. Practically every turn in the road or pole has a memorial where someone died, either a person driving, or walking alongside of the road.<br/> <br/>The pole and electrical box on the right side is a little distracting and could''ve been cropped a bit closer to the pink cross.</td>', 'A powerful image, especially where I live. Practically every turn in the road or pole has a memorial where someone died, either a person driving, or walking alongside of the road. The pole and electrical box on the right side is a little distracting and could''ve been cropped a bit closer to the pink cross.', '2004-06-23 22:19:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(776987, 84917, 19608, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what you are telling me with this desaturization.  You''ve done a good job on the model, but I really don''t like the grass.  I''d also suggest you don''t place your subjects dead center, unless there''s a reallly good reason to do so.</td>', 'I''m not sure what you are telling me with this desaturization.  You''ve done a good job on the model, but I really don''t like the grass.  I''d also suggest you don''t place your subjects dead center, unless there''s a reallly good reason to do so.', '2004-06-23 22:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(776989, 84790, 14656, '<td valign="top">Nice and sharp, no pun intended! Crisp, vibrant colors but the bell pepper almost seems cut/paste onto a white background. Looks too good to be real. ;)</td>', 'Nice and sharp, no pun intended! Crisp, vibrant colors but the bell pepper almost seems cut/paste onto a white background. Looks too good to be real. ;)', '2004-06-23 22:21:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(776990, 84878, 19608, '<td valign="top">The red eye-shape is very nice - but the entire rest of the picture is so OOF that it''s pretty hard to relate.</td>', 'The red eye-shape is very nice - but the entire rest of the picture is so OOF that it''s pretty hard to relate.', '2004-06-23 22:22:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(776997, 84877, 19608, '<td valign="top">You started with a great image - the tracks in the sand are great, composition is very nice, DoF is perfect.  But, having said that, the method you used to leave color on the one plant made a big mess of things.  It appears way too saturated and has a bluish halo around it.</td>', 'You started with a great image - the tracks in the sand are great, composition is very nice, DoF is perfect.  But, having said that, the method you used to leave color on the one plant made a big mess of things.  It appears way too saturated and has a bluish halo around it.', '2004-06-23 22:25:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(776999, 84543, 14656, '<td valign="top">Image is in excellent focus but lacks any white, other than a few speckles of the eyes. In other words, the image is too neutral lacking any highlights. The current image looks perfect when autoleveled and given maybe +10 on saturation in PS.<br/> <br/>Nice attempt, but it feels as if it''s a work in progress and not yet complete. Just autolevel and the image jumps right out at you!</td>', 'Image is in excellent focus but lacks any white, other than a few speckles of the eyes. In other words, the image is too neutral lacking any highlights. The current image looks perfect when autoleveled and given maybe +10 on saturation in PS. Nice attempt, but it feels as if it''s a work in progress and not yet complete. Just autolevel and the image jumps right out at you!', '2004-06-23 22:26:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(777002, 84025, 19608, '<td valign="top">Bright colors and interesting, but it does not do much for me.</td>', 'Bright colors and interesting, but it does not do much for me.', '2004-06-23 22:26:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(777005, 84759, 259, '<td valign="top">i think a more unique perspective would produce a more interesting picture.  red was a good choice for desaturation.</td>', 'i think a more unique perspective would produce a more interesting picture.  red was a good choice for desaturation.', '2004-06-23 22:28:13.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(777007, 84762, 19608, '<td valign="top">I like the soft purpole and the waterdrops - but can''t really relate to what you are telling me.</td>', 'I like the soft purpole and the waterdrops - but can''t really relate to what you are telling me.', '2004-06-23 22:28:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(777008, 84541, 14656, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast and great focus. Composition leaves a little to be desired. Personally, I would''ve taken this shot 2 or 3 steps to the left to "seperate" the posts a little. I think this would work great as b&amp;w but the blue feels out of place here.</td>', 'Nice contrast and great focus. Composition leaves a little to be desired. Personally, I would''ve taken this shot 2 or 3 steps to the left to "seperate" the posts a little. I think this would work great as b&w but the blue feels out of place here.', '2004-06-23 22:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(777014, 84282, 14656, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting and expression. The colors somehow don''t match to be a real tattoo and almost seem electric or glowing. Nice crop too, but I would''ve left a tad more space on the left side. Seems a bit close to his left hand.</td>', 'Excellent lighting and expression. The colors somehow don''t match to be a real tattoo and almost seem electric or glowing. Nice crop too, but I would''ve left a tad more space on the left side. Seems a bit close to his left hand.', '2004-06-23 22:31:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(777015, 84776, 19608, '<td valign="top">Great idea and execution.  Composition is very effective,  My biggest problem with your submission is the overpowering border,  It (the border) has the richest blacks and whitest whites - so it really draws attention.  Without any border - the viewer would be drawn more to the oovely rainbow.</td>', 'Great idea and execution.  Composition is very effective,  My biggest problem with your submission is the overpowering border,  It (the border) has the richest blacks and whitest whites - so it really draws attention.  Without any border - the viewer would be drawn more to the oovely rainbow.', '2004-06-23 22:31:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(777019, 84647, 259, '<td valign="top">really good use of the challenge, and very nice perspective too.</td>', 'really good use of the challenge, and very nice perspective too.', '2004-06-23 22:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(777021, 84546, 19608, '<td valign="top">Your selective desaturization is nicely done.  But I really want to see the person''s face!  The background appears a but "muddy" with all middle values - no strong blacks or whites.</td>', 'Your selective desaturization is nicely done.  But I really want to see the person''s face!  The background appears a but "muddy" with all middle values - no strong blacks or whites.', '2004-06-23 22:35:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(777023, 83785, 14656, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot and composition. Certain areas seem a bit overexposed though, such as the bottom left and the post on the right side of the hole. An image like this should feel dark and dreary but this feels bright and cheery.</td>', 'Beautiful shot and composition. Certain areas seem a bit overexposed though, such as the bottom left and the post on the right side of the hole. An image like this should feel dark and dreary but this feels bright and cheery.', '2004-06-23 22:35:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(777025, 84197, 19608, '<td valign="top">Effective use of the color - works very well.  Good focus, good exposure.</td>', 'Effective use of the color - works very well.  Good focus, good exposure.', '2004-06-23 22:36:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(777026, 84834, 259, '<td valign="top">nice use of the challenge.  the only thing i would recommend is to increase the contrast just a tad.</td>', 'nice use of the challenge.  the only thing i would recommend is to increase the contrast just a tad.', '2004-06-23 22:36:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(777028, 84662, 19608, '<td valign="top">Good use of the color.  Your image is very centered which doesn''t help make it really interesting.</td>', 'Good use of the color.  Your image is very centered which doesn''t help make it really interesting.', '2004-06-23 22:37:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(777029, 83785, 259, '<td valign="top">i like your choice of what to leave colored</td>', 'i like your choice of what to leave colored', '2004-06-23 22:38:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(777030, 84627, 14656, '<td valign="top">Image a bit too soft on the focus which I believe was caused by impoper focus (shot without macro) and camera shaking while shutter depressing or model moving or any combination of the above. This photo also lacks any white, you''ve established black and gray values but there are no highlights. The area you chose to keep color is dark as well and from far away or a quick glance, there would appear to be no color at all.</td>', 'Image a bit too soft on the focus which I believe was caused by impoper focus (shot without macro) and camera shaking while shutter depressing or model moving or any combination of the above. This photo also lacks any white, you''ve established black and gray values but there are no highlights. The area you chose to keep color is dark as well and from far away or a quick glance, there would appear to be no color at all.', '2004-06-23 22:38:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(777031, 84890, 19608, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice use of the pastel colors, but I''m afraid it''s not too exciting for me.</td>', 'It''s a nice use of the pastel colors, but I''m afraid it''s not too exciting for me.', '2004-06-23 22:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(777034, 84583, 19608, '<td valign="top">RED!  It really jumps out at you in the black and white image.  Composition is pleasing.</td>', 'RED!  It really jumps out at you in the black and white image.  Composition is pleasing.', '2004-06-23 22:41:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(777035, 84795, 14656, '<td valign="top">Nice use of gaussian blue to decrease the DOF. The remaining colors are dull, and the pose is unimaginative. Even though the model may be "photogenic," this snapshot type photo lacks any creativity or artistic value.<br/> <br/>A brightly psychedellic colored tie-dye shirt may have been more effective, the colors here are just too warm.</td>', 'Nice use of gaussian blue to decrease the DOF. The remaining colors are dull, and the pose is unimaginative. Even though the model may be "photogenic," this snapshot type photo lacks any creativity or artistic value. A brightly psychedellic colored tie-dye shirt may have been more effective, the colors here are just too warm.', '2004-06-23 22:42:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(777036, 84769, 259, '<td valign="top">good choice of what to leave color</td>', 'good choice of what to leave color', '2004-06-23 22:43:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(777037, 84588, 19608, '<td valign="top">Very crisp and clean.  Using the diagonal lines in your background is a great touch, as is the area you left in color.  Not happy with the border.</td>', 'Very crisp and clean.  Using the diagonal lines in your background is a great touch, as is the area you left in color.  Not happy with the border.', '2004-06-23 22:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(777042, 84826, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice subject and great portrait with the catchlight in the eye,  Composition very nice.  Perfect f-stop - keeping the subject area in sharp focus while blurring out the background.</td>', 'Nice subject and great portrait with the catchlight in the eye,  Composition very nice.  Perfect f-stop - keeping the subject area in sharp focus while blurring out the background.', '2004-06-23 22:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(777044, 84092, 19608, '<td valign="top">Wow - pink!  A classic shot - well executed.</td>', 'Wow - pink!  A classic shot - well executed.', '2004-06-23 22:47:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(777047, 84283, 19608, '<td valign="top">Cute and well done - perhaps a bit too centered.  Subtle colors work as you wanted.</td>', 'Cute and well done - perhaps a bit too centered.  Subtle colors work as you wanted.', '2004-06-23 22:48:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(777050, 84207, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice setting, lovely model. It may be a bit better if the model looked more involved - either by doing something or by looking at the camera.</td>', 'Nice setting, lovely model. It may be a bit better if the model looked more involved - either by doing something or by looking at the camera.', '2004-06-23 22:50:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(777054, 84178, 19608, '<td valign="top">The eyes are great - as is the entire left side of the image.  But the bright white on the right side really takes over, not what you wanted.<br/> <br/></td>', 'The eyes are great - as is the entire left side of the image.  But the bright white on the right side really takes over, not what you wanted. ', '2004-06-23 22:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(777058, 84591, 19608, '<td valign="top">You have an excellent compositiion and have exposed it very well.  It has a nice "country" feel to it.  I can''t decide if I would like it better with either the sign or the yellow line in color, but not both.  A very minor annoyance is the 2 white dots on the left edge (headlights?)  Strong submission that should do well.</td>', 'You have an excellent compositiion and have exposed it very well.  It has a nice "country" feel to it.  I can''t decide if I would like it better with either the sign or the yellow line in color, but not both.  A very minor annoyance is the 2 white dots on the left edge (headlights?)  Strong submission that should do well.', '2004-06-23 22:56:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(777061, 84829, 19608, '<td valign="top">I resally like the lighting and your use of the vertical blinds - it really makes the leaves stand out nicely.  It''s a simple effective image.</td>', 'I resally like the lighting and your use of the vertical blinds - it really makes the leaves stand out nicely.  It''s a simple effective image.', '2004-06-23 22:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(777065, 83785, 8624, '<td valign="top">nice job with the bricks, but the blown highlights are very distracting. I can see how this shot would be a tough one to get an even tonal range on, given the very dark area in shadow.</td>', 'nice job with the bricks, but the blown highlights are very distracting. I can see how this shot would be a tough one to get an even tonal range on, given the very dark area in shadow.', '2004-06-23 23:00:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(777071, 84608, 19608, '<td valign="top">The print quality is right on.  Bright crisp whites and dark blacks - with plenty of tonal range between.  Everything else works too - focus,  composition, and the desaturization.  If it were mine - I would not use the white line as part of the border.</td>', 'The print quality is right on.  Bright crisp whites and dark blacks - with plenty of tonal range between.  Everything else works too - focus,  composition, and the desaturization.  If it were mine - I would not use the white line as part of the border.', '2004-06-23 23:02:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(777072, 84146, 8624, '<td valign="top">Good choice of subject. I think this would have been stronger had you boosted the red saturation  to really make the berries pop.</td>', 'Good choice of subject. I think this would have been stronger had you boosted the red saturation  to really make the berries pop.', '2004-06-23 23:03:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(777074, 84871, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice idea - the theme and apple are great.  I''d like it better if your model was interacting with you more.  Nice exposure and rendering.</td>', 'Nice idea - the theme and apple are great.  I''d like it better if your model was interacting with you more.  Nice exposure and rendering.', '2004-06-23 23:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(777075, 84779, 19608, '<td valign="top">Just a hint of color works very well.  May be a buit stronger if there was more spavce in front of the egret.</td>', 'Just a hint of color works very well.  May be a buit stronger if there was more spavce in front of the egret.', '2004-06-23 23:05:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(777076, 84556, 8624, '<td valign="top">great title. wonderful image. your tones are excellent and the composition is very striking</td>', 'great title. wonderful image. your tones are excellent and the composition is very striking', '2004-06-23 23:05:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(777078, 84680, 19608, '<td valign="top">Unusual perspective that works well.  Not sure, but it may be stronger with jsut one of the umbrellas in color.</td>', 'Unusual perspective that works well.  Not sure, but it may be stronger with jsut one of the umbrellas in color.', '2004-06-23 23:06:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(777083, 84769, 19608, '<td valign="top">A study in textures very well done!  Exposure and focus on the building is perfect with a strong tonal range.  It looks like you may have removed some of the color in the green backgroud - which was a goiod choice.  As it is - it adds to the image - if it were bright green it would draw the viewer away from the great textures.</td>', 'A study in textures very well done!  Exposure and focus on the building is perfect with a strong tonal range.  It looks like you may have removed some of the color in the green backgroud - which was a goiod choice.  As it is - it adds to the image - if it were bright green it would draw the viewer away from the great textures.', '2004-06-23 23:10:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(777088, 84830, 19608, '<td valign="top">Wow - the blue eyes really sparkle - an exceptional pface and portrait.  I would suggest however that you remove the books next time - especially the bright ones.<br/>(Try to imagine what it would look like with just a dark area behind the models head.)</td>', 'Wow - the blue eyes really sparkle - an exceptional pface and portrait.  I would suggest however that you remove the books next time - especially the bright ones.(Try to imagine what it would look like with just a dark area behind the models head.)', '2004-06-23 23:12:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(777092, 84851, 19608, '<td valign="top">Beautiful face and eyes.  The lighting was not really your frind - many very bright areas in the featheres detract.</td>', 'Beautiful face and eyes.  The lighting was not really your frind - many very bright areas in the featheres detract.', '2004-06-23 23:13:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(777104, 84752, 20235, '<td valign="top">Great subject and composition. The DOF and your use of selective desaturation really emphasize the title and theme .... 7</td>', 'Great subject and composition. The DOF and your use of selective desaturation really emphasize the title and theme .... 7', '2004-06-23 23:19:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(777111, 84926, 20235, '<td valign="top">Fantastic detail and DOF! The background looks great against hte subject..... 7</td>', 'Fantastic detail and DOF! The background looks great against hte subject..... 7', '2004-06-23 23:22:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(777114, 84930, 20235, '<td valign="top">Great use of the desaturation to emphasize the subject and title. The dark background works well too. As a thought, maybe the spilled jelly beans could have taken more of the compostion by placing some on the table and cropping further back? Nice shot nonetheless.... 7</td>', 'Great use of the desaturation to emphasize the subject and title. The dark background works well too. As a thought, maybe the spilled jelly beans could have taken more of the compostion by placing some on the table and cropping further back? Nice shot nonetheless.... 7', '2004-06-23 23:24:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(777139, 84859, 11800, '<td valign="top">That''s my friends favorite poem. I like how the title really ties in with the photo and you did the technique properly. It seems to me that the exposure was off or there was too much post processing done. The grays in the foreground are dull and the water and other bank are overexposed. If I was working on this one, I would have created a duplicate layer and erased the woman and the foreground (or created a mask) and blended the light portions with a multiply mode. That would have at least given a more even tonal value to the picture. But then again, what am I thinking?</td>', 'That''s my friends favorite poem. I like how the title really ties in with the photo and you did the technique properly. It seems to me that the exposure was off or there was too much post processing done. The grays in the foreground are dull and the water and other bank are overexposed. If I was working on this one, I would have created a duplicate layer and erased the woman and the foreground (or created a mask) and blended the light portions with a multiply mode. That would have at least given a more even tonal value to the picture. But then again, what am I thinking?', '2004-06-23 23:36:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(777142, 84717, 11800, '<td valign="top">Very well taken picture. Nice clarity and tonal range.<br/>Sorry, but green is the essence of that name. It ain''t a jd unless it''s green.</td>', 'Very well taken picture. Nice clarity and tonal range.Sorry, but green is the essence of that name. It ain''t a jd unless it''s green.', '2004-06-23 23:43:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(777145, 84702, 19608, '<td valign="top">I love the idea here!  It''s one of the most intriguing uses of selective desat in the group.  It is also appropriate that you put the farmland in green and the city in grayscales.   Exposure right on, composition ok (but i''d prefer the river - and therefore the entire scene -a bit more diagonal.)  This should finish within sight of ribbonsville.</td>', 'I love the idea here!  It''s one of the most intriguing uses of selective desat in the group.  It is also appropriate that you put the farmland in green and the city in grayscales.   Exposure right on, composition ok (but i''d prefer the river - and therefore the entire scene -a bit more diagonal.)  This should finish within sight of ribbonsville.', '2004-06-23 23:43:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(777146, 84922, 19608, '<td valign="top">Very unusual and graphic,  almost an ad for a taxi company.  Compositon, exposure  great.</td>', 'Very unusual and graphic,  almost an ad for a taxi company.  Compositon, exposure  great.', '2004-06-23 23:45:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(777147, 84925, 19608, '<td valign="top">Good find and effective use of the color.  The top left corner of your image is very bothersome as it is so bright and demanding.</td>', 'Good find and effective use of the color.  The top left corner of your image is very bothersome as it is so bright and demanding.', '2004-06-23 23:46:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(777149, 84567, 19608, '<td valign="top">This slim Jim presentation works well for the image.  Good seeing with the red roof in front of the dark treeline.  Excellent composition.</td>', 'This slim Jim presentation works well for the image.  Good seeing with the red roof in front of the dark treeline.  Excellent composition.', '2004-06-23 23:47:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(777154, 84017, 19608, '<td valign="top">I like the idea  - and the bottom half of the image works very well by itself.  But unfortunately, as soon as you add the bald bright sky at the top left, it becomes unmanageable.  The selective desat appears to be very well done.</td>', 'I like the idea  - and the bottom half of the image works very well by itself.  But unfortunately, as soon as you add the bald bright sky at the top left, it becomes unmanageable.  The selective desat appears to be very well done.', '2004-06-23 23:50:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(777159, 84770, 1368, '<td valign="top">This is just awesome, composition, edeting and all Just beautiful! - 10</td>', 'This is just awesome, composition, edeting and all Just beautiful! - 10', '2004-06-23 23:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(777161, 84751, 19608, '<td valign="top">Wow - and it even has a stove / heater.  This is a very intriguing image (Iceland?).<br/>Composition is right on as is the exposure.  Althought it''s not that visually interesting to me - the desolation of the scene makes me keep looking.  A strong submission.</td>', 'Wow - and it even has a stove / heater.  This is a very intriguing image (Iceland?).Composition is right on as is the exposure.  Althought it''s not that visually interesting to me - the desolation of the scene makes me keep looking.  A strong submission.', '2004-06-23 23:53:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(777162, 84556, 11800, '<td valign="top">I like this one. It looks like the water is giving them their substance while the b/w gives them a dangerous and gloomy appearance.</td>', 'I like this one. It looks like the water is giving them their substance while the b/w gives them a dangerous and gloomy appearance.', '2004-06-23 23:54:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(777166, 84026, 1368, '<td valign="top">Good high key lighting,  just wish the background was balanced with it , its a great picture though :) - 9</td>', 'Good high key lighting,  just wish the background was balanced with it , its a great picture though :) - 9', '2004-06-23 23:55:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(777167, 83979, 19608, '<td valign="top">A very compellling child -  and nice portrait.  The whitest, brightest areas on both sides at the top compete for attention - which is unfortunate.  It''s a very good example of selective desat.</td>', 'A very compellling child -  and nice portrait.  The whitest, brightest areas on both sides at the top compete for attention - which is unfortunate.  It''s a very good example of selective desat.', '2004-06-23 23:56:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(777168, 84627, 1368, '<td valign="top">Could mabey have been better if you had the whole eye in the frame and the picture a little sharper, good luck :)</td>', 'Could mabey have been better if you had the whole eye in the frame and the picture a little sharper, good luck :)', '2004-06-23 23:57:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(777174, 84770, 19608, '<td valign="top">A very striking image.  I would normally complain about the centered image - but since you ''ve placed the person on the left edge, it''s not a problem at all!  The sky is great and your choices for selective desat are excellent.</td>', 'A very striking image.  I would normally complain about the centered image - but since you ''ve placed the person on the left edge, it''s not a problem at all!  The sky is great and your choices for selective desat are excellent.', '2004-06-24 00:00:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(777175, 84857, 19608, '<td valign="top">A very appealing portraint - it works well fo demonstrate selective desat.</td>', 'A very appealing portraint - it works well fo demonstrate selective desat.', '2004-06-24 00:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(777177, 84556, 1368, '<td valign="top">This shot is truly amazing  the sky looks good, I think it could have been a little darker though, the ship looks awesome and the reflection, the blue color is great, I  would be a fool if I would give this less than a 10, Good luck :)</td>', 'This shot is truly amazing  the sky looks good, I think it could have been a little darker though, the ship looks awesome and the reflection, the blue color is great, I  would be a fool if I would give this less than a 10, Good luck :)', '2004-06-24 00:03:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(777178, 84509, 19608, '<td valign="top">I like it!  Good exposure, composition and DoF.  The red really stands out and adds to the feel of it.</td>', 'I like it!  Good exposure, composition and DoF.  The red really stands out and adds to the feel of it.', '2004-06-24 00:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(777180, 84488, 19608, '<td valign="top">A nice macro that does indeed show selective desat.  It doesn''t really grab me though.</td>', 'A nice macro that does indeed show selective desat.  It doesn''t really grab me though.', '2004-06-24 00:04:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(777181, 84608, 1368, '<td valign="top">This shot is just toooo cool, I absoulutely love it, I will be mad if  this doesnt get a ribbon, the is nothing wrong with this, its just the way its supposed to be, So all I can say is good luck :) - 10</td>', 'This shot is just toooo cool, I absoulutely love it, I will be mad if  this doesnt get a ribbon, the is nothing wrong with this, its just the way its supposed to be, So all I can say is good luck :) - 10', '2004-06-24 00:05:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(777182, 84752, 19608, '<td valign="top">Exploration!  A very intriguing composition and perfect focal point.</td>', 'Exploration!  A very intriguing composition and perfect focal point.', '2004-06-24 00:06:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(777183, 84743, 19608, '<td valign="top">It has a nice feel to it.  Here''s my suggestions to make it stronger.  1) The boat isnn''t centered, but I''d like to see it a bit further left in the frame. 2) Did you try leaving the sky grayscale - it mat work better, and 3) The border pulls me away from the scene.</td>', 'It has a nice feel to it.  Here''s my suggestions to make it stronger.  1) The boat isnn''t centered, but I''d like to see it a bit further left in the frame. 2) Did you try leaving the sky grayscale - it mat work better, and 3) The border pulls me away from the scene.', '2004-06-24 00:08:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(777186, 84854, 20925, '<td valign="top">Wow!  I think this is the only entry that chose to desat the subject.  I wish I''d thought of it.  :^)  Great subject and expression, very nice desat effect.  One of my favorites for this challenge.  Gotta love that slobber.</td>', 'Wow!  I think this is the only entry that chose to desat the subject.  I wish I''d thought of it.  :^)  Great subject and expression, very nice desat effect.  One of my favorites for this challenge.  Gotta love that slobber.', '2004-06-24 00:10:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(777191, 84877, 20925, '<td valign="top">Hmm.  I like the subject and the composition of the shot, but the selective desaturation method you used isn''t really working for me.  I assume you did a rough selection intentionally, but I don''t think it adds.  I had been toying with the idea of a rough cut on the color for my entry but I couldn''t get any pics to come out right.  Would love to see this one done with a tight selection on maybe all three plants.</td>', 'Hmm.  I like the subject and the composition of the shot, but the selective desaturation method you used isn''t really working for me.  I assume you did a rough selection intentionally, but I don''t think it adds.  I had been toying with the idea of a rough cut on the color for my entry but I couldn''t get any pics to come out right.  Would love to see this one done with a tight selection on maybe all three plants.', '2004-06-24 00:15:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(777197, 84842, 20925, '<td valign="top">You''ve got (or borrowed) some nice lenses there.  And, I AM red with envy.  :P  But, c''mon!  With at least $2,500 worth of L glass, this is the pic you submitted?  Good luck anyway!  :^)</td>', 'You''ve got (or borrowed) some nice lenses there.  And, I AM red with envy.  :P  But, c''mon!  With at least $2,500 worth of L glass, this is the pic you submitted?  Good luck anyway!  :^)', '2004-06-24 00:22:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(777198, 84650, 20925, '<td valign="top">I like this shot.  I have a friend with a Lab/Greyhound (we think) mix who looks very, very similar - up until recently she even had the same collar.  My only issue with the shot for the challenge is I can just make out a rectangle of color around the eyes.  It''s distracting, and I''d bet the shot would look much better with a tighter selection around the eyes.</td>', 'I like this shot.  I have a friend with a Lab/Greyhound (we think) mix who looks very, very similar - up until recently she even had the same collar.  My only issue with the shot for the challenge is I can just make out a rectangle of color around the eyes.  It''s distracting, and I''d bet the shot would look much better with a tighter selection around the eyes.', '2004-06-24 00:31:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(777199, 84893, 19708, '<td valign="top">Great composition &amp; choice for this challenge!<br/>Nice job on acheiving the photographic-quality B &amp; W portion!</td>', 'Great composition & choice for this challenge!Nice job on acheiving the photographic-quality B & W portion!', '2004-06-24 00:34:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(777200, 84891, 19708, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of high contrast.<br/>Shame a little more of the grey couldn''t be washed out behind the eyelashes, but we can only get away with so much...<br/>Nice job!</td>', 'Excellent use of high contrast.Shame a little more of the grey couldn''t be washed out behind the eyelashes, but we can only get away with so much...Nice job!', '2004-06-24 00:37:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(777202, 84485, 20925, '<td valign="top">Smooth.  I love the milky, luminescent skin tones.  At first glance, I thought the watermelon saturation might have been boosted a little too much, but it really does manage to jump off the screen while still looking totally natural in his hands.  This is one of my top picks for the challenge.  Would love to find out your B/W workflow for this shot after the challenge.</td>', 'Smooth.  I love the milky, luminescent skin tones.  At first glance, I thought the watermelon saturation might have been boosted a little too much, but it really does manage to jump off the screen while still looking totally natural in his hands.  This is one of my top picks for the challenge.  Would love to find out your B/W workflow for this shot after the challenge.', '2004-06-24 00:37:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(777208, 84627, 20925, '<td valign="top">This could have been an interesting shot for me.  I like the eyes and skin, but the focus/camera shake kills it for me.  Maybe it was a choice you made, but I''m betting if you could have upped the shutter speed a little bit this might have been a much better shot.</td>', 'This could have been an interesting shot for me.  I like the eyes and skin, but the focus/camera shake kills it for me.  Maybe it was a choice you made, but I''m betting if you could have upped the shutter speed a little bit this might have been a much better shot.', '2004-06-24 00:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(777217, 84339, 20925, '<td valign="top">Crisp and clean.  The leaf just looks so alive in contrast to the deadness of the background.  I''d probably prefer a slightly different framing, but who cares.  One of my top picks.</td>', 'Crisp and clean.  The leaf just looks so alive in contrast to the deadness of the background.  I''d probably prefer a slightly different framing, but who cares.  One of my top picks.', '2004-06-24 00:45:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(777225, 84327, 20925, '<td valign="top">I''m assuming you got a lot of comments on the post-processing, so I won''t add to that.  :^)  I like the tight shot of the eyes, but the expression on the face makes me think you had your model staring into the sun for hours and hours.  (ouch!)  I might have tried for a tighter crop and maybe a more dramatic angle.</td>', 'I''m assuming you got a lot of comments on the post-processing, so I won''t add to that.  :^)  I like the tight shot of the eyes, but the expression on the face makes me think you had your model staring into the sun for hours and hours.  (ouch!)  I might have tried for a tighter crop and maybe a more dramatic angle.', '2004-06-24 00:49:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(777232, 84770, 20925, '<td valign="top">At first glance, this shot is a little busy for me, but as I look at it more, it almost seems like I can peer around the obstacles and look deeper in to the shot.  Very interesting lines and great capture of motion.  I''m raising my score after looking again to comment.  Good luck!</td>', 'At first glance, this shot is a little busy for me, but as I look at it more, it almost seems like I can peer around the obstacles and look deeper in to the shot.  Very interesting lines and great capture of motion.  I''m raising my score after looking again to comment.  Good luck!', '2004-06-24 00:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(777237, 84869, 3080, '<td valign="top">I like where you placed the cat within the frame of the photo.  The little splash of color is really nice.  I''m thinking though, how it would look with JUST the eyes in color.  They are piercing eyes really, and they are a slight greenish color on my comp, unless it''s just my eyes playing tricks on me, since my computer is green. lol.  Anyway, I''m staring at the eyes, and the nose is then a bit of a distraction.  Focus and clarity are great, and the lighting and tonal range looks good to me as well.  Very nicely done.  ~Heather~</td>', 'I like where you placed the cat within the frame of the photo.  The little splash of color is really nice.  I''m thinking though, how it would look with JUST the eyes in color.  They are piercing eyes really, and they are a slight greenish color on my comp, unless it''s just my eyes playing tricks on me, since my computer is green. lol.  Anyway, I''m staring at the eyes, and the nose is then a bit of a distraction.  Focus and clarity are great, and the lighting and tonal range looks good to me as well.  Very nicely done.  ~Heather~', '2004-06-24 00:55:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(777242, 84931, 3080, '<td valign="top">While this does fit the challenge perfectly, I''m not really feeling any wow here.  Focus and clarity are good, and lighting is alright, and the angle and framing are ok too.  Just not drawn in and kept there.  Technically, it is a good photo, but not my cup of tea. ~Heather~</td>', 'While this does fit the challenge perfectly, I''m not really feeling any wow here.  Focus and clarity are good, and lighting is alright, and the angle and framing are ok too.  Just not drawn in and kept there.  Technically, it is a good photo, but not my cup of tea. ~Heather~', '2004-06-24 00:57:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(777246, 84912, 4338, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition and the cropping, but the womans face has a litle too much of a glow / hot spot on the left cheek,</td>', 'I really like the composition and the cropping, but the womans face has a litle too much of a glow / hot spot on the left cheek,', '2004-06-24 00:59:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(777247, 83979, 3080, '<td valign="top">The area to the left of his eyes, is distracting.  Everything else around him is light colored, then the black shapes to the left really stand out.  Moreso than his eyes I''m afraid.   Looks like the lighting is a bit harsh on his shirt to the right of the photo, and a bit dark on his forhead.  focus and clarity are good, and I like the detail. ~Heather~</td>', 'The area to the left of his eyes, is distracting.  Everything else around him is light colored, then the black shapes to the left really stand out.  Moreso than his eyes I''m afraid.   Looks like the lighting is a bit harsh on his shirt to the right of the photo, and a bit dark on his forhead.  focus and clarity are good, and I like the detail. ~Heather~', '2004-06-24 00:59:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(777248, 84761, 3080, '<td valign="top">Very bright.  The color really makes your subject stand out of the background.  Nothing distracting there.  Focus and clarity are good, and the little water droplets really add some interest to the shot for sure.  I like how the flower is ''facing'' the left, and your border looks alright to me.  It''s not strong enough to distract from the subject, it''s subtle.  I like it! ~Heather~</td>', 'Very bright.  The color really makes your subject stand out of the background.  Nothing distracting there.  Focus and clarity are good, and the little water droplets really add some interest to the shot for sure.  I like how the flower is ''facing'' the left, and your border looks alright to me.  It''s not strong enough to distract from the subject, it''s subtle.  I like it! ~Heather~', '2004-06-24 01:01:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(777251, 84860, 4338, '<td valign="top">I like the desat job on this, keeping the color on the leaf was well done in just the shadow. but for my personal taste the foreground is too hot</td>', 'I like the desat job on this, keeping the color on the leaf was well done in just the shadow. but for my personal taste the foreground is too hot', '2004-06-24 01:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(777252, 84930, 3080, '<td valign="top">I''m loving this shot.  My only wish were that it were a bit lighter in the front.  Focus and clarity are supurb!  Nice crisp lines.  The centered placement is good for your subject in this case.  I don''t mind it at all.  The selective color is perfect, and it has overall appeal to me.  My only complaint is the darkness in the front.  Wish I could see more there.  Otherwise, wonderful! ~Heather~</td>', 'I''m loving this shot.  My only wish were that it were a bit lighter in the front.  Focus and clarity are supurb!  Nice crisp lines.  The centered placement is good for your subject in this case.  I don''t mind it at all.  The selective color is perfect, and it has overall appeal to me.  My only complaint is the darkness in the front.  Wish I could see more there.  Otherwise, wonderful! ~Heather~', '2004-06-24 01:04:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(777254, 84176, 4338, '<td valign="top">i feel the outline of the bird has too much of a hard line where you used the selection tool. Maybe try a softer edge next time to reduce the effect of the selection tool. not sure which program you used, but there should be an option for "soft edge"</td>', 'i feel the outline of the bird has too much of a hard line where you used the selection tool. Maybe try a softer edge next time to reduce the effect of the selection tool. not sure which program you used, but there should be an option for "soft edge"', '2004-06-24 01:07:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(777255, 84509, 3080, '<td valign="top">Beautiful subject!  I love guitar photos of all kinds.  My brain wants to make this a vertical crop though, showing the head of the person.  You decapitated him.  Focus and clarity are good, and lighting really creates a mood.  I think you did a nice job of keeping background elements subtle and out of the way.  The desaturation helps that too. ~Heather~</td>', 'Beautiful subject!  I love guitar photos of all kinds.  My brain wants to make this a vertical crop though, showing the head of the person.  You decapitated him.  Focus and clarity are good, and lighting really creates a mood.  I think you did a nice job of keeping background elements subtle and out of the way.  The desaturation helps that too. ~Heather~', '2004-06-24 01:07:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(777259, 84428, 4338, '<td valign="top">very nice. I like the angle of the butterfly in the shot. framing/ cropping is nice also.  The butterfly looks real sharp. There looks to be a few hard lines aroud the red flowers that the selection tool missed. Im sure it wil make a very nice print</td>', 'very nice. I like the angle of the butterfly in the shot. framing/ cropping is nice also.  The butterfly looks real sharp. There looks to be a few hard lines aroud the red flowers that the selection tool missed. Im sure it wil make a very nice print', '2004-06-24 01:11:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(777260, 84210, 3080, '<td valign="top">Yup, it is.  While I think you did a good job technically here, I''m not really drawn into the photo.  It''s a pic of a ball on the ground.  Had it been in color, I''m afraid I wouldn''t have found it exciting either.  The focus and clarity are good, lighting appears to be good, and you have placed the ball near the bottom right, and that placement is good.  You did everything right, but it''s just not my cup of tea.  ~Heather~</td>', 'Yup, it is.  While I think you did a good job technically here, I''m not really drawn into the photo.  It''s a pic of a ball on the ground.  Had it been in color, I''m afraid I wouldn''t have found it exciting either.  The focus and clarity are good, lighting appears to be good, and you have placed the ball near the bottom right, and that placement is good.  You did everything right, but it''s just not my cup of tea.  ~Heather~', '2004-06-24 01:11:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(777261, 84917, 19708, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what your intent was in this. Did you plan on leaving all the green "coloring outside the lines" trails?<br/>It looks like you may have to calibrate your monitor to me.<br/>Have you looked at this shot on someone else''s monitor?</td>', 'I don''t know what your intent was in this. Did you plan on leaving all the green "coloring outside the lines" trails?It looks like you may have to calibrate your monitor to me.Have you looked at this shot on someone else''s monitor?', '2004-06-24 01:14:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(777262, 84204, 3080, '<td valign="top">the reflections in the bell are a bit distracting.  Also, I''m wondering if you might have found a more interesting crop.  Focus and clarity are good, and the background contains no distracting elements.  The lighting is making some shadows near the bottom right, that maybe could have been fixed with a bit of side light.  Overall, I think you did a nice job. ~Heather~</td>', 'the reflections in the bell are a bit distracting.  Also, I''m wondering if you might have found a more interesting crop.  Focus and clarity are good, and the background contains no distracting elements.  The lighting is making some shadows near the bottom right, that maybe could have been fixed with a bit of side light.  Overall, I think you did a nice job. ~Heather~', '2004-06-24 01:14:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(777264, 84296, 4338, '<td valign="top">my firt reaction was WTF, but after looking at it I can see this is a much different approach than what most would have done. GREAT IDEA !!!  A few of the blocks look like they have some not so finished lines around them.</td>', 'my firt reaction was WTF, but after looking at it I can see this is a much different approach than what most would have done. GREAT IDEA !!!  A few of the blocks look like they have some not so finished lines around them.', '2004-06-24 01:15:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(777265, 84923, 4338, '<td valign="top">the glass in the back is really nice, but to me the glass and jewerly in the fore ground a bit distracting</td>', 'the glass in the back is really nice, but to me the glass and jewerly in the fore ground a bit distracting', '2004-06-24 01:16:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(777266, 84791, 3080, '<td valign="top">I feel like I should be grading the photos IN the photo rather than the photo itself, so I will try hard not to do that.  The photo OF the photos is ok.  Focus seems ok, lighting seems ok, other than the small shadow behind the upper left of the picture frame.  The desat is nice.  I like the purple amid the black and white.  All that being said...cute photos! :) ~Heather~</td>', 'I feel like I should be grading the photos IN the photo rather than the photo itself, so I will try hard not to do that.  The photo OF the photos is ok.  Focus seems ok, lighting seems ok, other than the small shadow behind the upper left of the picture frame.  The desat is nice.  I like the purple amid the black and white.  All that being said...cute photos! :) ~Heather~', '2004-06-24 01:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(777275, 84339, 4338, '<td valign="top">very clear and sharp and a nice job on the desat</td>', 'very clear and sharp and a nice job on the desat', '2004-06-24 01:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(777281, 84339, 10268, '<td valign="top">So simple, yet elegantly beautiful.<br/> <br/>Awesome focus, and great use of the desaturation.  I originally gave this a 7, but I''m bumping it up to a 9.</td>', 'So simple, yet elegantly beautiful. Awesome focus, and great use of the desaturation.  I originally gave this a 7, but I''m bumping it up to a 9.', '2004-06-24 01:39:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(777287, 84485, 10268, '<td valign="top">Ah, this one just makes me smile.<br/> <br/>The boy on the left has the greatest expression.<br/> <br/>Very cute, and great colors. 8.</td>', 'Ah, this one just makes me smile. The boy on the left has the greatest expression. Very cute, and great colors. 8.', '2004-06-24 01:41:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(777352, 84824, 18349, '<td valign="top">I find this fascinating...I like how you are showing something that is sort of mundane and everyday in such a new way.  Great angle; love the blue.  Nice image! ;o)</td>', 'I find this fascinating...I like how you are showing something that is sort of mundane and everyday in such a new way.  Great angle; love the blue.  Nice image! ;o)', '2004-06-24 02:30:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(777355, 84146, 18349, '<td valign="top">I like the approach you have taken with this shot.  I do believe that it could use a boost in the saturation of the reds.  Maybe a slight change in composition...placing the strawberries more in the left corner, giving more of a view of the shapes of the other fruits so that they aren''t quite as abstract might add some emphasis on the berries themselves as they pop off the screen in red.  I know I''m rambling, but that was what kind of jumped out at me.  Good shot, could be a little more powerful.  :o)</td>', 'I like the approach you have taken with this shot.  I do believe that it could use a boost in the saturation of the reds.  Maybe a slight change in composition...placing the strawberries more in the left corner, giving more of a view of the shapes of the other fruits so that they aren''t quite as abstract might add some emphasis on the berries themselves as they pop off the screen in red.  I know I''m rambling, but that was what kind of jumped out at me.  Good shot, could be a little more powerful.  :o)', '2004-06-24 02:37:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(777372, 84546, 18349, '<td valign="top">I really like this image, and I can''t explain why.  That doesn''t make any sense, does it?  ;o)  I love the yellow and the composition is nice.  The contrasts are great.</td>', 'I really like this image, and I can''t explain why.  That doesn''t make any sense, does it?  ;o)  I love the yellow and the composition is nice.  The contrasts are great.', '2004-06-24 02:47:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(777472, 84917, 9906, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice of what to desat and what not.  I personally don''t care for it.  I think it would have worked better if the dogs were not desaturated and you framed them in the green also.<br/>TC</td>', 'Interesting choice of what to desat and what not.  I personally don''t care for it.  I think it would have worked better if the dogs were not desaturated and you framed them in the green also.TC', '2004-06-24 04:08:36.000000', NULL, 1),
