(777485, 84543, 9906, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp shot of the cat!  Love the detail in the fur.  It''s hard to get that close with a cat shot (especially if you let the flash fire the first time....  I can''t get near my cat with a camera now...)  Don''t think the desat really adds to the shot though...<br/>TC</td>', 'Nice sharp shot of the cat!  Love the detail in the fur.  It''s hard to get that close with a cat shot (especially if you let the flash fire the first time....  I can''t get near my cat with a camera now...)  Don''t think the desat really adds to the shot though...TC', '2004-06-24 04:13:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(777486, 84312, 6130, '<td valign="top">Fun and natural.</td>', 'Fun and natural.', '2004-06-24 04:13:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(777487, 84026, 11518, '<td valign="top">I didn''t like this picture when I first saw it.  But when I went back to it and studied it some more it kinda grew on me.  The processing which I found to be overwhelming at first now seems  to make sense, emphasizing the hypnotic eyes of the model.  Good job, I''m changing my 5 to a 7</td>', 'I didn''t like this picture when I first saw it.  But when I went back to it and studied it some more it kinda grew on me.  The processing which I found to be overwhelming at first now seems  to make sense, emphasizing the hypnotic eyes of the model.  Good job, I''m changing my 5 to a 7', '2004-06-24 04:14:34.000000', NULL, 1),
