(777499, 84770, 9906, '<td valign="top">I like the shot overall.  Lovely use of leading lines to draw your eye to the center, but the colors that are left are distracting and IMHO not where the eye is meant to be drawn to.<br/>TC</td>', 'I like the shot overall.  Lovely use of leading lines to draw your eye to the center, but the colors that are left are distracting and IMHO not where the eye is meant to be drawn to.TC', '2004-06-24 04:22:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(777500, 84899, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  The only thing I would have done different would be to desat the shoes and clone out the light spot at the top of the shot (at about 11 o''clock).  Makes me feel like a voyeuer...<br/>TC</td>', 'Very nice!  The only thing I would have done different would be to desat the shoes and clone out the light spot at the top of the shot (at about 11 o''clock).  Makes me feel like a voyeuer...TC', '2004-06-24 04:24:49.000000', NULL, 1),
