(777504, 84296, 9906, '<td valign="top">Just my humble opinion, but this looks gimmicky to me.  Kind of hokey.  I like the b/w part.  You have nice tonal range there.  The yellow eye brick works too!  You lose me with the off centered, left in color border.<br/>TC</td>', 'Just my humble opinion, but this looks gimmicky to me.  Kind of hokey.  I like the b/w part.  You have nice tonal range there.  The yellow eye brick works too!  You lose me with the off centered, left in color border.TC', '2004-06-24 04:30:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(777513, 84889, 9906, '<td valign="top">Makes me want to make up a story!<br/>TC</td>', 'Makes me want to make up a story!TC', '2004-06-24 04:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
