(777524, 84474, 9809, '<td valign="top">I would like to see this photo with her lips and maybe eyes still colored as well as the maple leaf and earring. I also wish the hair wasn''t blocking the earring. The wisp of hair between the leaf and earring is perfect by itself.</td>', 'I would like to see this photo with her lips and maybe eyes still colored as well as the maple leaf and earring. I also wish the hair wasn''t blocking the earring. The wisp of hair between the leaf and earring is perfect by itself.', '2004-06-24 04:43:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(777526, 84485, 9906, '<td valign="top">This is the first of all the desat shots I''ve seen in this challenge that made me stop and say ''Wow!''  It seems to have a reason.  It tells a story!  I can taste and the mellon and feel the joy!  Kudo''s and good luck in the challenge.  I''m gonna jinx ya and say top five!<br/>TC</td>', 'This is the first of all the desat shots I''ve seen in this challenge that made me stop and say ''Wow!''  It seems to have a reason.  It tells a story!  I can taste and the mellon and feel the joy!  Kudo''s and good luck in the challenge.  I''m gonna jinx ya and say top five!TC', '2004-06-24 04:44:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(777529, 84859, 9906, '<td valign="top">Way to overexposed to make a great b/w shot.  To do GREAT b/w you need to expose so that you have good highlites.  Here the highlights are blown out...<br/>TC</td>', 'Way to overexposed to make a great b/w shot.  To do GREAT b/w you need to expose so that you have good highlites.  Here the highlights are blown out...TC', '2004-06-24 04:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(777530, 84847, 9809, '<td valign="top">HA! Very unique and a great image. The soft focus even works for this shot -- I wonder what others say about the focus... I guess I''ll check later. This would be better if you''d dropped all the green and desaturated all colors but the red. The lady in red (lower right) raises the rating by at least 2 points. One of my favorites in this challenge.</td>', 'HA! Very unique and a great image. The soft focus even works for this shot -- I wonder what others say about the focus... I guess I''ll check later. This would be better if you''d dropped all the green and desaturated all colors but the red. The lady in red (lower right) raises the rating by at least 2 points. One of my favorites in this challenge.', '2004-06-24 04:48:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(777531, 84197, 9906, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp shot of the cat!  Love the detail in the fur.  It''s hard to get that close with a cat shot (especially if you let the flash fire the first time....  I can''t get near my cat with a camera now...)  Don''t think the desat really adds to the shot though...<br/>TC</td>', 'Nice sharp shot of the cat!  Love the detail in the fur.  It''s hard to get that close with a cat shot (especially if you let the flash fire the first time....  I can''t get near my cat with a camera now...)  Don''t think the desat really adds to the shot though...TC', '2004-06-24 04:51:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(777533, 84428, 9809, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen several butterflies in this challenge where everything but the butterfly was desaturated. What is it they are trying to say? Here, you''ve left the flower with a title of "Attraction." GREAT!!! The title emphasizes the point of the photo. I could see this as a poster with the title printed across the top of the photo in that negative space (I know this is illegal for the challenge -- I''m just making a suggestion for a future print). Great DOF and nicely cropped. Maybe not a winner, but should make top 10 IMHO.</td>', 'I''ve seen several butterflies in this challenge where everything but the butterfly was desaturated. What is it they are trying to say? Here, you''ve left the flower with a title of "Attraction." GREAT!!! The title emphasizes the point of the photo. I could see this as a poster with the title printed across the top of the photo in that negative space (I know this is illegal for the challenge -- I''m just making a suggestion for a future print). Great DOF and nicely cropped. Maybe not a winner, but should make top 10 IMHO.', '2004-06-24 04:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(777535, 84560, 9906, '<td valign="top">Out of curiousity, why did you leave the un-opened flower at 2 o''clock in color?  It almost imediately draws my eye away from the subject...<br/>TC</td>', 'Out of curiousity, why did you leave the un-opened flower at 2 o''clock in color?  It almost imediately draws my eye away from the subject...TC', '2004-06-24 04:53:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(777536, 84859, 9809, '<td valign="top">HA! Looks like my Aunt Vi! Except that hat would also be purple.</td>', 'HA! Looks like my Aunt Vi! Except that hat would also be purple.', '2004-06-24 04:54:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(777537, 84893, 9906, '<td valign="top">Wow I can hear the sound of her hitting the dirt.  If I close my eyes I can see her running up to the starting line,  hear her gasp as her muscles launch her up into the air, see her stretch for the distance, then...<br/>TC</td>', 'Wow I can hear the sound of her hitting the dirt.  If I close my eyes I can see her running up to the starting line,  hear her gasp as her muscles launch her up into the air, see her stretch for the distance, then...TC', '2004-06-24 04:56:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(777544, 84769, 9906, '<td valign="top">I wanna leave a comment, but all that comes to my mind now is, ''Wow!''<br/>Sorry it''s not a helpfull comment...  ;-)<br/>TC</td>', 'I wanna leave a comment, but all that comes to my mind now is, ''Wow!''Sorry it''s not a helpfull comment...  ;-)TC', '2004-06-24 05:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(777545, 84588, 19959, '<td valign="top">excellent.</td>', 'excellent.', '2004-06-24 05:02:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(777566, 84630, 14656, '<td valign="top">Boring subject. Interesting angle and perspective, but that could be applied to any image. The angle or selective desat still doesn''t improve this photo.</td>', 'Boring subject. Interesting angle and perspective, but that could be applied to any image. The angle or selective desat still doesn''t improve this photo.', '2004-06-24 05:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(777567, 84878, 14656, '<td valign="top">Pretty creepy but 80% of this photo is blurred foreground which is very distracting.</td>', 'Pretty creepy but 80% of this photo is blurred foreground which is very distracting.', '2004-06-24 05:26:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(777571, 84743, 14656, '<td valign="top">Horizon looks slightly tilted. I think this would still be an uninteresting photo, even in full color.</td>', 'Horizon looks slightly tilted. I think this would still be an uninteresting photo, even in full color.', '2004-06-24 05:27:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(777574, 84485, 14656, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp focus and strong contrast! That juicy watermelon sure looks good right about now :)</td>', 'Nice sharp focus and strong contrast! That juicy watermelon sure looks good right about now :)', '2004-06-24 05:29:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(777578, 84901, 14656, '<td valign="top">I suppose the pink was desaturated to the grayish white? That stray yellow dot at 1 o''clock adds a little chaos to the image, some may like it, some may not. Personally, I think it adds some interest to the picture. Other than that, the background may be dull, but it helps contrast the flower petals nicely.</td>', 'I suppose the pink was desaturated to the grayish white? That stray yellow dot at 1 o''clock adds a little chaos to the image, some may like it, some may not. Personally, I think it adds some interest to the picture. Other than that, the background may be dull, but it helps contrast the flower petals nicely.', '2004-06-24 05:31:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(777583, 84706, 14656, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, you really got in there up close and personal. Would''ve liked a tad sharper focus on the ladybug, seems that thing it''s sitting on stole the focus.</td>', 'Nice composition, you really got in there up close and personal. Would''ve liked a tad sharper focus on the ladybug, seems that thing it''s sitting on stole the focus.', '2004-06-24 05:33:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(777639, 84761, 11738, '<td valign="top">Nice job!  I like that the background is just ever so slightly out of focus and that the bud are still quite clear.  Good job in retaining the flower''s colour.  The water droplets really add interest to this shot.  I''m not sure if I like that border or not, but not scoring you down for it.</td>', 'Nice job!  I like that the background is just ever so slightly out of focus and that the bud are still quite clear.  Good job in retaining the flower''s colour.  The water droplets really add interest to this shot.  I''m not sure if I like that border or not, but not scoring you down for it.', '2004-06-24 07:36:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(777641, 84744, 11738, '<td valign="top">Interesting play on the challenge topic.  One of the more subdued entries, which I think many more should have been.  I''m guessing at the weapon: Enfield L85A1?  So this would make it a British soldier?  Don''t mind me... too many video games.  You''ve done a very good job here.  I like how you didn''t desaturate the gun and the hand, although you''ve accidently erased the colour on his wrist.  One of my favourites!  Good luck!</td>', 'Interesting play on the challenge topic.  One of the more subdued entries, which I think many more should have been.  I''m guessing at the weapon: Enfield L85A1?  So this would make it a British soldier?  Don''t mind me... too many video games.  You''ve done a very good job here.  I like how you didn''t desaturate the gun and the hand, although you''ve accidently erased the colour on his wrist.  One of my favourites!  Good luck!', '2004-06-24 07:48:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(777642, 84776, 11738, '<td valign="top">Good rainbow shot but I find that yellowish part under it takes away from the shot.  I realize that it wasn''t the same colour as the sky, but leaving just the raindow itself would have been more visually appealing.  I really like how you framed the rainbow using the branches.</td>', 'Good rainbow shot but I find that yellowish part under it takes away from the shot.  I realize that it wasn''t the same colour as the sky, but leaving just the raindow itself would have been more visually appealing.  I really like how you framed the rainbow using the branches.', '2004-06-24 07:52:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(777644, 84836, 11738, '<td valign="top">Ach laddy, stop or I''ll say Ach again!!  <br/> <br/>Does he keep his handcuffs in his sporrrrrrrran?<br/> <br/>I had no idea that police officers could dress ths way for active duty.  Too bad this shot is so busy since the subject matter is definitely interesting.  Did you consider asking him if you could take his picture in a better setting?</td>', 'Ach laddy, stop or I''ll say Ach again!!   Does he keep his handcuffs in his sporrrrrrrran? I had no idea that police officers could dress ths way for active duty.  Too bad this shot is so busy since the subject matter is definitely interesting.  Did you consider asking him if you could take his picture in a better setting?', '2004-06-24 07:57:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(777649, 84132, 11738, '<td valign="top">This is a funny shot!  The first thing that came to mind was "Mine?  Mine?  Mine?  Mine?" a la Finding Nemo.  Great work on capturing the pose.</td>', 'This is a funny shot!  The first thing that came to mind was "Mine?  Mine?  Mine?  Mine?" a la Finding Nemo.  Great work on capturing the pose.', '2004-06-24 08:05:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(777654, 84185, 11738, '<td valign="top">Love the dark tones of this shot.  Bug pictures are often too brightly lit for my taste.  I also love how you shot shows depth and how the butterfly is clearly focussed.  Good work.  Among my favourites for this challenge.</td>', 'Love the dark tones of this shot.  Bug pictures are often too brightly lit for my taste.  I also love how you shot shows depth and how the butterfly is clearly focussed.  Good work.  Among my favourites for this challenge.', '2004-06-24 08:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(777656, 84893, 11738, '<td valign="top">My #1 pick for this challenge.  Excellent capture and love the dark tones of this shot.  Your timing is exquisite, capturing this athlete in a very interesting moment.  Your choice of crop also compliments the shot very nicely.</td>', 'My #1 pick for this challenge.  Excellent capture and love the dark tones of this shot.  Your timing is exquisite, capturing this athlete in a very interesting moment.  Your choice of crop also compliments the shot very nicely.', '2004-06-24 08:13:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(777658, 84899, 11738, '<td valign="top">Interesting image with sex appeal.  However, I find that the red is a tad overbearing, just a bit to harsh.  Could have been toned down just a tad.  What is that white blob near the top left portion of the photo?  That would have been so easy to clone out.</td>', 'Interesting image with sex appeal.  However, I find that the red is a tad overbearing, just a bit to harsh.  Could have been toned down just a tad.  What is that white blob near the top left portion of the photo?  That would have been so easy to clone out.', '2004-06-24 08:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(777662, 84776, 16004, '<td valign="top">first off, nice job on the desat part of the picture - extracting colour from something with no real clearly defined edge must have been something of a bugger.   i do like very much how you have the rainbow in between the trees, i think that is quite arty and nicely composed.  what i''m not so impressed with is the house and cars in the foreground - it appears a bit more woody further up the street, and i think standing there might have been more in keeping with the shot.   similarly, you could try cloning the trees in the background and covering the house with them.  however, choice of subject is perfect, and to my eyes, it''s a shot nicely executed.</td>', 'first off, nice job on the desat part of the picture - extracting colour from something with no real clearly defined edge must have been something of a bugger.   i do like very much how you have the rainbow in between the trees, i think that is quite arty and nicely composed.  what i''m not so impressed with is the house and cars in the foreground - it appears a bit more woody further up the street, and i think standing there might have been more in keeping with the shot.   similarly, you could try cloning the trees in the background and covering the house with them.  however, choice of subject is perfect, and to my eyes, it''s a shot nicely executed.', '2004-06-24 08:30:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(777665, 84787, 10705, '<td valign="top">I like this photo, but I think I would have like it more if just the tree leaves were green.</td>', 'I like this photo, but I think I would have like it more if just the tree leaves were green.', '2004-06-24 08:42:35.000000', NULL, 1),
