(777673, 84065, 10705, '<td valign="top">Nice image ... the trees showing through the back window are still green, tho.</td>', 'Nice image ... the trees showing through the back window are still green, tho.', '2004-06-24 08:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(777676, 84509, 10705, '<td valign="top">Nice</td>', 'Nice', '2004-06-24 08:54:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(777678, 84315, 10705, '<td valign="top">very cute.  I think the bright yellow is just a little overpowering.  Still very nice photo, tho.</td>', 'very cute.  I think the bright yellow is just a little overpowering.  Still very nice photo, tho.', '2004-06-24 08:57:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(777681, 84886, 10705, '<td valign="top">very cute photo!</td>', 'very cute photo!', '2004-06-24 09:00:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(777682, 84889, 10705, '<td valign="top">Balloons and a unicycle ... perfect combination!</td>', 'Balloons and a unicycle ... perfect combination!', '2004-06-24 09:00:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(777719, 84569, 16004, '<td valign="top">gotta ask really, did you do any post photo taking edittting, or are all the colours natural?  if that is straight out the camera, then i think it''s great.  if it''s editting, i think it''s even greater because the sharpness of the edge of colour, and the shades of the green is terrifically well done.  great take on the challenge.  9.</td>', 'gotta ask really, did you do any post photo taking edittting, or are all the colours natural?  if that is straight out the camera, then i think it''s great.  if it''s editting, i think it''s even greater because the sharpness of the edge of colour, and the shades of the green is terrifically well done.  great take on the challenge.  9.', '2004-06-24 09:53:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(777721, 84542, 23430, '<td valign="top">Looks good</td>', 'Looks good', '2004-06-24 09:54:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(777722, 84575, 16004, '<td valign="top">the white wine looks a bit green, really, but overall there are parts of this i really like.  i think the light in the shadow and reflections are very lovely, and reasonably well captured.  i think it''s a bit of a pity that the glasses are not still transluscent, as this might have been more effective.  similarly, did you try to position the glasses in a way that the projected shadows match better - for example, there is a entimeter gap between the stem and the shadow on the right, but no gap on the left.   just seems a little bit unbalanced.  5.</td>', 'the white wine looks a bit green, really, but overall there are parts of this i really like.  i think the light in the shadow and reflections are very lovely, and reasonably well captured.  i think it''s a bit of a pity that the glasses are not still transluscent, as this might have been more effective.  similarly, did you try to position the glasses in a way that the projected shadows match better - for example, there is a entimeter gap between the stem and the shadow on the right, but no gap on the left.   just seems a little bit unbalanced.  5.', '2004-06-24 09:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(777724, 84334, 16004, '<td valign="top">takes a bit of thought to fully appreciate what''s going on here.  i''ve got it now, but initially my thoughts were "eh?".  i''m slightly worried the more speedy voters might pass over a bit too quickly.  the capture of the rainbow is grand, though perhaps if you stood up (apologies if you''re a dwarf) it would be less obscured by the dead pole?  also, i would have left the devesation in monochrome - i personally think it might be more symbolic if the peace after the storm was the only thing in colour (and what glorious colour it is - it''s bright and lovely) .  interesting and novel concept though.  7.</td>', 'takes a bit of thought to fully appreciate what''s going on here.  i''ve got it now, but initially my thoughts were "eh?".  i''m slightly worried the more speedy voters might pass over a bit too quickly.  the capture of the rainbow is grand, though perhaps if you stood up (apologies if you''re a dwarf) it would be less obscured by the dead pole?  also, i would have left the devesation in monochrome - i personally think it might be more symbolic if the peace after the storm was the only thing in colour (and what glorious colour it is - it''s bright and lovely) .  interesting and novel concept though.  7.', '2004-06-24 10:02:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(777729, 84339, 10047, '<td valign="top">Awesome capture. Well done. Contrast and clarity are exceptional. Nice 3D effect.</td>', 'Awesome capture. Well done. Contrast and clarity are exceptional. Nice 3D effect.', '2004-06-24 10:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(777730, 84744, 10047, '<td valign="top">Exceptional! Well done. Very creative.</td>', 'Exceptional! Well done. Very creative.', '2004-06-24 10:09:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(777731, 84474, 10047, '<td valign="top">Well done. Attractive model. Excellent clarity and composition.</td>', 'Well done. Attractive model. Excellent clarity and composition.', '2004-06-24 10:11:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(777732, 84751, 16004, '<td valign="top">the brightness or contrast (one of those things) of the hut seems out of synch with the rest.  perhaps if the land around the hut was made darker it would seem more at one (or do you have PS?  try selecting the land and play with curves by doing left end down and right end up).  it''s a pity because i feel the composition, subject matter and the environment is all totally brilliant, and this is one of the most can-hang-on-a-wall shots submitted this week.  Selective desat is totally suitable here.  8.</td>', 'the brightness or contrast (one of those things) of the hut seems out of synch with the rest.  perhaps if the land around the hut was made darker it would seem more at one (or do you have PS?  try selecting the land and play with curves by doing left end down and right end up).  it''s a pity because i feel the composition, subject matter and the environment is all totally brilliant, and this is one of the most can-hang-on-a-wall shots submitted this week.  Selective desat is totally suitable here.  8.', '2004-06-24 10:11:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(777734, 84745, 10047, '<td valign="top">Excellent. Nice effect.</td>', 'Excellent. Nice effect.', '2004-06-24 10:12:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(777737, 84569, 10047, '<td valign="top">Good clarity and contrast. Excellent green color.</td>', 'Good clarity and contrast. Excellent green color.', '2004-06-24 10:13:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(777744, 84840, 14414, '<td valign="top">i like it, but perhaps its a little less effective given that the rock would be a grey-ish colour anyway</td>', 'i like it, but perhaps its a little less effective given that the rock would be a grey-ish colour anyway', '2004-06-24 10:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(777820, 84906, 9411, '<td valign="top">Stunning image, very abstract in nature, but with enough recognizable elements to carry us along with the sailors.   9</td>', 'Stunning image, very abstract in nature, but with enough recognizable elements to carry us along with the sailors.   9', '2004-06-24 11:28:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(777826, 84899, 9411, '<td valign="top">No kidding!,, this is creative and well done. There is one little bit of something at the top that is distracting. The colour is a bit over the top.. With the title I was expecting Red.. This views as flourescent orange to me. I think if the colour had been a little less extreme I could have voted higher. Still nicely done.</td>', 'No kidding!,, this is creative and well done. There is one little bit of something at the top that is distracting. The colour is a bit over the top.. With the title I was expecting Red.. This views as flourescent orange to me. I think if the colour had been a little less extreme I could have voted higher. Still nicely done.', '2004-06-24 11:32:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(777828, 84779, 9411, '<td valign="top">Lovely image of this wonderful bird. Unfortunately there is little colour showing to get the desaturation theme across. All I see is a wee bit of yellow around the eye, I would hope for a stronger colour element.  This would be a stunning completely black and white shot.</td>', 'Lovely image of this wonderful bird. Unfortunately there is little colour showing to get the desaturation theme across. All I see is a wee bit of yellow around the eye, I would hope for a stronger colour element.  This would be a stunning completely black and white shot.', '2004-06-24 11:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(777834, 84840, 9411, '<td valign="top">Wow,, great perspective. This image has a lot going for it.   But, I''m afraid that for this challenge, I find there is not enough impact of the remaining colour to make a really strong statement.  Possibly if you had composed the shot to have the flowers fill more of the frame.  As it stands this would be stunning as  full black and white. 6</td>', 'Wow,, great perspective. This image has a lot going for it.   But, I''m afraid that for this challenge, I find there is not enough impact of the remaining colour to make a really strong statement.  Possibly if you had composed the shot to have the flowers fill more of the frame.  As it stands this would be stunning as  full black and white. 6', '2004-06-24 11:40:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(777841, 84327, 9411, '<td valign="top">Creative composition. I find that the over saturated appearing eyes do not work as well as a more natural colour would.  The whites, to me, should be white, not blue.</td>', 'Creative composition. I find that the over saturated appearing eyes do not work as well as a more natural colour would.  The whites, to me, should be white, not blue.', '2004-06-24 11:43:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(777850, 84176, 10047, '<td valign="top">The desaturation didn''t really make the bird standout that much.</td>', 'The desaturation didn''t really make the bird standout that much.', '2004-06-24 11:47:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(777851, 83979, 10047, '<td valign="top">Good capture of the emotion. I think the depth of focus was to shallow.</td>', 'Good capture of the emotion. I think the depth of focus was to shallow.', '2004-06-24 11:48:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(777855, 83785, 10047, '<td valign="top">Good contrast. I think I might have tried cropping out the left side.</td>', 'Good contrast. I think I might have tried cropping out the left side.', '2004-06-24 11:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(777857, 84896, 10047, '<td valign="top">The blue tint on the wheels, headlamps, and glass makes the picture seem odd.</td>', 'The blue tint on the wheels, headlamps, and glass makes the picture seem odd.', '2004-06-24 11:52:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(777870, 84702, 10047, '<td valign="top">Creative and well done. Nice color, clarity, and contrast.</td>', 'Creative and well done. Nice color, clarity, and contrast.', '2004-06-24 11:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(777889, 84542, 11895, '<td valign="top">I really like this but maybe a tighter cropping (so that the subject, the fish, were a bigger part of the image and the background was less) would have scored higher.</td>', 'I really like this but maybe a tighter cropping (so that the subject, the fish, were a bigger part of the image and the background was less) would have scored higher.', '2004-06-24 12:07:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(777913, 84751, 15403, '<td valign="top">this is an effective photo...the touches of snow, the fog, etc with the starkness of the shack really look great together.</td>', 'this is an effective photo...the touches of snow, the fog, etc with the starkness of the shack really look great together.', '2004-06-24 12:29:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(777915, 84703, 15403, '<td valign="top">beautiful idea.  I assume you  placed the flowers on the statue.  I like the way you think.  You obviously have a great eye and creativity. 10 :)</td>', 'beautiful idea.  I assume you  placed the flowers on the statue.  I like the way you think.  You obviously have a great eye and creativity. 10 :)', '2004-06-24 12:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(777921, 84382, 15403, '<td valign="top">I like this shot technically.  It is very sharp, etc.  I feel it would be much more effective if the gentleman were more "farmerly", i.e., overalls,  etc.  The shopping bag is a bit distracting as well.</td>', 'I like this shot technically.  It is very sharp, etc.  I feel it would be much more effective if the gentleman were more "farmerly", i.e., overalls,  etc.  The shopping bag is a bit distracting as well.', '2004-06-24 12:34:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(777923, 84647, 15403, '<td valign="top">I love your perspective here.  So many people would focus primarily on the plane.  The "195" lets you know what it is, and the tower is effective.  I can''t wait to see more.</td>', 'I love your perspective here.  So many people would focus primarily on the plane.  The "195" lets you know what it is, and the tower is effective.  I can''t wait to see more.', '2004-06-24 12:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(777925, 83912, 15403, '<td valign="top">beautifyl.  The secondary flag (in the background) is a great addition here.  You obviously have a great eye (yeah...I''m a little jealous) :)</td>', 'beautifyl.  The secondary flag (in the background) is a great addition here.  You obviously have a great eye (yeah...I''m a little jealous) :)', '2004-06-24 12:36:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(777927, 84727, 15403, '<td valign="top">interesting.  I don''t believe I''ve ever seen a night shot in selective desat before.  This is just beautiful.  When I look at certain shots, I see them framed and on a wall somewhere.  I see this one in an upscale cafe...very nice</td>', 'interesting.  I don''t believe I''ve ever seen a night shot in selective desat before.  This is just beautiful.  When I look at certain shots, I see them framed and on a wall somewhere.  I see this one in an upscale cafe...very nice', '2004-06-24 12:37:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(777934, 84680, 15403, '<td valign="top">great perspective and choice of what to desat...This picture tells a story, which in my opinion is a goal of photography.  I love the "busy-ness" of the shot, the candidness (are any of those real words?), and the overall feel.  I''m stopping short of giving you a 10 because I think it could have been a bit lighter.  I''m sure the desaturation/grayscale conversion caused this, but there are several tricks to lightening without breaking DPC rules.  Here''s your  9 (wish I could give a 9.5)  :)</td>', 'great perspective and choice of what to desat...This picture tells a story, which in my opinion is a goal of photography.  I love the "busy-ness" of the shot, the candidness (are any of those real words?), and the overall feel.  I''m stopping short of giving you a 10 because I think it could have been a bit lighter.  I''m sure the desaturation/grayscale conversion caused this, but there are several tricks to lightening without breaking DPC rules.  Here''s your  9 (wish I could give a 9.5)  :)', '2004-06-24 12:39:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(777938, 84512, 15403, '<td valign="top">excellent sports shot.  I''ll bet if the wetsuit were a different color, this would really stand out.  Maybe a tighter crop on the left, leaving the spray, causing more of a close up on the surfer/skier would have really drawn the viewer in.  Nonetheless, a great shot</td>', 'excellent sports shot.  I''ll bet if the wetsuit were a different color, this would really stand out.  Maybe a tighter crop on the left, leaving the spray, causing more of a close up on the surfer/skier would have really drawn the viewer in.  Nonetheless, a great shot', '2004-06-24 12:42:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(777942, 84776, 15403, '<td valign="top">I was wondering if there would be a rainbow shot in the challenge!  Beautifully done.  The border is a bit distracting to me, but not enough to cause any heartburn :)...thanks for sharing</td>', 'I was wondering if there would be a rainbow shot in the challenge!  Beautifully done.  The border is a bit distracting to me, but not enough to cause any heartburn :)...thanks for sharing', '2004-06-24 12:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(777944, 84266, 15403, '<td valign="top">very nice.  I can see this on the wall of an upscale kitchen.  I''ll bet you''re gonna be top 5 with this one :)</td>', 'very nice.  I can see this on the wall of an upscale kitchen.  I''ll bet you''re gonna be top 5 with this one :)', '2004-06-24 12:44:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(777947, 84351, 15403, '<td valign="top">nice macro.  A little "smooth" (neatimage?) for my tastes, but framed and placed on the right wall, a great shot!</td>', 'nice macro.  A little "smooth" (neatimage?) for my tastes, but framed and placed on the right wall, a great shot!', '2004-06-24 12:45:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(777953, 84634, 15403, '<td valign="top">oh wow!!!!!  This is awesome!!!  I want to know the story behind it....please share.  A very rare 10 from me...here''s why:<br/>I''ve said it before - a photo should tell a story (in my opinion).  When you look at this shot, a story unfolds.  Is this a family band?  School kids waiting to play for the President?  Dunno...that''s the beauty of it.  You can make it whatever you want.  Thanks for sharing</td>', 'oh wow!!!!!  This is awesome!!!  I want to know the story behind it....please share.  A very rare 10 from me...here''s why:I''ve said it before - a photo should tell a story (in my opinion).  When you look at this shot, a story unfolds.  Is this a family band?  School kids waiting to play for the President?  Dunno...that''s the beauty of it.  You can make it whatever you want.  Thanks for sharing', '2004-06-24 12:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(777962, 84283, 21714, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, nicely masked and finely balanced colours.  I think the image would look even better with the reflection of the kids turned to grayscale.</td>', 'Interesting shot, nicely masked and finely balanced colours.  I think the image would look even better with the reflection of the kids turned to grayscale.', '2004-06-24 13:17:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(777964, 84801, 21714, '<td valign="top">I think this is a brilliant idea and it''s been nicely done. I like the red highlights in her hair, but I am seeing some blue around that part. This little bit of blue is bothering me a bit. Otherwise I think it''s a very good image.</td>', 'I think this is a brilliant idea and it''s been nicely done. I like the red highlights in her hair, but I am seeing some blue around that part. This little bit of blue is bothering me a bit. Otherwise I think it''s a very good image.', '2004-06-24 13:18:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(777965, 84894, 21714, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, Nice job!</td>', 'Beautiful shot, Nice job!', '2004-06-24 13:19:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(777969, 84634, 21714, '<td valign="top">The shot is very interesting and what you have done with it is brilliant. Good thinking, well excecuted.</td>', 'The shot is very interesting and what you have done with it is brilliant. Good thinking, well excecuted.', '2004-06-24 13:22:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(777973, 84339, 21714, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favourites. Focus, DOF and tonal range &amp; masking - you got them spot on. Well done!</td>', 'This is one of my favourites. Focus, DOF and tonal range & masking - you got them spot on. Well done!', '2004-06-24 13:30:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(777975, 84577, 21714, '<td valign="top">Great idea - Nicely done!</td>', 'Great idea - Nicely done!', '2004-06-24 13:32:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(777982, 84816, 21714, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. I would suggest a greater DOF and softening aroung the edges of the flag.</td>', 'Nice shot. I would suggest a greater DOF and softening aroung the edges of the flag.', '2004-06-24 13:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(777987, 84132, 21714, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot. I somehow think that it would have worked better without the bird. I think the blue taps are interesting enough.</td>', 'Beautiful shot. I somehow think that it would have worked better without the bird. I think the blue taps are interesting enough.', '2004-06-24 13:42:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(777988, 84588, 21714, '<td valign="top">Nice tones and a great shot. I like your simplistic approach. Very well done.</td>', 'Nice tones and a great shot. I like your simplistic approach. Very well done.', '2004-06-24 13:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(777991, 84914, 21714, '<td valign="top">Great idea - Nicely done.  I am not too sure about the composition. The left of the frame is a bit distracting.</td>', 'Great idea - Nicely done.  I am not too sure about the composition. The left of the frame is a bit distracting.', '2004-06-24 13:46:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(777994, 84381, 14355, '<td valign="top">Great idea - but the twist in her stance makes her look like a leg is missing.   Not sure if I like the vignetting - would probably look fine when matted and framed.</td>', 'Great idea - but the twist in her stance makes her look like a leg is missing.   Not sure if I like the vignetting - would probably look fine when matted and framed.', '2004-06-24 13:48:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(777995, 84542, 21714, '<td valign="top">Love the floating  effect this image has created. Nicely done.</td>', 'Love the floating  effect this image has created. Nicely done.', '2004-06-24 13:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(777998, 84748, 14355, '<td valign="top">You didn''t render the rest of the picture to greyscale.  Might have worked better with just one book yellow?.  You have dozens of little bits of yellow sticking out in places you don''t want to highlight and shades of green in places too.  Good try, neat idea.</td>', 'You didn''t render the rest of the picture to greyscale.  Might have worked better with just one book yellow?.  You have dozens of little bits of yellow sticking out in places you don''t want to highlight and shades of green in places too.  Good try, neat idea.', '2004-06-24 13:49:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(778004, 84864, 14355, '<td valign="top">Waaaay too many color for a desat challenge.    You forgot to desat a whole section from under the bee''s right wing, and what you did around it''s body and antenna needs help.  You should have magnified the heck out of the pictue and simply gone around it  at 1-5 pixel resolution.  Might have taken you an extra five minutes.  That, and just the bee in color woud have made this pic a 10 because you chose an excellent picture to start with that had great contrast, great focus, and a good subject.   Don''t rush, take your time!!!  You could have won this one with another 10 minutes of work.  Rated 6.</td>', 'Waaaay too many color for a desat challenge.    You forgot to desat a whole section from under the bee''s right wing, and what you did around it''s body and antenna needs help.  You should have magnified the heck out of the pictue and simply gone around it  at 1-5 pixel resolution.  Might have taken you an extra five minutes.  That, and just the bee in color woud have made this pic a 10 because you chose an excellent picture to start with that had great contrast, great focus, and a good subject.   Don''t rush, take your time!!!  You could have won this one with another 10 minutes of work.  Rated 6.', '2004-06-24 13:51:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(778008, 84878, 21714, '<td valign="top">I think a tighter crop would have worked better on this image. Shiny bits on the left are distracting and I think without them this image would have made a bigger impact.</td>', 'I think a tighter crop would have worked better on this image. Shiny bits on the left are distracting and I think without them this image would have made a bigger impact.', '2004-06-24 13:54:46.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(778011, 84834, 14355, '<td valign="top">Not a great choice of picture to use - some of the hues in the yellow and red look to be missing from the desaturation process when the green was removed.  Rated 6.</td>', 'Not a great choice of picture to use - some of the hues in the yellow and red look to be missing from the desaturation process when the green was removed.  Rated 6.', '2004-06-24 13:58:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(778012, 84299, 14355, '<td valign="top">Too many items are colored, and, too many colors for this challenge.  You would have been better off just having one picture, or, just one person in each picture in color.  Good picture for the challenge.  Rated 6.</td>', 'Too many items are colored, and, too many colors for this challenge.  You would have been better off just having one picture, or, just one person in each picture in color.  Good picture for the challenge.  Rated 6.', '2004-06-24 13:59:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(778014, 84647, 21714, '<td valign="top">There''s a bit of gray on the plane at the top. Either you missed it or intended to keep it like that. But it does give the impression of a bad job. It''s an interesting shot otherwise.</td>', 'There''s a bit of gray on the plane at the top. Either you missed it or intended to keep it like that. But it does give the impression of a bad job. It''s an interesting shot otherwise.', '2004-06-24 14:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(778015, 84559, 14355, '<td valign="top">Nice try.  Your crop is a little too tight, focus is soft on the wings, and your butterfly has had the butter beaten out of it.  Great job of desaturation but the photo''s subject has very little eye appeal to be a great picture.</td>', 'Nice try.  Your crop is a little too tight, focus is soft on the wings, and your butterfly has had the butter beaten out of it.  Great job of desaturation but the photo''s subject has very little eye appeal to be a great picture.', '2004-06-24 14:01:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(778017, 84383, 14620, '<td valign="top">Very Sweet!  Can''t wait to see how this was achieved as there doesn''t look to be anyone driving, although I''m sure there''s an easy explanation, PS effect maybe?  Either way, it looks very cool.  Very nice tones and good composition.</td>', 'Very Sweet!  Can''t wait to see how this was achieved as there doesn''t look to be anyone driving, although I''m sure there''s an easy explanation, PS effect maybe?  Either way, it looks very cool.  Very nice tones and good composition.', '2004-06-24 14:02:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(778019, 84869, 21714, '<td valign="top">I think elements in the background are a bit distracting.  They are not blurred enough not to wonder about them. I think the cat is too close to the chair. It''s a nice desaturation job.</td>', 'I think elements in the background are a bit distracting.  They are not blurred enough not to wonder about them. I think the cat is too close to the chair. It''s a nice desaturation job.', '2004-06-24 14:04:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(778022, 84381, 14620, '<td valign="top">Love it!  Great subject, good composition and I like the vignetting although it seems just a tad bit heavy handed, just my opinion though.  It kind of gives you the idea that she''s being looked at through binoculars or something.  :-)  Overall this a nice use of selective desat and works well with this challenge.</td>', 'Love it!  Great subject, good composition and I like the vignetting although it seems just a tad bit heavy handed, just my opinion though.  It kind of gives you the idea that she''s being looked at through binoculars or something.  :-)  Overall this a nice use of selective desat and works well with this challenge.', '2004-06-24 14:06:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(778023, 84861, 14355, '<td valign="top">Crop is waaaaay too tight with most of the flower! cut off.  The white center is overpowering.  You normally wouldn''t have had the original framed this way.  Darkening the picture would have added more contrast to the white pedals, would have brought out the pedal textures, and added allot more to the picture.  Great job and workmanship getting the small yellow parts separated from the main background!  Rated 6</td>', 'Crop is waaaaay too tight with most of the flower! cut off.  The white center is overpowering.  You normally wouldn''t have had the original framed this way.  Darkening the picture would have added more contrast to the white pedals, would have brought out the pedal textures, and added allot more to the picture.  Great job and workmanship getting the small yellow parts separated from the main background!  Rated 6', '2004-06-24 14:06:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(778024, 84741, 21714, '<td valign="top">I can''t stop looking at the top right corner of this image. I don''t think it''s a good thing when your focus turns to something that you didn''t intend people to be interested in.</td>', 'I can''t stop looking at the top right corner of this image. I don''t think it''s a good thing when your focus turns to something that you didn''t intend people to be interested in.', '2004-06-24 14:07:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(778029, 84857, 21714, '<td valign="top">Except for the halo around the man''s head, I think you have done a good job.</td>', 'Except for the halo around the man''s head, I think you have done a good job.', '2004-06-24 14:10:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(778030, 84651, 14355, '<td valign="top">Cute.  Looks like fish that were the victims of a grafettie artist - because the red strip goes through the eyes.   You may have been better off with a less tight crop and leaving the whole fish colored, or, leaving the tank colored and desaturating the fish.  Good workmanship separating them from the rest of the background.</td>', 'Cute.  Looks like fish that were the victims of a grafettie artist - because the red strip goes through the eyes.   You may have been better off with a less tight crop and leaving the whole fish colored, or, leaving the tank colored and desaturating the fish.  Good workmanship separating them from the rest of the background.', '2004-06-24 14:11:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(778034, 84761, 14355, '<td valign="top">Some of the background isn''t fully greyscalled as mentioned in the challenge.  And those parts not exaclty highlight either.</td>', 'Some of the background isn''t fully greyscalled as mentioned in the challenge.  And those parts not exaclty highlight either.', '2004-06-24 14:13:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(778036, 84870, 21714, '<td valign="top">This shot does grab my attention. It would have been a great image if the flower was masked better and if there was more details.</td>', 'This shot does grab my attention. It would have been a great image if the flower was masked better and if there was more details.', '2004-06-24 14:14:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(778040, 84909, 14355, '<td valign="top">Looks like a normal picture........ I have grey and metal tacks in my desk at work.   On close inspection -  I''m guessing you changed the yellow''s to greyscale, but, missed the yellow reflection comming off the clear tacks.  A well focused picture, but, you needed to consider if the viewer would recognize the missing color.  And you needed a bit more time on this to remove the yellow reflections.</td>', 'Looks like a normal picture........ I have grey and metal tacks in my desk at work.   On close inspection -  I''m guessing you changed the yellow''s to greyscale, but, missed the yellow reflection comming off the clear tacks.  A well focused picture, but, you needed to consider if the viewer would recognize the missing color.  And you needed a bit more time on this to remove the yellow reflections.', '2004-06-24 14:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(778048, 84354, 14355, '<td valign="top">A nice high contrast picture and you sure were on the right track, but, when you desaturated you also removed some of the green and yellow hues in the umbrella needed to make it''s presense seem natural in the picture.</td>', 'A nice high contrast picture and you sure were on the right track, but, when you desaturated you also removed some of the green and yellow hues in the umbrella needed to make it''s presense seem natural in the picture.', '2004-06-24 14:23:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(778053, 84114, 14355, '<td valign="top">The colors are nice, and it''s a great picture but, there isn''t enough contrast in the background to make it jump out at the viewer.</td>', 'The colors are nice, and it''s a great picture but, there isn''t enough contrast in the background to make it jump out at the viewer.', '2004-06-24 14:25:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(778057, 84568, 14355, '<td valign="top">Nice try.   But me it looks like a High Key pic of a gal sucking on a 1/4 20 bent concrete lag bolt.</td>', 'Nice try.   But me it looks like a High Key pic of a gal sucking on a 1/4 20 bent concrete lag bolt.', '2004-06-24 14:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(778059, 84563, 14355, '<td valign="top">You desaturated too much of the dress while doing the other colors.  You lost some of the R/G/Y color components that would have made the dress seem natural and real.</td>', 'You desaturated too much of the dress while doing the other colors.  You lost some of the R/G/Y color components that would have made the dress seem natural and real.', '2004-06-24 14:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(778060, 84424, 14355, '<td valign="top">It''s not pink, it''s orange.  The crop is so tight the bird eclipses the desaturated background.</td>', 'It''s not pink, it''s orange.  The crop is so tight the bird eclipses the desaturated background.', '2004-06-24 14:31:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(778061, 84068, 14355, '<td valign="top">Seems you removed some of the highlights in the parrots colors while desaturating the rest of the picture.</td>', 'Seems you removed some of the highlights in the parrots colors while desaturating the rest of the picture.', '2004-06-24 14:32:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(778066, 84065, 14355, '<td valign="top">I would have desaturated the license plate, interior and the reflections to make it stand out from the background. I also would have blured out the license plate number unless you have a release from the owner.   If the saturation of the blue was intensified just a little it will really stand out......... and look awesome when matted and frammed.   Rated 9</td>', 'I would have desaturated the license plate, interior and the reflections to make it stand out from the background. I also would have blured out the license plate number unless you have a release from the owner.   If the saturation of the blue was intensified just a little it will really stand out......... and look awesome when matted and frammed.   Rated 9', '2004-06-24 14:36:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(778070, 84795, 14355, '<td valign="top">I am sure know how much I love this picture!</td>', 'I am sure know how much I love this picture!', '2004-06-24 14:38:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(778071, 84917, 14355, '<td valign="top">I think your picture would look great if just the person and dogs were in color,</td>', 'I think your picture would look great if just the person and dogs were in color,', '2004-06-24 14:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(778095, 84627, 7322, '<td valign="top">I''m sure you have probably read this by now, by her eyes are very out of focus. I don''t know if it is because of the technique or not, but iher eyes have a very milky, glazed appearance which is exteremlely creepy. A closer look makes me suspect you painted the color in somewhat transparently and this is probably what gives them the unatural appearance. The photo was out of focus to begin with, so it really wasn''t the best choice for an entry, particularly a tricky one like this.</td>', 'I''m sure you have probably read this by now, by her eyes are very out of focus. I don''t know if it is because of the technique or not, but iher eyes have a very milky, glazed appearance which is exteremlely creepy. A closer look makes me suspect you painted the color in somewhat transparently and this is probably what gives them the unatural appearance. The photo was out of focus to begin with, so it really wasn''t the best choice for an entry, particularly a tricky one like this.', '2004-06-24 14:58:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(778096, 84092, 7322, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea. The background has seams in it that kind of make me think it is a skirt or something. Next time you might want to purchase some black velvet or even just some colored paper. The lighting isn''t very good. It just looks like you used the flash in your camera. The shoes have shiny hot spots and the color lacks depth.</td>', 'Interesting idea. The background has seams in it that kind of make me think it is a skirt or something. Next time you might want to purchase some black velvet or even just some colored paper. The lighting isn''t very good. It just looks like you used the flash in your camera. The shoes have shiny hot spots and the color lacks depth.', '2004-06-24 15:01:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(778099, 84613, 7322, '<td valign="top">This looks weirdly over-manipulated on my monitor. There is an odd solarized or posterized effect running across the black background like it may have been a wire fence? The edges of the flower look posterized also. I''m not sure if this was the intention. It looks very weird.</td>', 'This looks weirdly over-manipulated on my monitor. There is an odd solarized or posterized effect running across the black background like it may have been a wire fence? The edges of the flower look posterized also. I''m not sure if this was the intention. It looks very weird.', '2004-06-24 15:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(778100, 84567, 7322, '<td valign="top">I like the composition but it is awfully small. I imagine that is because of the panoramic effect. It is hard to get a panorama with a 640 pixel maximum, I imagine. It looks like this has nice crisp detail but it is really hard to tell from the small size. Sorry.</td>', 'I like the composition but it is awfully small. I imagine that is because of the panoramic effect. It is hard to get a panorama with a 640 pixel maximum, I imagine. It looks like this has nice crisp detail but it is really hard to tell from the small size. Sorry.', '2004-06-24 15:04:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(778104, 83785, 11800, '<td valign="top">Just beautiful.  Perfect for the challenge. The slight overexposure on the outside works to erase the details that might disturb the play between light and dark and the wall that separates them.</td>', 'Just beautiful.  Perfect for the challenge. The slight overexposure on the outside works to erase the details that might disturb the play between light and dark and the wall that separates them.', '2004-06-24 15:06:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(778107, 83771, 7322, '<td valign="top">It looks like you managed the technique pretty well. Although I appreciate the pattern the boxes make, somewhat, I don''t find this angled view that appealing. A straight-on composition would have flattened the shapes into a more abstract composition of squares and llines and added interest to what is essentially a very mundane subject.</td>', 'It looks like you managed the technique pretty well. Although I appreciate the pattern the boxes make, somewhat, I don''t find this angled view that appealing. A straight-on composition would have flattened the shapes into a more abstract composition of squares and llines and added interest to what is essentially a very mundane subject.', '2004-06-24 15:08:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(778115, 84637, 7322, '<td valign="top">The plant, which is uninteresting, obscures the face of the child which is far more interesting. It is usually not a good choice to obscure the face in a portrait. If your intent is to add an air of mystery or anonymity to the subject then this would work. In a portrait of a child however it just doesn''t work.</td>', 'The plant, which is uninteresting, obscures the face of the child which is far more interesting. It is usually not a good choice to obscure the face in a portrait. If your intent is to add an air of mystery or anonymity to the subject then this would work. In a portrait of a child however it just doesn''t work.', '2004-06-24 15:10:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(778130, 84922, 7322, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. The tight cropping and overhead view makes for an interesting abstract composition. I would suggest elevating the contrast first, perhaps darken some of the greys, saturating the yellow, and then move on to the selective desaturation. As it is now, the yellow really doesn''t quite pop and there are just too many middle values and not enough lights and darks to really make this composition sing. Also, even though there may have been five yellow cars on the lot, it may have been more interesting if you had just selected the one with the trunk open to really make a strong statement. The yellow placement in this composition is just rather random. Nice effort.</td>', 'Nice idea. The tight cropping and overhead view makes for an interesting abstract composition. I would suggest elevating the contrast first, perhaps darken some of the greys, saturating the yellow, and then move on to the selective desaturation. As it is now, the yellow really doesn''t quite pop and there are just too many middle values and not enough lights and darks to really make this composition sing. Also, even though there may have been five yellow cars on the lot, it may have been more interesting if you had just selected the one with the trunk open to really make a strong statement. The yellow placement in this composition is just rather random. Nice effort.', '2004-06-24 15:15:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(778137, 84751, 7322, '<td valign="top">I like the approach and the scene. The foreground looks a bit murky and out of focus. Perhaps adjusting the contrast a bit first and than doing the desaturation technique may have brightened it a bit. As it is, the b&amp;w appears very dull with almost no darks.</td>', 'I like the approach and the scene. The foreground looks a bit murky and out of focus. Perhaps adjusting the contrast a bit first and than doing the desaturation technique may have brightened it a bit. As it is, the b&w appears very dull with almost no darks.', '2004-06-24 15:18:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(778138, 84621, 9411, '<td valign="top">Fascinating image. Unfortunately your selection process is a bit off. All of the poppy should have been in orange. I assume this is because of not being proficient with your editing program. If you are using photoshop, I would be happy to give you some tips, if you like.</td>', 'Fascinating image. Unfortunately your selection process is a bit off. All of the poppy should have been in orange. I assume this is because of not being proficient with your editing program. If you are using photoshop, I would be happy to give you some tips, if you like.', '2004-06-24 15:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(778143, 84568, 9411, '<td valign="top">Great idea. Love the composition.  What I find not so great is the colour, I seems really oversaturated and the bleed around her lips is distracting. Also the colour on her chin seems out of place.</td>', 'Great idea. Love the composition.  What I find not so great is the colour, I seems really oversaturated and the bleed around her lips is distracting. Also the colour on her chin seems out of place.', '2004-06-24 15:20:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(778147, 84913, 11800, '<td valign="top">I think I would really like this if it was fully color or b/w. Good range of focus(looks slightly soft) and proper placement of the farmhouse. The tower in the upper left might have been cloned out for a more rural feel.  I do see black blacks and white whites it''s just that all the grays seem to be the same, leaving a feeling of tonal flatness.</td>', 'I think I would really like this if it was fully color or b/w. Good range of focus(looks slightly soft) and proper placement of the farmhouse. The tower in the upper left might have been cloned out for a more rural feel.  I do see black blacks and white whites it''s just that all the grays seem to be the same, leaving a feeling of tonal flatness.', '2004-06-24 15:22:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(778154, 83788, 11800, '<td valign="top">The red is nice and I like the rainbow wings and the fly does seem to be as well focused as your camera probably would allow. I see the problem as coming from the leaf. It makes it look as if the picture had been cropped too much or you used the digital part of the zoom function.  Whatever happened, the leaf looks lumpy and bumpy from causes not from the texture of the leaf itself.</td>', 'The red is nice and I like the rainbow wings and the fly does seem to be as well focused as your camera probably would allow. I see the problem as coming from the leaf. It makes it look as if the picture had been cropped too much or you used the digital part of the zoom function.  Whatever happened, the leaf looks lumpy and bumpy from causes not from the texture of the leaf itself.', '2004-06-24 15:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(778181, 84762, 11800, '<td valign="top">I like the wool sweater and the texture of the fibers. I''m sorta stumped about what the lavender thing is.  It looks like plastic, but my mind keeps telling me the sweater should be hanging up. Sorry. It''s probably my own fault that I can''t understand this.</td>', 'I like the wool sweater and the texture of the fibers. I''m sorta stumped about what the lavender thing is.  It looks like plastic, but my mind keeps telling me the sweater should be hanging up. Sorry. It''s probably my own fault that I can''t understand this.', '2004-06-24 15:44:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(778195, 84854, 11800, '<td valign="top">It''s a well taken picture and such a handsome dog.  There is a little to much noise for my tastes but that is more of a camera thing. I do question the reverse desat choice. The color draws my eyes first to the heart.</td>', 'It''s a well taken picture and such a handsome dog.  There is a little to much noise for my tastes but that is more of a camera thing. I do question the reverse desat choice. The color draws my eyes first to the heart.', '2004-06-24 15:53:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(778260, 84752, 7291, '<td valign="top">Excellent!  Good composition.</td>', 'Excellent!  Good composition.', '2004-06-24 16:53:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(778262, 84588, 7291, '<td valign="top">I think the red is too small to make enough of an impact.  Or maybe not bright enough.  I''d love to see the full color version of this.</td>', 'I think the red is too small to make enough of an impact.  Or maybe not bright enough.  I''d love to see the full color version of this.', '2004-06-24 16:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(778263, 84630, 7291, '<td valign="top">Great angle.</td>', 'Great angle.', '2004-06-24 16:55:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(778265, 84828, 7291, '<td valign="top">Interesting color cast on the tractor.  Love the B&amp;W portion of the photo.</td>', 'Interesting color cast on the tractor.  Love the B&W portion of the photo.', '2004-06-24 16:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(778266, 84381, 7291, '<td valign="top">I think this is beautiful.  Good job.</td>', 'I think this is beautiful.  Good job.', '2004-06-24 16:56:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(778268, 84312, 7291, '<td valign="top">I thik there may be too much color in this to be really impactul.  Perhaps just the yellow?  Good capture though.</td>', 'I thik there may be too much color in this to be really impactul.  Perhaps just the yellow?  Good capture though.', '2004-06-24 16:57:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(778273, 84753, 20779, '<td valign="top">Fantastic color and lighting.</td>', 'Fantastic color and lighting.', '2004-06-24 17:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(778291, 84780, 20941, '<td valign="top">this is the best de-sat ive seen so far in this challenge. The colors are beautifully natural, the baby''s expression, priceless. I don''t think I would have changed anything here. 10</td>', 'this is the best de-sat ive seen so far in this challenge. The colors are beautifully natural, the baby''s expression, priceless. I don''t think I would have changed anything here. 10', '2004-06-24 17:43:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(778334, 84921, 10047, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. Excellent clarity and composition.</td>', 'Nicely done. Excellent clarity and composition.', '2004-06-24 18:25:31.000000', NULL, 1),
