(778387, 84762, 2764, '<td valign="top">I can''t getmy mind around this one,  the textures, contrast and colors are nice but I feel like I need to know what it is.  Is that an eyeball inside?  A cat? Washing a sweater?  A rag washing a car and no animal?</td>', 'I can''t getmy mind around this one,  the textures, contrast and colors are nice but I feel like I need to know what it is.  Is that an eyeball inside?  A cat? Washing a sweater?  A rag washing a car and no animal?', '2004-06-24 19:13:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(778392, 84790, 2764, '<td valign="top">creepy</td>', 'creepy', '2004-06-24 19:17:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(778405, 84874, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is a good image, the lighting is very adequate. No over-exposed areas although it is taken in sunlight. I personally wouldn''t have included two colors but rather just the red of the balloon and left the rest in B&amp;W. I am not sure what it is in the sky to the top right of the girl''s cap, it looks like a brush stroke or something, it has a blue tinge to it.</td>', 'This is a good image, the lighting is very adequate. No over-exposed areas although it is taken in sunlight. I personally wouldn''t have included two colors but rather just the red of the balloon and left the rest in B&W. I am not sure what it is in the sky to the top right of the girl''s cap, it looks like a brush stroke or something, it has a blue tinge to it.', '2004-06-24 19:29:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(778406, 84282, 5728, '<td valign="top">Stunning image, it almost looks like it was taken with a film camera with those skin textures coming through like that, good work! Funny, but for some reason the earring doesn''t look like it is connected to the ear but to the skin below it :)</td>', 'Stunning image, it almost looks like it was taken with a film camera with those skin textures coming through like that, good work! Funny, but for some reason the earring doesn''t look like it is connected to the ear but to the skin below it :)', '2004-06-24 19:31:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(778416, 84917, 14614, '<td valign="top">this is a great, creative use of dsat.  the border works well, the scratchy green is interesting... trees provide a good background - perhaps a bit too much negative space on either side of the professional models</td>', 'this is a great, creative use of dsat.  the border works well, the scratchy green is interesting... trees provide a good background - perhaps a bit too much negative space on either side of the professional models', '2004-06-24 19:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(778454, 84828, 6999, '<td valign="top">Fine work indeed. The real touch that I like here is the inclusion of the entirety of the tractor and whatever the hell it''s towing. great light on the hills, good sky - perhaps a slight loss of impact in the foreground - would like to have seen the contrast taken a touch further there, or perhaps simply more of the crop included but that''s a minor thing I think, and no doubt subject to compositional constraints. 8</td>', 'Fine work indeed. The real touch that I like here is the inclusion of the entirety of the tractor and whatever the hell it''s towing. great light on the hills, good sky - perhaps a slight loss of impact in the foreground - would like to have seen the contrast taken a touch further there, or perhaps simply more of the crop included but that''s a minor thing I think, and no doubt subject to compositional constraints. 8', '2004-06-24 20:10:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(778470, 84706, 1563, '<td valign="top">Personally I think you should have exactuated the red color for a stronger effect</td>', 'Personally I think you should have exactuated the red color for a stronger effect', '2004-06-24 20:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(778497, 84888, 7291, '<td valign="top">Very cool.  I like it a lot.</td>', 'Very cool.  I like it a lot.', '2004-06-24 20:40:17.000000', NULL, 1),
