(778649, 84568, 23364, '<td valign="top">HHHMMMMM GOOD!</td>', 'HHHMMMMM GOOD!', '2004-06-24 21:55:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(778660, 84912, 7322, '<td valign="top">I can only hope the intention was not to make the eyes look yellow also. Unfortunately, that is what I''m seeing and it looks very creepy. The thin yellow border only emphasizes it. The tones in the b&amp;w portion of her skin could be better. There is a very shiny pale area running from her forehead over her left eye and along her nose and down her mouth. It is very distracting. When you convert color to black and white you aren''t done. You still need to tone the greys so they aren''t so dull looking. An easy way of doing this in PS is to adjust hue/saturation, clicking on the colorize box and then moving the saturation level to very low. You can also adjust the hue level to get the tone you like. I prefer to pretty much leave it in the middle where it is.</td>', 'I can only hope the intention was not to make the eyes look yellow also. Unfortunately, that is what I''m seeing and it looks very creepy. The thin yellow border only emphasizes it. The tones in the b&w portion of her skin could be better. There is a very shiny pale area running from her forehead over her left eye and along her nose and down her mouth. It is very distracting. When you convert color to black and white you aren''t done. You still need to tone the greys so they aren''t so dull looking. An easy way of doing this in PS is to adjust hue/saturation, clicking on the colorize box and then moving the saturation level to very low. You can also adjust the hue level to get the tone you like. I prefer to pretty much leave it in the middle where it is.', '2004-06-24 22:00:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(778662, 84769, 11800, '<td valign="top">Super contrast. Really well taken. Proper use of desaturation. The title brings it all together into a neat package. Just enough of the grass shows to let the viewer know that they are looking at the outside of the building.</td>', 'Super contrast. Really well taken. Proper use of desaturation. The title brings it all together into a neat package. Just enough of the grass shows to let the viewer know that they are looking at the outside of the building.', '2004-06-24 22:02:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(778670, 84334, 11800, '<td valign="top">Beautiful rainbow and excellent use of dof. I think this is one of the ones that would look better in full color. For this challenge, I don''t understand why part of the grass was left green. The posts aren''t so bad because it brings attention to the destruction and I like the softened effect on the upright one.</td>', 'Beautiful rainbow and excellent use of dof. I think this is one of the ones that would look better in full color. For this challenge, I don''t understand why part of the grass was left green. The posts aren''t so bad because it brings attention to the destruction and I like the softened effect on the upright one.', '2004-06-24 22:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(778683, 84795, 11800, '<td valign="top">Sorry. It looks a lot like a snapshot. Nothing wrong with snapshots, just not for a competition.</td>', 'Sorry. It looks a lot like a snapshot. Nothing wrong with snapshots, just not for a competition.', '2004-06-24 22:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(778698, 84861, 11800, '<td valign="top">It must have taken you forever to get this right. It has a nice composition and I can see details thru most of the light petals but they do seem a little overexposed. Maybe it''s bcause they are naturally so light.</td>', 'It must have taken you forever to get this right. It has a nice composition and I can see details thru most of the light petals but they do seem a little overexposed. Maybe it''s bcause they are naturally so light.', '2004-06-24 22:29:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(778707, 84686, 11800, '<td valign="top">She is a cute kid. I like the composition. I do have to wonder about the choice to keep the clothes in color.</td>', 'She is a cute kid. I like the composition. I do have to wonder about the choice to keep the clothes in color.', '2004-06-24 22:34:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(778724, 84889, 22734, '<td valign="top">very entertaining</td>', 'very entertaining', '2004-06-24 22:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(778757, 84801, 2158, '<td valign="top">Personally, I''d have desaturated the hair as well.  The colour may be interesting, but it draws attention away from the artwork.</td>', 'Personally, I''d have desaturated the hair as well.  The colour may be interesting, but it draws attention away from the artwork.', '2004-06-24 23:33:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(778767, 84485, 19952, '<td valign="top">There are a lot of really outstanding shots in this challenge, but this is my personal favorite. You picked a perfect photo for the challenge and did an amazing job with the desaturation. Very nice!</td>', 'There are a lot of really outstanding shots in this challenge, but this is my personal favorite. You picked a perfect photo for the challenge and did an amazing job with the desaturation. Very nice!', '2004-06-24 23:46:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(778773, 84327, 19952, '<td valign="top">The only detraction from this photo is the overprocessing that gives the skin a plasticky sheen, but other than that it''s a truly beautiful shot. Very nice job!</td>', 'The only detraction from this photo is the overprocessing that gives the skin a plasticky sheen, but other than that it''s a truly beautiful shot. Very nice job!', '2004-06-24 23:48:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(778786, 84282, 19952, '<td valign="top">This is a really beautiful shot and a great choice for desaturation. The only thing that I find distracting is the ear, which seems to have been partially erased. If his ear actually does look like that and his earring is attached to his upper jaw, then please pass on my apologies. ;-) But this is a great shot - one of my favorites in this challenge.</td>', 'This is a really beautiful shot and a great choice for desaturation. The only thing that I find distracting is the ear, which seems to have been partially erased. If his ear actually does look like that and his earring is attached to his upper jaw, then please pass on my apologies. ;-) But this is a great shot - one of my favorites in this challenge.', '2004-06-24 23:52:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(778796, 84866, 19952, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot and think it''s a good choice for desaturation. The only nitpick would be that it might be better with the colored flower a bit off-center, but that''s a personal preference. Very nice job!</td>', 'I really like this shot and think it''s a good choice for desaturation. The only nitpick would be that it might be better with the colored flower a bit off-center, but that''s a personal preference. Very nice job!', '2004-06-24 23:55:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(778804, 84339, 19952, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what''s so appealing about this shot, but it''s one of my favorites in thiis challenge. Great clarity and simplicity - nice job!</td>', 'I''m not sure what''s so appealing about this shot, but it''s one of my favorites in thiis challenge. Great clarity and simplicity - nice job!', '2004-06-24 23:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(778814, 84680, 19952, '<td valign="top">Really nice shot - one of the best in this challenge. It''s amazing how much the people fade into the background when desaturated like that.</td>', 'Really nice shot - one of the best in this challenge. It''s amazing how much the people fade into the background when desaturated like that.', '2004-06-25 00:02:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(778820, 84382, 19952, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot - it''s one of my favorites in the challenge. My only nitpick is that his face looks a little washed out. It might be better with a little burning and sharpening. Still, great job!</td>', 'I really like this shot - it''s one of my favorites in the challenge. My only nitpick is that his face looks a little washed out. It might be better with a little burning and sharpening. Still, great job!', '2004-06-25 00:04:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(778829, 84706, 19952, '<td valign="top">I really like the clarity you were able to achieve on this photo. It looks like you desaturated by removing all colors except red, which left the ladybug a slightly odd brown color at the top. It might have been better to lasso the whole ladybug and desaturate everything else, which would retain the full color of the insect. But it''s really nice like this as well - great shot.</td>', 'I really like the clarity you were able to achieve on this photo. It looks like you desaturated by removing all colors except red, which left the ladybug a slightly odd brown color at the top. It might have been better to lasso the whole ladybug and desaturate everything else, which would retain the full color of the insect. But it''s really nice like this as well - great shot.', '2004-06-25 00:10:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(778842, 84207, 19952, '<td valign="top">Very cute shot. It''s so hard to keep a child still when you want to leave the shutter open for awhile. Sometimes I''ll ask my 5-year-old to lean on something, such as that rock, which will keep her from moving around too much. You''d think they could sit still for just 1/10th of a second! :-)</td>', 'Very cute shot. It''s so hard to keep a child still when you want to leave the shutter open for awhile. Sometimes I''ll ask my 5-year-old to lean on something, such as that rock, which will keep her from moving around too much. You''d think they could sit still for just 1/10th of a second! :-)', '2004-06-25 00:16:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(778847, 84854, 19952, '<td valign="top">Very unique decision to desaturate the main focus of the photo. It''s a bit noisy in the colored part, so you might try keeping the colored and desaturated selections on different layers and then only sharpening the desaturated part, or even blurring the colored part. Cute shot!</td>', 'Very unique decision to desaturate the main focus of the photo. It''s a bit noisy in the colored part, so you might try keeping the colored and desaturated selections on different layers and then only sharpening the desaturated part, or even blurring the colored part. Cute shot!', '2004-06-25 00:18:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(778866, 84834, 18958, '<td valign="top">Wow nice yellow/silver color !</td>', 'Wow nice yellow/silver color !', '2004-06-25 00:38:28.000000', NULL, 1),
