(778902, 84770, 7291, '<td valign="top">What a great image.  My favorite of the challenge so far.  There is actually a lot in the picture that has color but with this picture it works very well.  My first 10 given in this challenge.</td>', 'What a great image.  My favorite of the challenge so far.  There is actually a lot in the picture that has color but with this picture it works very well.  My first 10 given in this challenge.', '2004-06-25 00:55:18.000000', NULL, 1),
