(779174, 84204, 15002, '<td valign="top">I love it!  if I had to nit-pic,  i don''t like the texture of the terry cloth towel in BG.  Velvet maybe?  8<br/></td>', 'I love it!  if I had to nit-pic,  i don''t like the texture of the terry cloth towel in BG.  Velvet maybe?  8', '2004-06-25 06:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
