(779244, 84895, 1368, '<td valign="top">This is a cool picture! I keep wondering what that blue thingy is, I like the lighting and composition, the blue ball looks a little lighter than the rest of the picture, it looks a little strange, anyway I like this picture a lot, its different, original and very cool :) - 9</td>', 'This is a cool picture! I keep wondering what that blue thingy is, I like the lighting and composition, the blue ball looks a little lighter than the rest of the picture, it looks a little strange, anyway I like this picture a lot, its different, original and very cool :) - 9', '2004-06-25 08:42:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(779247, 84765, 1368, '<td valign="top">She is sooo cute :) Wonderful portrait, I cant give you constructive comment cause I like it just the way it is. Good job :)</td>', 'She is sooo cute :) Wonderful portrait, I cant give you constructive comment cause I like it just the way it is. Good job :)', '2004-06-25 08:44:41.000000', NULL, 1),
