(779491, 84877, 7543, '<td valign="top">Great composition, good subject. Only thing bothering me is the light green halo around the green tree. You should have selected the tree more carefully before the desaturation process, shame because it is a great shot.</td>', 'Great composition, good subject. Only thing bothering me is the light green halo around the green tree. You should have selected the tree more carefully before the desaturation process, shame because it is a great shot.', '2004-06-25 13:08:44.000000', NULL, 1),
