(779593, 84652, 22580, '<td valign="top">Nice photo but that shadow is a bit distracting</td>', 'Nice photo but that shadow is a bit distracting', '2004-06-25 15:20:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(779596, 84682, 22580, '<td valign="top">Nice but for some reason it looks a little blurry to me.</td>', 'Nice but for some reason it looks a little blurry to me.', '2004-06-25 15:22:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(779598, 84722, 22580, '<td valign="top">Hmm, first thing I noticed was the noise.</td>', 'Hmm, first thing I noticed was the noise.', '2004-06-25 15:24:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(779601, 84144, 22580, '<td valign="top">Nice composition although it seems that the whites are a bit washed out. Lots of detail lost.</td>', 'Nice composition although it seems that the whites are a bit washed out. Lots of detail lost.', '2004-06-25 15:25:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(779604, 84303, 4494, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Love the old setting, and the man sitting there under the yellow umbrella is great.  Sky is a little blown out but oh well.  I might have tried to get a little more contrast in the B&amp;W (some areas don''t seem to be black enough).</td>', 'Very nice.  Love the old setting, and the man sitting there under the yellow umbrella is great.  Sky is a little blown out but oh well.  I might have tried to get a little more contrast in the B&W (some areas don''t seem to be black enough).', '2004-06-25 15:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(779605, 84911, 22580, '<td valign="top">Nice, although photo seems a bit dark.</td>', 'Nice, although photo seems a bit dark.', '2004-06-25 15:27:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(779609, 84833, 4494, '<td valign="top">This  pic shows too much "other stuff".  This is the problem with car shows, you have tons of people all of the place which makes wide shots really hard.</td>', 'This  pic shows too much "other stuff".  This is the problem with car shows, you have tons of people all of the place which makes wide shots really hard.', '2004-06-25 15:29:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(779611, 84780, 4494, '<td valign="top">Wow, this almost has a painting feel to it.  The soft colors are great.  Perfect B&amp;W exposure as well.</td>', 'Wow, this almost has a painting feel to it.  The soft colors are great.  Perfect B&W exposure as well.', '2004-06-25 15:31:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(779614, 84266, 4494, '<td valign="top">Nice realistic red color.  Might be better to move the frame up and right which would put the raspberry in the lower left and also show more of the leaves which are interesting.</td>', 'Nice realistic red color.  Might be better to move the frame up and right which would put the raspberry in the lower left and also show more of the leaves which are interesting.', '2004-06-25 15:33:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(779617, 84717, 4494, '<td valign="top">Looks like the paint is purple.  Aren''t these green?  You should have left it green and desaturated so it''s a very very light green.  I''d have cropped it so just the top half of the image is showing.  I there''s too much of the grill there.  Maybe so that just the first 2 grill supports are showing.  This would also emphasize "John Deere" more because it would be bigger.</td>', 'Looks like the paint is purple.  Aren''t these green?  You should have left it green and desaturated so it''s a very very light green.  I''d have cropped it so just the top half of the image is showing.  I there''s too much of the grill there.  Maybe so that just the first 2 grill supports are showing.  This would also emphasize "John Deere" more because it would be bigger.', '2004-06-25 15:38:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(779618, 84744, 4494, '<td valign="top">Excellent focus and contrast.  I would have also desaturated his left arm/shoulder and hand, but not the gun.  Pretty cool. 8.</td>', 'Excellent focus and contrast.  I would have also desaturated his left arm/shoulder and hand, but not the gun.  Pretty cool. 8.', '2004-06-25 15:42:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(779621, 84567, 4494, '<td valign="top">This reminds me, I''d like to see a "Panorama" challenge.  But in this, I don''t think the roof is a strong enough subject.  Maybe you should have gotten closer so you can see more of the barn.</td>', 'This reminds me, I''d like to see a "Panorama" challenge.  But in this, I don''t think the roof is a strong enough subject.  Maybe you should have gotten closer so you can see more of the barn.', '2004-06-25 15:45:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(779622, 84185, 4494, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Love the clarity and color of the butterfly, but, I don''t really like the purple-ish color of the rest.  You should have made it a light grey (lighten the rest using Levels, etc) which would give a great contrast with the dark butterfly.</td>', 'Very nice.  Love the clarity and color of the butterfly, but, I don''t really like the purple-ish color of the rest.  You should have made it a light grey (lighten the rest using Levels, etc) which would give a great contrast with the dark butterfly.', '2004-06-25 15:47:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(779623, 84801, 4494, '<td valign="top">Pretty good.  Should have cloned out the cloth on the left and the "v" shaped thing at the top.   I''d have played with the B&amp;W levels a little to more contrast, darker road, etc.</td>', 'Pretty good.  Should have cloned out the cloth on the left and the "v" shaped thing at the top.   I''d have played with the B&W levels a little to more contrast, darker road, etc.', '2004-06-25 15:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(779626, 84912, 4494, '<td valign="top">Oops, you aren''t supposed to have a portrait picture with the subject looking "out" of the frame.  Should have cropped so she is looking INTO the frame.</td>', 'Oops, you aren''t supposed to have a portrait picture with the subject looking "out" of the frame.  Should have cropped so she is looking INTO the frame.', '2004-06-25 15:52:18.000000', NULL, 1),
