(779632, 84895, 4494, '<td valign="top">Like the abstract rotation of this.  Fits well with this subject.  Great color on the ball and nice frame that works well with the image.  I think I would have cropped it a little tigher on the left so the light part in the lower left isn''t there.  Or you could have cloned it out.  I''d probably clone it because I like that dark area and would want to keep it, making that corner almost pure black.</td>', 'Like the abstract rotation of this.  Fits well with this subject.  Great color on the ball and nice frame that works well with the image.  I think I would have cropped it a little tigher on the left so the light part in the lower left isn''t there.  Or you could have cloned it out.  I''d probably clone it because I like that dark area and would want to keep it, making that corner almost pure black.', '2004-06-25 15:57:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(779640, 84860, 4494, '<td valign="top">I would have desaturated the green shadow a little more (but not all the way) to give even more emphasis to the cricket.  Very cool shot.</td>', 'I would have desaturated the green shadow a little more (but not all the way) to give even more emphasis to the cricket.  Very cool shot.', '2004-06-25 16:06:34.000000', NULL, 1),
