(779841, 84488, 14355, '<td valign="top">Nice try.  You have a piece of colorful kiwi fruit dead center in the middle of the picture.  Nice colors and fine focus on the fruit - the thumb is not in focus and a distractant.  The kiwi  is obviously the main subject.  Desaturating the finger does not enhance the fruit, and, there is no backgroud to desaturate.  Rather then making the piece of fruit stand out the greyscaled fingers just make it look a bit odd.  Anything, other slices of fruit, other whole fruits, anything in the background that was also desaturated would have helped.</td>', 'Nice try.  You have a piece of colorful kiwi fruit dead center in the middle of the picture.  Nice colors and fine focus on the fruit - the thumb is not in focus and a distractant.  The kiwi  is obviously the main subject.  Desaturating the finger does not enhance the fruit, and, there is no backgroud to desaturate.  Rather then making the piece of fruit stand out the greyscaled fingers just make it look a bit odd.  Anything, other slices of fruit, other whole fruits, anything in the background that was also desaturated would have helped.', '2004-06-25 19:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(779843, 84907, 22580, '<td valign="top">Looks slightly out of focus</td>', 'Looks slightly out of focus', '2004-06-25 19:13:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(779845, 84025, 14355, '<td valign="top">Deffinitly an unwise choice of picture to use in this challenge.  The doll is already the main subject and stands out like a lighthouse on fire.  All the mechanical items around it are unrecognizable as to what they are- boom box, open printer etc - so desaturating these items does not enhance the picture since the viewer can''t recognize that colors are missing.</td>', 'Deffinitly an unwise choice of picture to use in this challenge.  The doll is already the main subject and stands out like a lighthouse on fire.  All the mechanical items around it are unrecognizable as to what they are- boom box, open printer etc - so desaturating these items does not enhance the picture since the viewer can''t recognize that colors are missing.', '2004-06-25 19:16:34.000000', NULL, 1),
