(779851, 84751, 14355, '<td valign="top">Taken on a better day with more contrast in the grass and background this shot may have worked gang busters.  But the haze/fog in the background signifies tones of grey belong in the picuture ....... it nulifies allof of the shock of missing colors.</td>', 'Taken on a better day with more contrast in the grass and background this shot may have worked gang busters.  But the haze/fog in the background signifies tones of grey belong in the picuture ....... it nulifies allof of the shock of missing colors.', '2004-06-25 19:18:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(779859, 84743, 14355, '<td valign="top">I''m sure you enjoyed my original comment.  You needed to start with a good high contrast picture - the waves are a help, but, the empty sky is no help at all.  Instead you have too much negative space in the sky and waves.  To fix this - you could have cropped this picture just 10% right and left of the boat - made it into a vertical rectangle.  A little magnification wouldn''t have hurt .Then desat the sky and ocean - this would have fixed the negative space problem and made the boat really stand out.</td>', 'I''m sure you enjoyed my original comment.  You needed to start with a good high contrast picture - the waves are a help, but, the empty sky is no help at all.  Instead you have too much negative space in the sky and waves.  To fix this - you could have cropped this picture just 10% right and left of the boat - made it into a vertical rectangle.  A little magnification wouldn''t have hurt .Then desat the sky and ocean - this would have fixed the negative space problem and made the boat really stand out.', '2004-06-25 19:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(779860, 84741, 14355, '<td valign="top">Unwise choice of picture to enter in this challenge - looks like a normal picture of a building taken on a cloudy day.</td>', 'Unwise choice of picture to enter in this challenge - looks like a normal picture of a building taken on a cloudy day.', '2004-06-25 19:27:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(779864, 84569, 14355, '<td valign="top">Certainly a nice enough picture - great razor sharp focus.  However, you have a green pull top and the rest is normally a greyscalled metal.  What every you desaturated isn''t recognizable.</td>', 'Certainly a nice enough picture - great razor sharp focus.  However, you have a green pull top and the rest is normally a greyscalled metal.  What every you desaturated isn''t recognizable.', '2004-06-25 19:29:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(779867, 84650, 14355, '<td valign="top">Looks like an unfinished product.  If you had removed the red hues from the grass background and face of the dog this might have worked for you.  If you can''t see these colors on your monitor - then I sudgest calibrating it.</td>', 'Looks like an unfinished product.  If you had removed the red hues from the grass background and face of the dog this might have worked for you.  If you can''t see these colors on your monitor - then I sudgest calibrating it.', '2004-06-25 19:32:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(779868, 84886, 14355, '<td valign="top">You should have picked a picture that would normally have lots of colors in it - desaturating a white duck gives you a white duck.  It doesn''t make the subject stand out any more by just darkening the ground.</td>', 'You should have picked a picture that would normally have lots of colors in it - desaturating a white duck gives you a white duck.  It doesn''t make the subject stand out any more by just darkening the ground.', '2004-06-25 19:32:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(779871, 84932, 14355, '<td valign="top">This looks like a normal picture - what ever you desaturated is not recognizable to the viewer - looks like normal concret wall and your basic floor.  You needed to start with a high contrast picture where the missing colors would have been easily recognized as missing by the viewer, and, the result highlighted something else in the picture.  In this picture - you could have made the figure or the tree your main subject and greyscalled all the rest.</td>', 'This looks like a normal picture - what ever you desaturated is not recognizable to the viewer - looks like normal concret wall and your basic floor.  You needed to start with a high contrast picture where the missing colors would have been easily recognized as missing by the viewer, and, the result highlighted something else in the picture.  In this picture - you could have made the figure or the tree your main subject and greyscalled all the rest.', '2004-06-25 19:36:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(779873, 84577, 14355, '<td valign="top">Nowhere''s near the contrast needed to make this picture work.  Looks like a normal pic that is over exposed in a high key attempt.  Had you shown the whole face, and, it wasn''t so light, it may have worked better for you.</td>', 'Nowhere''s near the contrast needed to make this picture work.  Looks like a normal pic that is over exposed in a high key attempt.  Had you shown the whole face, and, it wasn''t so light, it may have worked better for you.', '2004-06-25 19:37:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(779874, 84489, 14355, '<td valign="top">This is not a good picture to choose for this challenge.  The guardrail, telephone pole with utility boxes and poor little tree on the left just give a fully cluttered background.  If you had taken the picture from allot more to the right to eleminate the pole it may have worked for you.</td>', 'This is not a good picture to choose for this challenge.  The guardrail, telephone pole with utility boxes and poor little tree on the left just give a fully cluttered background.  If you had taken the picture from allot more to the right to eleminate the pole it may have worked for you.', '2004-06-25 19:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(779875, 84455, 14355, '<td valign="top">Poor pictue to select for a challenge like this.  This could be any toy with a grey part - looks like any normal picture.  You should have selected something with allot of contrast in the background and colors that people would have recognized were missing.</td>', 'Poor pictue to select for a challenge like this.  This could be any toy with a grey part - looks like any normal picture.  You should have selected something with allot of contrast in the background and colors that people would have recognized were missing.', '2004-06-25 19:42:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(779878, 84647, 14355, '<td valign="top">Not a wise choice of picture to enter in this challenge.  The building appears naturally white and clearly comands to be the main subject of this picture.  The red plane cowling might appear interesting to other flyers, but, it''s too small of a plane fragment to be a good picture of a plane.  With the fragment highlighted and the main subject subdued - it''s a confusing photograph.</td>', 'Not a wise choice of picture to enter in this challenge.  The building appears naturally white and clearly comands to be the main subject of this picture.  The red plane cowling might appear interesting to other flyers, but, it''s too small of a plane fragment to be a good picture of a plane.  With the fragment highlighted and the main subject subdued - it''s a confusing photograph.', '2004-06-25 19:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(779880, 84722, 14355, '<td valign="top">This looks like a normal picture taken inside a grey tent.  To make desat work you need to have something with lots of contrast and missing colors in the background  people can identify with that are missing.</td>', 'This looks like a normal picture taken inside a grey tent.  To make desat work you need to have something with lots of contrast and missing colors in the background  people can identify with that are missing.', '2004-06-25 19:49:02.000000', NULL, 1),
