(779901, 84927, 14355, '<td valign="top">And the difference between this and a normal picture is.?  Just an  unwise  choice of picture to use for this challenge - the viewer had no idea what color is desaturated.  I can take a good guess - but - my jeep has the same color seats and carpet.</td>', 'And the difference between this and a normal picture is.?  Just an  unwise  choice of picture to use for this challenge - the viewer had no idea what color is desaturated.  I can take a good guess - but - my jeep has the same color seats and carpet.', '2004-06-25 20:01:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(779904, 84772, 14355, '<td valign="top">Looks like a normal picture.  So much equipment these days comes in this shade of grey - just and unwise choice of picture to use.</td>', 'Looks like a normal picture.  So much equipment these days comes in this shade of grey - just and unwise choice of picture to use.', '2004-06-25 20:03:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(779915, 84591, 14355, '<td valign="top">You chose two competing minor subjects to highlight - line and curve.  They compete because the line is a lighter shade of yellow from the brighter sign.  Could be natural - it should have been corrected in PS so the two items complimented each other.  Either desaturate the sign a little or increase the line''s saturation a bit and it would have helped immensely..... that, and leaving the sky intact would have added balance.  However, the road is your main subject in this picture - by  highlighting the two minors it''s only caused confusion.   The road being black is already highlighted by the colors in the original picture - desaturation only made it blend in.  This is not a good choice of picture to use in a desaturation challenge.</td>', 'You chose two competing minor subjects to highlight - line and curve.  They compete because the line is a lighter shade of yellow from the brighter sign.  Could be natural - it should have been corrected in PS so the two items complimented each other.  Either desaturate the sign a little or increase the line''s saturation a bit and it would have helped immensely..... that, and leaving the sky intact would have added balance.  However, the road is your main subject in this picture - by  highlighting the two minors it''s only caused confusion.   The road being black is already highlighted by the colors in the original picture - desaturation only made it blend in.  This is not a good choice of picture to use in a desaturation challenge.', '2004-06-25 20:14:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(779917, 84185, 14355, '<td valign="top">You didn''t greyscale the background like the challenge asked for - why not?  I would have given this a 9 or 10 easy if you had finished the last step.</td>', 'You didn''t greyscale the background like the challenge asked for - why not?  I would have given this a 9 or 10 easy if you had finished the last step.', '2004-06-25 20:14:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(779920, 84210, 14355, '<td valign="top">Looks like a normal picture of a red ball on a tar road.</td>', 'Looks like a normal picture of a red ball on a tar road.', '2004-06-25 20:15:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(779923, 84644, 14355, '<td valign="top">The picture is all washed out....... hard to tell if it''s a desat or just over exposed.  If you want desat to work you need to start with a good picture.  Not all picture will work.</td>', 'The picture is all washed out....... hard to tell if it''s a desat or just over exposed.  If you want desat to work you need to start with a good picture.  Not all picture will work.', '2004-06-25 20:17:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(779926, 84286, 14355, '<td valign="top">Looks like a sepia toned picture.  The brown border only enhances the sepia effect.</td>', 'Looks like a sepia toned picture.  The brown border only enhances the sepia effect.', '2004-06-25 20:18:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(779929, 84824, 14355, '<td valign="top">The ''loop thing'' is obviously the main subject, but, it''s cut off.  As an unidentified object it''s background becomes uncertain.  Overall, the pictuare had no reference point - macro shot of a blue spring, or, school jungle gym? - so they viewer doesn''t understand if the background is normal for this object or not.  Excellent workmanship separating the blue from the background.  It''s a controversial shot - some will love it, some will leave it...... but controversy only wins words.</td>', 'The ''loop thing'' is obviously the main subject, but, it''s cut off.  As an unidentified object it''s background becomes uncertain.  Overall, the pictuare had no reference point - macro shot of a blue spring, or, school jungle gym? - so they viewer doesn''t understand if the background is normal for this object or not.  Excellent workmanship separating the blue from the background.  It''s a controversial shot - some will love it, some will leave it...... but controversy only wins words.', '2004-06-25 20:24:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(779931, 84654, 14355, '<td valign="top">The picture seems too overexposed for the desaturated background to enhance the birds presense in the picture.  Had the leaf been desaturated it would have helped allot.</td>', 'The picture seems too overexposed for the desaturated background to enhance the birds presense in the picture.  Had the leaf been desaturated it would have helped allot.', '2004-06-25 20:26:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(779936, 84769, 14355, '<td valign="top">I love this one. It''s a great composition, very imaginative, and well execuited. Rated 9.</td>', 'I love this one. It''s a great composition, very imaginative, and well execuited. Rated 9.', '2004-06-25 20:29:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(779939, 84717, 14355, '<td valign="top">City folks might not get this one.  I would have either centered the crop so the radiator wasn''t off to the left or just removed it and done a tight crop on the name.  Either case - the rest of the tractor has a funny off purple hue that really needed to be greyscaled.</td>', 'City folks might not get this one.  I would have either centered the crop so the radiator wasn''t off to the left or just removed it and done a tight crop on the name.  Either case - the rest of the tractor has a funny off purple hue that really needed to be greyscaled.', '2004-06-25 20:32:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(779945, 84176, 14355, '<td valign="top">Somehow the colors just don''t appear natural looking..... as if something is reflecting onto the bird.  It deffinitly stands out.</td>', 'Somehow the colors just don''t appear natural looking..... as if something is reflecting onto the bird.  It deffinitly stands out.', '2004-06-25 20:38:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(779960, 84637, 21714, '<td valign="top">Cool stuff. Nicely done.</td>', 'Cool stuff. Nicely done.', '2004-06-25 20:51:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(779961, 84840, 21714, '<td valign="top">It''s different and it''s cool.</td>', 'It''s different and it''s cool.', '2004-06-25 20:52:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(779967, 84488, 21714, '<td valign="top">Good Job except for the halo. I only noticed it because it''s around the thumb too.</td>', 'Good Job except for the halo. I only noticed it because it''s around the thumb too.', '2004-06-25 20:56:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(779969, 84768, 21714, '<td valign="top">It''s not a very clean desaturation job and there are traces of red on the skin too.</td>', 'It''s not a very clean desaturation job and there are traces of red on the skin too.', '2004-06-25 20:58:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(779980, 84548, 21714, '<td valign="top">Neat and crisp. Well done.</td>', 'Neat and crisp. Well done.', '2004-06-25 21:12:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(780008, 84842, 1344, '<td valign="top">Isn''t something that''s completely black and white already pretty much desaturated?</td>', 'Isn''t something that''s completely black and white already pretty much desaturated?', '2004-06-25 21:55:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(780009, 84327, 1344, '<td valign="top">great idea, but the skin is way over-photoshopped</td>', 'great idea, but the skin is way over-photoshopped', '2004-06-25 21:58:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(780010, 84780, 1344, '<td valign="top">nice....  if the face was a bit sharper, it''d get a 10.....  9!  good work</td>', 'nice....  if the face was a bit sharper, it''d get a 10.....  9!  good work', '2004-06-25 22:00:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(780067, 84488, 6597, '<td valign="top">meets the challenge Don''t get too excited over a kiwi but stands out real good 6</td>', 'meets the challenge Don''t get too excited over a kiwi but stands out real good 6', '2004-06-25 23:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(780068, 84583, 6597, '<td valign="top">good job my attention goes right to the rose 7</td>', 'good job my attention goes right to the rose 7', '2004-06-25 23:29:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(780083, 84779, 14355, '<td valign="top">Desaturating a white bird against a white brackground gives you a ......... white  bird on a white background.  That little dab of faded yellow around the eyes isn''t ''standing out''.</td>', 'Desaturating a white bird against a white brackground gives you a ......... white  bird on a white background.  That little dab of faded yellow around the eyes isn''t ''standing out''.', '2004-06-25 23:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(780135, 84745, 14355, '<td valign="top">This is an awesome photograph you had to start with.  Wonderfully sharp and crips, great detail and focus.  Perfect.  Leaving the sky blue balanced it out very well - nice call there.  Supurb workmanship separating the horse and rider from the background.  I had wondered about just the horse or the rider colored, but, they are a set and look great together.  This is going to look nice matted and framed.  Great job.</td>', 'This is an awesome photograph you had to start with.  Wonderfully sharp and crips, great detail and focus.  Perfect.  Leaving the sky blue balanced it out very well - nice call there.  Supurb workmanship separating the horse and rider from the background.  I had wondered about just the horse or the rider colored, but, they are a set and look great together.  This is going to look nice matted and framed.  Great job.', '2004-06-26 00:42:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(780140, 84634, 14355, '<td valign="top">Not a wise picture choice for this challenge - the little details don''t jump out - a closer crop may have helped....... but you''d loose the people on the end.    Overall - a damn good effort - you have wonderful workmanship skills for detail.</td>', 'Not a wise picture choice for this challenge - the little details don''t jump out - a closer crop may have helped....... but you''d loose the people on the end.    Overall - a damn good effort - you have wonderful workmanship skills for detail.', '2004-06-26 00:46:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(780143, 84930, 259, '<td valign="top">nice lighting</td>', 'nice lighting', '2004-06-26 00:47:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(780146, 84485, 14355, '<td valign="top">Excellent picture to select for this challenge!  Awesome workmanship skill separating the kids from the watermellon.  Colors in the watermellon are astounding.  Very well done.</td>', 'Excellent picture to select for this challenge!  Awesome workmanship skill separating the kids from the watermellon.  Colors in the watermellon are astounding.  Very well done.', '2004-06-26 00:48:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(780155, 84057, 14355, '<td valign="top">I came back to this one after calibrating my monitor.  Its a very nice picture that looks more like classical art work or a nice drawing.  Wonderful hue of blue too.  An understated picture.  Great workmanship.</td>', 'I came back to this one after calibrating my monitor.  Its a very nice picture that looks more like classical art work or a nice drawing.  Wonderful hue of blue too.  An understated picture.  Great workmanship.', '2004-06-26 00:52:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(780163, 84296, 14355, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept using the outter part as a frame.  It does detract from the yellow brick in the center, but, adds an overall balance to the shot.  Pretty neat ''out of the box'' idea - and the only one in this challenge like it - you are original.  (ummmm you did give the blocks back to the kids, right?)</td>', 'Interesting concept using the outter part as a frame.  It does detract from the yellow brick in the center, but, adds an overall balance to the shot.  Pretty neat ''out of the box'' idea - and the only one in this challenge like it - you are original.  (ummmm you did give the blocks back to the kids, right?)', '2004-06-26 00:56:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(780165, 84852, 14355, '<td valign="top">Great group of plants to work with and it has plenty of contrast.  The lead flower being out of focus is a distraction.</td>', 'Great group of plants to work with and it has plenty of contrast.  The lead flower being out of focus is a distraction.', '2004-06-26 00:58:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(780166, 83917, 14355, '<td valign="top">You have a picture of a train ........... you desaturated what little background is showing, and, left the train whole to accent the whole train.  It doesn''t really stand out as a desatured picture until one''s eyes wanders arounds and picks up on the mssing blue in the sky.  Might have looked better with just the window reflection in color?</td>', 'You have a picture of a train ........... you desaturated what little background is showing, and, left the train whole to accent the whole train.  It doesn''t really stand out as a desatured picture until one''s eyes wanders arounds and picks up on the mssing blue in the sky.  Might have looked better with just the window reflection in color?', '2004-06-26 01:00:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(780175, 84914, 22459, '<td valign="top">Simply superb well executed shot with great color to bring it to life, Top three for sure.</td>', 'Simply superb well executed shot with great color to bring it to life, Top three for sure.', '2004-06-26 01:11:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(780180, 84840, 22459, '<td valign="top">nice image just required a little more color to bring it to life.</td>', 'nice image just required a little more color to bring it to life.', '2004-06-26 01:13:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(780181, 84542, 22459, '<td valign="top">Great shot maybe the subject is a little to central but still a real eye grabber.</td>', 'Great shot maybe the subject is a little to central but still a real eye grabber.', '2004-06-26 01:15:10.000000', NULL, 1),
