(780972, 84485, 19608, '<td valign="top">This image has everything (almost) going foir it!  Great subjects, perfect desaturization,  and it does indeed say "Summer at the Farm" in a Norman Rockwell style.<br/> <br/>Having said all that - why in the heck didn''t you move the guys away from that fence?  The background should not draw attention from the subject - but this one does.  (That''s my only complaint and it includes the object behind the shoulder / neck boy on the right.)<br/> <br/> <br/>Ribbonsville is just ahead.  Your train stops there.<br/> <br/> <br/></td>', 'This image has everything (almost) going foir it!  Great subjects, perfect desaturization,  and it does indeed say "Summer at the Farm" in a Norman Rockwell style. Having said all that - why in the heck didn''t you move the guys away from that fence?  The background should not draw attention from the subject - but this one does.  (That''s my only complaint and it includes the object behind the shoulder / neck boy on the right.)  Ribbonsville is just ahead.  Your train stops there.  ', '2004-06-27 00:10:18.000000', NULL, 1),
