(782068, 84556, 8816, '<td valign="top">Very cool picture.  An unusual use of selective desat, a way I would never thought to use.  Love the juxtaposition of colored water and gray sky, really draws attention to the ships, which lie just in the center.  Very creative and original, well done!<br/> <br/>Lee</td>', 'Very cool picture.  An unusual use of selective desat, a way I would never thought to use.  Love the juxtaposition of colored water and gray sky, really draws attention to the ships, which lie just in the center.  Very creative and original, well done! Lee', '2004-06-28 01:58:29.000000', NULL, 0),
