(782178, 84026, 6804, '<td valign="top">I cannot believe work like this can go so un-noticed by so many voters. I understand art is subjective, but it seems so many of the voters only see the technical aspects in photography. This is a modern style with the exposure so exaggerated it is clearly intentional. I really hoped this one would do better in the challenge.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-06-28 02:26:03.</i></td>', 'I cannot believe work like this can go so un-noticed by so many voters. I understand art is subjective, but it seems so many of the voters only see the technical aspects in photography. This is a modern style with the exposure so exaggerated it is clearly intentional. I really hoped this one would do better in the challenge.', '2004-06-28 02:53:33.000000', '2004-06-28 03:26:03.000000', 0),
