(784553, 84550, 5534, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by laurielblack:</b></div><hr/><i> I was quite surprised to find this one at 91st instead of in the top ten...it''s a great shot.  I get my little mannequin this week and I''m so excited about it!  You did such a great job with this one.  Don''t be discouraged at all!!!!  :o) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>These little mannequins are great learning tools, the tough part is trying to use them in an original way....which is something I still need to do.<br/> <br/>Glad you like the photo, although I was a bit dissapointed with my placing I figure if a few people like it then the placement doesn''t matter.<br/> <br/>Thanks for taking the time to comment on my entry everyone.</td>', 'Originally posted by laurielblack: I was quite surprised to find this one at 91st instead of in the top ten...it''s a great shot.  I get my little mannequin this week and I''m so excited about it!  You did such a great job with this one.  Don''t be discouraged at all!!!!  :o)   These little mannequins are great learning tools, the tough part is trying to use them in an original way....which is something I still need to do. Glad you like the photo, although I was a bit dissapointed with my placing I figure if a few people like it then the placement doesn''t matter. Thanks for taking the time to comment on my entry everyone.', '2004-06-29 08:47:05.000000', NULL, 0),
