(784591, 84893, 11815, '<td valign="top">Okay, I didn''t see this one while I was voting. This is the second time I see this happen. Not to complain about the winner b/c she did a good job. But honestly the photo was a bit cheesy. I guess that''s what the people on this site like, b/c time after time the cheesiest most cliche image wins. <br/> <br/>Your photo is PERFECT, I think i have only given out one 10 so far. I give you a 10 gladly. The movement, the expression, the compostion, the DOF, all on point.  You colored the shirt which was a perfect choice. It draws attention to the exact point of interest and compliments the image perfectly. you did a wonderful job, really. In my mind your photo took the blue ribbon. I give up on this site and the consistent voting for cheesy and cliche images.  Congrats.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-06-29 09:11:01.</i></td>', 'Okay, I didn''t see this one while I was voting. This is the second time I see this happen. Not to complain about the winner b/c she did a good job. But honestly the photo was a bit cheesy. I guess that''s what the people on this site like, b/c time after time the cheesiest most cliche image wins.  Your photo is PERFECT, I think i have only given out one 10 so far. I give you a 10 gladly. The movement, the expression, the compostion, the DOF, all on point.  You colored the shirt which was a perfect choice. It draws attention to the exact point of interest and compliments the image perfectly. you did a wonderful job, really. In my mind your photo took the blue ribbon. I give up on this site and the consistent voting for cheesy and cliche images.  Congrats.', '2004-06-29 10:10:00.000000', '2004-06-29 10:11:01.000000', 0),
