(785122, 84770, 12611, '<td valign="top">another great city shot. I really like teh quality of your work because you seem to "see"- or perhaps "create" an interesting shot out of the busy, cluttered or more "normal" or "banal" city topics. Of course here you have the everyday person walking around amidst a truly dramatic sky and fantastic vertical lines leading to the dome.<br/>keep up the good work.</td>', 'another great city shot. I really like teh quality of your work because you seem to "see"- or perhaps "create" an interesting shot out of the busy, cluttered or more "normal" or "banal" city topics. Of course here you have the everyday person walking around amidst a truly dramatic sky and fantastic vertical lines leading to the dome.keep up the good work.', '2004-06-29 16:29:47.000000', NULL, 0),
