(795017, 84569, 8522, '<td valign="top">Critique Club:<br/> <br/>A very competent shot, nicely exposed. The centred composition works very well. A good candidate for selective desaturation, and it has been carried out well. Border complements the photo well. I like the diagonal composition, and black and white really complements the texture of the can.<br/>However, your choice of subject doesn''t really hit me with a ''wow''... rather a solid, well taken photo that makes me respect the technique used.</td>', 'Critique Club: A very competent shot, nicely exposed. The centred composition works very well. A good candidate for selective desaturation, and it has been carried out well. Border complements the photo well. I like the diagonal composition, and black and white really complements the texture of the can.However, your choice of subject doesn''t really hit me with a ''wow''... rather a solid, well taken photo that makes me respect the technique used.', '2004-07-04 14:15:05.000000', NULL, 0),
