(926266, 84327, 19035, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Unicorn_Fighter03:</b></div><hr/><i> Ý DONT THÝNK ÝTS NOT REAL PÝC.. SOMEBODY CAN DO THAT WÝTH 3D MAKÝN PROGRAMS... Ý DONT THÝNK ÝTS REAL PÝC.. BUT NÝCE EYES... YEA.. LOOKÝN LÝKE PLASTÝC AND 3D MODEL.. BUT NÝCE EYES AGAÝN.. GOOD JOB..!ANSWER ME ÝF YA WANNA TALK ABOUT THAT </i></td></tr></table><i></i> <br/> <br/>These really were my daughters eyes, I post processed them quite a bit, but that was the look I was going for.  Not much was done to her actual eyes but her skin was smoothed out considerably.  Here is the orginal photo as proof....<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=107706" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/19035/thumb/107706.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/19035/thumb/107706.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/19035/thumb/107706.jpg"/></a><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-09-25 23:21:23.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by Unicorn_Fighter03: Ý DONT THÝNK ÝTS NOT REAL PÝC.. SOMEBODY CAN DO THAT WÝTH 3D MAKÝN PROGRAMS... Ý DONT THÝNK ÝTS REAL PÝC.. BUT NÝCE EYES... YEA.. LOOKÝN LÝKE PLASTÝC AND 3D MODEL.. BUT NÝCE EYES AGAÝN.. GOOD JOB..!ANSWER ME ÝF YA WANNA TALK ABOUT THAT   These really were my daughters eyes, I post processed them quite a bit, but that was the look I was going for.  Not much was done to her actual eyes but her skin was smoothed out considerably.  Here is the orginal photo as proof.... ', '2004-09-25 23:55:45.000000', '2004-09-26 00:21:23.000000', 0),
